window.DCH_GUIDE_I18N=window.DCH_GUIDE_I18N||{};window.DCH_GUIDE_I18N["zh-CN"]={"Back to home":"返回首页","Site information":"网站信息","Invalid input":"输入无效","Enter valid values.":"请输入有效数值。","Check the vehicle price, down payment and fees.":"请检查车辆价格、首付款和费用。","Enter a valid first day of the last period.":"请输入有效的末次月经第一天。","40 weeks":"40 周","Save calculator":"收藏此计算器","Saved ✓":"已收藏 ✓","Quick summary: Estimate payoff time and interest using the debt avalanche method, which targets the highest APR first.":"快速摘要：使用债务雪崩还款法估算还清时间和利息，该方法优先偿还年利率最高的债务。","This page models the debt avalanche method for up to three debts.":"本页面为最多三笔债务模拟债务雪崩还款法。","Each debt receives its entered minimum payment, and all of the remaining monthly budget goes to the debt with the highest APR, whatever its balance.":"每笔债务先支付您输入的最低还款额，每月剩余的全部预算都用于年利率最高的债务，无论其余额大小。","When that debt is paid off, its payment rolls into the next highest rate.":"该笔债务还清后，它的还款额会转入利率次高的债务。","The order is chosen to limit interest charges.":"选择这种顺序是为了减少利息支出。","The page shows the payoff time and total interest this order produces for your numbers.":"页面会显示这种顺序在您的数字下产生的还清时间和总利息。","Under the result the page also shows a table that runs both orders on your debts, so you do not need to open the snowball page to compare.":"结果下方还有一张表，会对您的债务同时运行两种顺序，因此无需打开雪球还款法页面来比较。","Below it, a year-by-year table follows the avalanche plan, and a short list gives the month each debt reaches zero.":"再往下是按年展示雪崩还款法计划的表格，以及列出每笔债务还清月份的简短清单。","Whatever is left of the fixed budget goes to the open debt with the highest APR.":"固定预算中剩余的部分用于年利率最高的未结清债务。","When that balance reaches zero the freed money moves to the debt with the next highest rate.":"当该余额降到零时，释放出的资金会转到利率次高的债务。","In this calculator the avalanche order targets the 9,000 debt at 22% first and the result is 40 months, $5,146.08 of total interest and $21,146.08 in total payments.":"在本计算器中，雪崩还款法顺序优先偿还 22% 的 9,000 那笔债务，结果为 40 个月、总利息 $5,146.08、总还款额 $21,146.08。","The debt snowball calculator on the same numbers gives 43 months and $6,435.86 of interest, because it targets the 2,000 debt first.":"用同样的数字，债务雪球还款法计算器得出 43 个月和 $6,435.86 的利息，因为它优先偿还 2,000 的那笔债务。","Avalanche ignores balance size, so the first debt can take a long time to clear if it is large.":"雪崩还款法不考虑余额大小，因此如果第一笔债务金额较大，可能需要很长时间才能还清。","In the example above the first target is the 9,000 balance, yet the whole plan finishes 3 months sooner and costs $1,289.78 less interest than snowball.":"在上面的例子中，第一个目标是 9,000 的余额，但整个计划比雪球还款法提前 3 个月完成，利息少 $1,289.78。","When the smallest balance also has the highest rate, as in the default inputs, both methods give the same result (33 months, $3,405.43 interest).":"当最小余额同时也是利率最高的债务时（如默认输入），两种方法结果相同（33 个月，利息 $3,405.43）。","It does not handle balance-transfer offers, promotional rates that expire, or cards whose APR depends on how you pay.":"它不处理余额转移优惠、会到期的促销利率，或年利率取决于您还款方式的信用卡。","A rate-first order saves interest in this model but may leave you waiting a long time before the first account closes.":"在此模型中，优先偿还高利率债务可以节省利息，但第一个账户可能要等很久才能结清。","Use the result to weigh that trade-off for your own balances.":"请用结果来权衡这种取舍对您自己余额的影响。","Which debt does the avalanche method pay first?":"债务雪崩还款法最先偿还哪笔债务？","The one with the highest APR, regardless of its balance.":"年利率最高的那笔，无论其余额是多少。","Will avalanche save me interest compared with snowball?":"与雪球还款法相比，雪崩还款法能为我节省利息吗？","Look at the comparison table above for your own debts.":"请查看上方针对您自己债务的比较表。","Avalanche is built to put extra money on the highest rate first, which is why it often charges less interest, but the table shows the actual result for your numbers.":"雪崩还款法的设计是先把额外资金用于利率最高的债务，因此利息往往更少，但表格显示的才是您的数字下的实际结果。","With the default numbers both orders give 33 months and $3,405.43, because the smallest balance is also the highest rate.":"使用默认数字时，两种顺序都是 33 个月和 $3,405.43，因为最小余额同时也是利率最高的债务。","Compared with paying only the entered minimums in avalanche order (50 months, $6,197.99 interest), the extra $250.00 a month (freed minimums still roll over in both runs) saves $2,792.56 of interest and 17 months.":"与按雪崩还款法顺序只支付所输入的最低还款额相比（50 个月，利息 $6,197.99），每月额外还 $250.00（两种情形中释放出的最低还款额都会转入下一笔债务）可节省 $2,792.56 的利息和 17 个月。","Avalanche plan, year by year":"雪崩还款法计划，按年明细","Avalanche plan year by year":"雪崩还款法计划按年明细","Quick summary: Estimate bankruptcy attorney, filing, counseling, trustee-related and other case costs for budgeting purposes.":"快速摘要：为预算目的估算破产案件的律师费、立案费、咨询费、受托人相关费用及其他案件费用。","Estimate bankruptcy attorney, filing, counseling, trustee-related and other case costs for budgeting purposes.":"为预算目的估算破产案件的律师费、立案费、咨询费、受托人相关费用及其他案件费用。","Inputs and units":"输入项与单位","Required fields cannot be blank.":"必填项不能为空。","Estimated attorney hours:":"预计律师工时：","the hours the attorney expects the case to take.":"律师预计办理此案所需的小时数。","Attorney hourly rate ($):":"律师小时费率（$）：","the hourly rate for the attorney's time.":"律师每小时工作时间的收费标准。","Flat, package or minimum legal fee ($):":"固定、套餐或最低律师费（$）：","the flat, package or minimum fee for the case.":"此案的固定、套餐或最低费用。","Court, filing and government fees ($):":"法院、立案和政府规费（$）：","filing and government charges for the case.":"此案的立案和政府收费。","Expert, translation or professional fees ($):":"专家、翻译或专业人员费用（$）：","outside professional fees the case needs.":"此案所需的外部专业人员费用。","Other case-related costs ($):":"其他案件相关费用（$）：","any other costs tied to the case.":"与此案相关的任何其他费用。","Method and assumptions":"方法与假设","The calculator multiplies the hours by the rate for the hourly basis, takes the larger of that and the flat or minimum fee as the legal fee, adds the court, expert and other costs as external fees, and reports the total plus how far it runs above the flat figure.":"计算器将小时数乘以费率得到按小时计费的基数，取该金额与固定或最低费用中较大者作为律师费，再把法院、专家和其他费用作为外部费用相加，并报告总额以及超出固定金额的部分。","With the illustrative starting inputs: the hourly basis is 16 times 300, which is $4,800.00, above the 2,200 flat fee, so the legal line is $4,800.00.":"按示例起始数据：小时基数为 16 乘以 300，即 $4,800.00，高于 2,200 的固定费用，因此律师费一项为 $4,800.00。","The external fees are 340 plus 250 plus 200, which is $790.00, the total is $5,590.00, and the amount above the flat fee is $3,390.00.":"外部费用为 340 加 250 加 200，即 $790.00，总额为 $5,590.00，超出固定费用的部分为 $3,390.00。","Estimated attorney hours":"预计律师工时","Attorney hourly rate ($)":"律师小时费率（$）","Flat, package or minimum legal fee ($)":"固定、套餐或最低律师费（$）","Court, filing and government fees ($)":"法院、立案和政府规费（$）","Expert, translation or professional fees ($)":"专家、翻译或专业人员费用（$）","Other case-related costs ($)":"其他案件相关费用（$）","Estimated total legal-service cost":"估算的法律服务总费用","Estimated hourly legal work":"估算的按小时法律工作费用","Professional and filing costs":"专业人员和立案费用","Estimated legal fee before external costs":"外部费用之前的估算律师费","Estimated cost above the flat or minimum fee":"超出固定或最低费用的估算成本","The case total is the headline: $5,590.00 on the starting inputs.":"案件总额是核心数字：按起始数据为 $5,590.00。","The hourly basis ($4,800.00) exceeds the 2,200 flat fee, so the hourly figure governs the legal line; the model never adds the two bases together.":"小时基数（$4,800.00）超过 2,200 的固定费用，因此律师费一项由小时金额决定；模型绝不会把两种基数相加。","The above-flat line ($3,390.00) shows how far the total runs past the flat floor once external fees are included.":"高于固定费用的一行（$3,390.00）显示加入外部费用后，总额超出固定下限多少。","Reading the flat field as a fee added on top of the hours; the model takes the larger of the two bases as the legal fee.":"把固定费用一栏理解为在工时费之上另加的费用；模型取两种基数中较大者作为律师费。","Entering a retainer in the flat field as well as the expected hours; the model compares the bases, it does not bill both.":"既在固定费用一栏填入预付金，又填入预计工时；模型是比较两种基数，不会两者都收取。","Leaving filing fees out of the external fields; the model only adds what you enter.":"没有把立案费填入外部费用栏；模型只会加上您输入的内容。","Reading the total as the fee you will pay; engagement letters differ, so confirm the basis, hourly or flat, in your own agreement.":"把总额当成您要支付的费用；委托协议各不相同，请在自己的协议中确认计费方式是按小时还是固定。","Reading the fee breakdown for a bankruptcy matter":"如何阅读破产案件的费用明细","With the starting figures, 16 hours at $300.00 is $4,800.00 of hourly work, which is above the $2,200.00 flat fee, so the hourly work sets the legal fee.":"按起始数据，16 小时、每小时 $300.00，按小时工作为 $4,800.00，高于 $2,200.00 的固定费用，因此律师费由按小时工作决定。","Adding $340.00 of court fees, $250.00 of professional fees and $200.00 of other costs gives $5,590.00.":"加上法院费用 $340.00、专业人员费用 $250.00 和其他费用 $200.00，得到 $5,590.00。","The break-even is 7.33 hours: below it this model keeps the flat fee, above it every hour counts.":"盈亏平衡点为 7.33 小时：低于此值，本模型采用固定费用；高于此值，每一小时都会计入。","Because the hourly work is already above the flat floor, changing the hours moves the total directly: 25% fewer or more hours changes it by $1,200.00, and a 10% change in the rate by $480.00.":"由于按小时工作已经超过固定下限，改变小时数会直接改变总额：小时数增减 25% 会使总额变动 $1,200.00，费率变动 10% 则变动 $480.00。","The flat-fee-only row shows $2,990.00.":"仅固定费用一行显示 $2,990.00。","If your engagement is a true fixed price with hours not billed on top, enter that price as the flat fee and 0 hours.":"如果您的委托是真正的固定价格，且不另按小时计费，请把该价格填为固定费用，小时数填 0。","What if the hours come in below the flat fee?":"如果实际工时低于固定费用所覆盖的水平会怎样？","The flat or minimum governs.":"以固定或最低费用为准。","At 5 hours the hourly basis would be $1,500.00, so the legal line would read the 2,200 figure and the total would be $2,990.00.":"工时为 5 小时时，小时基数为 $1,500.00，因此律师费一项取 2,200 这一金额，总额为 $2,990.00。","Are filing fees part of the attorney fee?":"立案费属于律师费的一部分吗？","Not in this model.":"在本模型中不属于。","They sit in the external line, $790.00 on the starting inputs with expert and other costs.":"它们在外部费用一项中，按起始数据与专家及其他费用合计为 $790.00。","Is this a quote?":"这是报价吗？","No. It is planning arithmetic from the figures you enter; the actual fee comes from your attorney's own agreement.":"不是。这只是基于您输入数字的规划计算；实际费用以您律师自己的协议为准。","Legal fees vary widely by state, attorney, complexity, urgency, hearings, negotiations, appeals and outcome.":"律师费会因州、律师、案件复杂程度、紧急程度、庭审、谈判、上诉和结果而有很大差异。","This is a budgeting estimate, not a fee quote or legal advice.":"这是用于预算的估算，不是律师费报价，也不是法律建议。","How a flat or minimum fee is handled":"如何处理固定或最低费用","The legal fee is max(estimated hours × hourly rate, entered flat/minimum fee).":"律师费 = max(预计小时数 × 小时费率, 所输入的固定/最低费用)。","External charges are then added.":"然后加上外部费用。","This is a minimum-fee model, not a selector between two independent quotes: entering both a complete hourly quote and a separate alternative fixed quote will intentionally use the larger amount.":"这是最低费用模型，而不是在两个独立报价之间做选择：同时输入完整的按小时报价和另一个固定报价，会有意采用较大的金额。","For 10 hours at $200 with a $1,500 minimum and $300 of external charges, the total is $2,300.":"10 小时、每小时 $200、最低费用 $1,500、外部费用 $300，总额为 $2,300。","If the minimum rises to $2,500 with the same work, the total becomes $2,800.":"如果最低费用升到 $2,500，工作量不变，总额变为 $2,800。","A retainer credited against billed work should not also be entered as a new external expense.":"已抵扣已计费工作的预付金，不应再作为新的外部支出重复输入。","Confirm which filing, counseling, trustee-related or hearing costs the engagement includes.":"请确认委托中包含哪些立案、咨询、受托人相关或庭审费用。","A payment arrangement for legal fees does not change the total fee, and this form does not determine filing eligibility or the appropriate case procedure.":"律师费的分期付款安排不会改变总费用，本表单也不判定是否有资格申请或适用何种案件程序。","Quick summary: Estimate a divorce legal budget from attorney time, hourly rates, filing, mediation, expert and other case costs.":"快速摘要：根据律师工时、小时费率、立案、调解、专家及其他案件费用估算离婚法律预算。","Estimate a divorce legal budget from attorney time, hourly rates, filing, mediation, expert and other case costs.":"根据律师工时、小时费率、立案、调解、专家及其他案件费用估算离婚法律预算。","outside professional fees the case needs, such as valuation or forensic work.":"此案所需的外部专业人员费用，例如估值或司法鉴定工作。","With the illustrative starting inputs: the hourly basis is 35 times 350, which is $12,250.00, above the 5,000 flat fee, so the legal line is $12,250.00.":"按示例起始数据：小时基数为 35 乘以 350，即 $12,250.00，高于 5,000 的固定费用，因此律师费一项为 $12,250.00。","The external fees are 450 plus 1,800 plus 650, which is $2,900.00, the total is $15,150.00, and the amount above the flat fee is $10,150.00.":"外部费用为 450 加 1,800 加 650，即 $2,900.00，总额为 $15,150.00，超出固定费用的部分为 $10,150.00。","The case total is the headline: $15,150.00 on the starting inputs.":"案件总额是核心数字：按起始数据为 $15,150.00。","The hourly basis ($12,250.00) exceeds the 5,000 flat fee, so the hourly figure governs the legal line; the model never adds the two bases together.":"小时基数（$12,250.00）超过 5,000 的固定费用，因此律师费一项由小时金额决定；模型绝不会把两种基数相加。","Expert and professional fees ($1,800 of the $2,900.00 external line) are the largest external piece here, and they sit outside the attorney's own fee.":"专家和专业人员费用（外部费用 $2,900.00 中的 $1,800）是这里最大的外部部分，且不包含在律师自己的费用之内。","Assuming expert fees are inside the attorney's rate; the model prices them as a separate external line.":"以为专家费用已包含在律师费率内；模型把它们作为单独的外部费用项计价。","Reading the fee breakdown for a divorce matter":"如何阅读离婚案件的费用明细","The starting scenario has 35 hours at $350.00, or $12,250.00, against a $5,000.00 flat fee, so hourly work is 80.9% of the $15,150.00 total.":"起始情景为 35 小时、每小时 $350.00，即 $12,250.00，对比 $5,000.00 的固定费用，因此按小时工作占 $15,150.00 总额的 80.9%。","The flat floor would only matter below 14.29 hours.":"固定下限只有在低于 14.29 小时时才起作用。","Specialist fees of $1,800.00 are the largest of the non-legal lines.":"专家费用 $1,800.00 是非律师费项目中最大的一项。","In the what-if table, 25% more or fewer hours moves the total by $3,062.50 and a 10% rate change by $1,225.00.":"在假设对比表中，小时数增减 25% 会使总额变动 $3,062.50，费率变动 10% 则变动 $1,225.00。","With no hourly work the page returns $7,900.00, the flat fee plus the entered court, specialist and other costs.":"没有按小时工作时，本页返回 $7,900.00，即固定费用加上所输入的法院、专家及其他费用。","Hours are the number to pressure-test on this page, since they set most of the result.":"在本页中，小时数是最值得压力测试的数字，因为它决定了大部分结果。","At 10 hours the hourly basis would be $3,500.00, so the legal line would read the 5,000 figure and the total would be $7,900.00.":"工时为 10 小时时，小时基数为 $3,500.00，因此律师费一项取 5,000 这一金额，总额为 $7,900.00。","What does the external line cover?":"外部费用一项包括什么？","Court, filing and government fees plus expert and other case costs: $2,900.00 on the starting inputs.":"法院、立案和政府规费，加上专家及其他案件费用：按起始数据为 $2,900.00。","Separate the attorney’s work from mediation, valuation, expert and court charges.":"把律师的工作与调解、估值、专家和法院收费分开。","A contested hearing or an appeal may be outside a quoted package; the calculator cannot infer those additional hours from the value of the assets in dispute.":"有争议的庭审或上诉可能不在已报价的套餐之内；计算器无法根据争议资产的价值推断这些额外工时。","Quick summary: Estimate a DUI-defense legal budget from attorney time, flat fees, court costs, experts and other case expenses.":"快速摘要：根据律师工时、固定费用、法院费用、专家及其他案件开支估算酒驾（DUI）辩护法律预算。","Estimate a DUI-defense legal budget from attorney time, flat fees, court costs, experts and other case expenses.":"根据律师工时、固定费用、法院费用、专家及其他案件开支估算酒驾（DUI）辩护法律预算。","outside professional fees the case needs, such as expert witnesses.":"此案所需的外部专业人员费用，例如专家证人。","With the illustrative starting inputs: the hourly basis is 30 times 400, which is $12,000.00, above the 6,500 flat fee, so the legal line is $12,000.00.":"按示例起始数据：小时基数为 30 乘以 400，即 $12,000.00，高于 6,500 的固定费用，因此律师费一项为 $12,000.00。","The external fees are 850 plus 1,600 plus 900, which is $3,350.00, the total is $15,350.00, and the amount above the flat fee is $8,850.00.":"外部费用为 850 加 1,600 加 900，即 $3,350.00，总额为 $15,350.00，超出固定费用的部分为 $8,850.00。","The case total is the headline: $15,350.00 on the starting inputs.":"案件总额是核心数字：按起始数据为 $15,350.00。","The hourly basis ($12,000.00) exceeds the 6,500 flat fee, so the hourly figure governs the legal line; the model never adds the two bases together.":"小时基数（$12,000.00）超过 6,500 的固定费用，因此律师费一项由小时金额决定；模型绝不会把两种基数相加。","The above-flat line ($8,850.00) shows how far the total runs past the flat floor once external fees are included.":"高于固定费用的一行（$8,850.00）显示加入外部费用后，总额超出固定下限多少。","Folding court-ordered fines into the case costs by default; the external fields are case costs you choose to enter, so decide deliberately what belongs there.":"默认把法院判处的罚款计入案件费用；外部费用栏是由您自行决定填写的案件费用，所以请慎重决定哪些内容应填在这里。","Reading the fee breakdown for a DUI defense matter":"如何阅读酒驾（DUI）辩护案件的费用明细","Thirty hours at $400.00 is $12,000.00, above the $6,500.00 flat fee, so hourly work drives 78.2% of the $15,350.00 total.":"30 小时、每小时 $400.00 即 $12,000.00，高于 $6,500.00 的固定费用，因此按小时工作占 $15,350.00 总额的 78.2%。","The flat fee becomes the governing figure only below 16.25 hours.":"只有低于 16.25 小时，固定费用才会成为起决定作用的金额。","Court and filing fees of $850.00, professional fees of $1,600.00 and other costs of $900.00 make up the rest.":"法院和立案费用 $850.00、专业人员费用 $1,600.00 以及其他费用 $900.00 构成其余部分。","A 25% change in hours moves the total by $3,000.00 and a 10% change in the rate by $1,200.00.":"小时数变动 25% 会使总额变动 $3,000.00，费率变动 10% 则变动 $1,200.00。","With the hourly work removed, the total is $9,850.00.":"去掉按小时工作后，总额为 $9,850.00。","Enter only the costs you expect to pay on top of the legal fee, and keep any fees already inside a package price out of the court and other cost fields so they are not counted twice.":"只输入您预计在律师费之外要支付的费用，并且不要把已包含在套餐价格内的费用再填入法院费用和其他费用栏，以免重复计算。","At 10 hours the hourly basis would be $4,000.00, so the legal line would read the 6,500 figure and the total would be $9,850.00.":"工时为 10 小时时，小时基数为 $4,000.00，因此律师费一项取 6,500 这一金额，总额为 $9,850.00。","Are fines part of this estimate?":"罚款包含在这个估算中吗？","Not unless you enter an amount in the other-costs field.":"不包含，除非您在其他费用栏里输入金额。","The model prices the fees and case costs you enter; any court-ordered amounts are separate.":"模型只对您输入的费用和案件成本计价；法院判令的任何金额都是另外的。","Identify whether the engagement covers only advice and negotiation or also hearings, trial and administrative-license proceedings.":"确认委托只涵盖咨询和谈判，还是也包括庭审、审判和行政驾照程序。","Fines, insurance changes and other consequences are different from the legal-service budget shown here.":"罚款、保险变动及其他后果与这里显示的法律服务预算是两回事。","Quick summary: Estimate estate-planning legal costs for wills, trusts, powers of attorney, document preparation and related professional work.":"快速摘要：估算遗嘱、信托、授权委托书、文件起草及相关专业工作的遗产规划法律费用。","Estimate estate-planning legal costs for wills, trusts, powers of attorney, document preparation and related professional work.":"估算遗嘱、信托、授权委托书、文件起草及相关专业工作的遗产规划法律费用。","the hours the attorney expects the work to take.":"律师预计完成这项工作所需的小时数。","the flat, package or minimum fee for the work.":"这项工作的固定、套餐或最低费用。","filing and government charges for the work.":"这项工作的立案和政府收费。","outside professional fees the work needs.":"这项工作所需的外部专业人员费用。","any other costs tied to the work.":"与这项工作相关的任何其他费用。","The calculator multiplies the hours by the rate for the hourly basis, takes the larger of that and the flat or minimum fee as the legal fee, adds the filing, expert and other costs as external fees, and reports the total plus how far it runs above the flat figure.":"计算器将小时数乘以费率得到按小时计费的基数，取该金额与固定或最低费用中较大者作为律师费，再把立案、专家和其他费用作为外部费用相加，并报告总额以及超出固定金额的部分。","With the illustrative starting inputs: the hourly basis is 12 times 375, which is $4,500.00, above the 3,500 flat fee, so the legal line is $4,500.00.":"按示例起始数据：小时基数为 12 乘以 375，即 $4,500.00，高于 3,500 的固定费用，因此律师费一项为 $4,500.00。","The external fees are 150 plus 700 plus 250, which is $1,100.00, the total is $5,600.00, and the amount above the flat fee is $2,100.00.":"外部费用为 150 加 700 加 250，即 $1,100.00，总额为 $5,600.00，超出固定费用的部分为 $2,100.00。","The work total is the headline: $5,600.00 on the starting inputs.":"工作总额是核心数字：按起始数据为 $5,600.00。","The hourly basis ($4,500.00) exceeds the 3,500 flat fee, so the hourly figure governs the legal line; the model never adds the two bases together.":"小时基数（$4,500.00）超过 3,500 的固定费用，因此律师费一项由小时金额决定；模型绝不会把两种基数相加。","The above-flat line ($2,100.00) shows how far the total runs past the flat floor once external fees are included.":"高于固定费用的一行（$2,100.00）显示加入外部费用后，总额超出固定下限多少。","Assuming notary or recording charges are inside the attorney's rate; the model prices them through the external fields you enter.":"以为公证或登记费用已包含在律师费率内；模型通过您输入的外部费用栏对其计价。","Reading the fee breakdown for estate planning":"如何阅读遗产规划的费用明细","This scenario sits close to its flat floor: 12 hours at $375.00 is $4,500.00 against a $3,500.00 flat fee, a break-even of 9.33 hours.":"此情景接近其固定下限：12 小时、每小时 $375.00 即 $4,500.00，对比 $3,500.00 固定费用，盈亏平衡点为 9.33 小时。","The total is $5,600.00, of which professional fees of $700.00 are 12.5%.":"总额为 $5,600.00，其中 $700.00 的专业人员费用占 12.5%。","That closeness shows in the what-if table.":"这种接近程度会在假设对比表中体现出来。","Cutting the hours by 25% brings hourly work to $3,375.00, below the flat fee, so the total falls only to $4,600.00, the same as the flat-fee-only row.":"把小时数减少 25%，按小时工作降到 $3,375.00，低于固定费用，所以总额只降到 $4,600.00，与仅固定费用一行相同。","Raising the hours by 25% adds $1,125.00.":"把小时数增加 25%，会增加 $1,125.00。","If a package covers the documents you want, the flat fee is the number to check against your quote.":"如果某个套餐涵盖您需要的文件，应拿固定费用这个数字与您的报价对照。","What if the work takes fewer hours than the flat fee covers?":"如果实际工时少于固定费用所覆盖的小时数会怎样？","At 9 hours the hourly basis would be $3,375.00, so the legal line would read the 3,500 figure and the total would be $4,600.00.":"工时为 9 小时时，小时基数为 $3,375.00，因此律师费一项取 3,500 这一金额，总额为 $4,600.00。","Are notary or recording charges included?":"是否包含公证或登记费用？","Only if you enter them in the external fields; the model adds exactly what you enter there.":"只有在外部费用栏中输入时才包含；模型恰好加上您在那里输入的内容。","Check which documents, asset transfers and follow-up revisions are included in a flat quote.":"请核实固定报价中包含哪些文件、资产转让和后续修改。","A document package is different from hourly administration after a death, and the same drafting work should not be included twice.":"文件套餐与人去世后按小时计费的遗产管理不同，同样的起草工作不应重复计入。","Quick summary: Estimate immigration legal-service costs using editable attorney hours, package fees, filing, translation and specialist assumptions.":"快速摘要：使用可编辑的律师工时、套餐费用、立案、翻译和专家假设，估算移民法律服务费用。","Estimate immigration legal-service costs using editable attorney hours, package fees, filing, translation and specialist assumptions.":"使用可编辑的律师工时、套餐费用、立案、翻译和专家假设，估算移民法律服务费用。","the hours the attorney expects the matter to take.":"律师预计办理此事项所需的小时数。","the flat, package or minimum fee for the matter.":"此事项的固定、套餐或最低费用。","filing and government charges for the matter.":"此事项的立案和政府收费。","outside professional fees the matter needs, such as translation.":"此事项所需的外部专业人员费用，例如翻译。","any other costs tied to the matter.":"与此事项相关的任何其他费用。","With the illustrative starting inputs: the hourly basis is 18 times 325, which is $5,850.00, above the 4,200 flat fee, so the legal line is $5,850.00.":"按示例起始数据：小时基数为 18 乘以 325，即 $5,850.00，高于 4,200 的固定费用，因此律师费一项为 $5,850.00。","The external fees are 725 plus 900 plus 300, which is $1,925.00, the total is $7,775.00, and the amount above the flat fee is $3,575.00.":"外部费用为 725 加 900 加 300，即 $1,925.00，总额为 $7,775.00，超出固定费用的部分为 $3,575.00。","The matter total is the headline: $7,775.00 on the starting inputs.":"事项总额是核心数字：按起始数据为 $7,775.00。","The hourly basis ($5,850.00) exceeds the 4,200 flat fee, so the hourly figure governs the legal line; the model never adds the two bases together.":"小时基数（$5,850.00）超过 4,200 的固定费用，因此律师费一项由小时金额决定；模型绝不会把两种基数相加。","Government filing charges ($725 of the $1,925.00 external line) sit outside the attorney's fee, and they change on their own schedule, so confirm current amounts from the official source.":"政府立案收费（外部费用 $1,925.00 中的 $725）不包含在律师费之内，且按其自身时间表调整，所以请从官方来源确认当前金额。","Assuming translation is inside the attorney's rate; the model prices it as a separate external line.":"以为翻译费已包含在律师费率内；模型把它作为单独的外部费用项计价。","Leaving government filing charges out of the external fields; the model only adds what you enter.":"没有把政府立案收费填入外部费用栏；模型只会加上您输入的内容。","Reading the fee breakdown for an immigration matter":"如何阅读移民事项的费用明细","Eighteen hours at $325.00 is $5,850.00, above the $4,200.00 flat fee (break-even 12.92 hours).":"18 小时、每小时 $325.00 即 $5,850.00，高于 $4,200.00 的固定费用（盈亏平衡点 12.92 小时）。","Government and filing fees of $725.00 are 9.3% of the $7,775.00 total, and professional fees of $900.00 add 11.6%.":"政府和立案费用 $725.00 占 $7,775.00 总额的 9.3%，专业人员费用 $900.00 再占 11.6%。","A 25% change in hours moves the total by $1,462.50 and a 10% rate change by $585.00.":"小时数变动 25% 会使总额变动 $1,462.50，费率变动 10% 则变动 $585.00。","The flat-fee-only row is $6,125.00.":"仅固定费用一行为 $6,125.00。","Enter government filing fees as the amounts you expect to pay for your filing; this page does not look up any fee schedule, and the filing and professional lines stay constant across the what-if rows.":"请把政府立案收费输入为您预计为自己的申请支付的金额；本页不会查询任何收费表，立案和专业人员费用各项在各假设行中保持不变。","What if the matter finishes in fewer hours?":"如果事项用更少的小时完成会怎样？","The flat or minimum governs below the crossover.":"低于交叉点时，以固定或最低费用为准。","At 10 hours the hourly basis would be $3,250.00, so the legal line would read the 4,200 figure and the total would be $6,125.00.":"工时为 10 小时时，小时基数为 $3,250.00，因此律师费一项取 4,200 这一金额，总额为 $6,125.00。","Are government filing charges included?":"是否包含政府立案收费？","Yes, in the external line as entered: $725.00 on the starting inputs.":"包含，按输入值计入外部费用一项：按起始数据为 $725.00。","Confirm the current amounts from the official source, since they change on their own schedule.":"请从官方来源确认当前金额，因为它们按自身时间表调整。","Keep attorney fees separate from government filing, translation, medical and courier charges.":"把律师费与政府立案、翻译、医疗和快递费用分开。","Confirm which application stages the engagement includes; the form does not determine eligibility, current filing fees or the outcome of an application.":"请确认委托包含申请的哪些阶段；本表单不判定资格、当前立案费用或申请结果。","Quick summary: Estimate Facebook or Meta Ads traffic, conversions, revenue, ROAS and ROI from spend, CPM and conversion assumptions.":"快速摘要：根据支出、CPM 和转化假设，估算 Facebook 或 Meta 广告的流量、转化、收入、ROAS 和 ROI。","Estimate Facebook or Meta Ads traffic, conversions, revenue, ROAS and ROI from spend, CPM and conversion assumptions.":"根据支出、CPM 和转化假设，估算 Facebook 或 Meta 广告的流量、转化、收入、ROAS 和 ROI。","Advertising spend ($):":"广告支出（$）：","the amount spent on the ads in the period.":"该期间在广告上花费的金额。","It can be 0.":"可以为 0。","Average CPM ($):":"平均 CPM（$）：","the average cost per thousand impressions.":"每千次展示的平均成本。","It must be above 0.":"必须大于 0。","Click-through rate (%):":"点击率（%）：","clicks as a percentage of impressions.":"点击数占展示次数的百分比。","It can be 0 and cannot exceed 100.":"可以为 0，但不能超过 100。","Website conversion rate (%):":"网站转化率（%）：","conversions as a percentage of clicks.":"转化数占点击数的百分比。","Average revenue per conversion ($):":"每次转化的平均收入（$）：","the revenue an average conversion brings.":"一次平均转化带来的收入。","Gross margin (%):":"毛利率（%）：","the share of revenue left after the cost of goods.":"扣除商品成本后剩余的收入比例。","Other campaign and creative costs ($):":"其他活动和创意成本（$）：","non-media costs such as creative production.":"非媒体成本，例如创意制作。","The calculator turns the spend into impressions at the entered CPM, into clicks at the click-through rate, into conversions at the website conversion rate, and into revenue at the average revenue per conversion.":"计算器按所输入的 CPM 把支出换算成展示次数，按点击率换算成点击数，按网站转化率换算成转化数，再按每次转化的平均收入换算成收入。","Gross profit is revenue at the margin; the return on investment subtracts spend and other costs from that profit and divides by those costs.":"毛利是按毛利率计算的收入；投资回报率则用该利润减去支出和其他成本，再除以这些成本。","With the illustrative starting inputs: the 12,000 spend at an 18 CPM buys the impressions for 9,333 clicks, which convert 326.7 times at 3.5%, producing $179,666.67 of revenue (a 14.97x return on ad spend).":"按示例起始数据：12,000 的支出、CPM 为 18，买到的展示带来 9,333 次点击，按 3.5% 转化 326.7 次，产生 $179,666.67 的收入（广告支出回报率为 14.97x）。","Gross profit at 65% minus the 12,000 spend and 1,500 of other costs leaves $103,283.33, a 765.06% return on those combined costs.":"65% 的毛利减去 12,000 的支出和 1,500 的其他成本，剩下 $103,283.33，相对这些合计成本的回报率为 765.06%。","Advertising spend ($)":"广告支出（$）","Average CPM ($)":"平均 CPM（$）","Click-through rate (%)":"点击率（%）","Website conversion rate (%)":"网站转化率（%）","Average revenue per conversion ($)":"每次转化的平均收入（$）","Gross margin (%)":"毛利率（%）","Other campaign and creative costs ($)":"其他活动和创意成本（$）","Estimated advertising ROI":"估算的广告 ROI","Estimated clicks":"估算点击数","Estimated conversions":"估算转化数","Estimated revenue and ROAS":"估算收入和 ROAS","Estimated contribution profit":"估算贡献利润","The headline is the return on investment: 765.06% on the starting inputs, profit as a share of the 12,000 spend plus 1,500 of other costs.":"核心数字是投资回报率：按起始数据为 765.06%，即利润占 12,000 支出加 1,500 其他成本的比例。","The funnel lines show where volume comes from: 9,333 clicks become 326.7 conversions, which at 550 each produce $179,666.67 of revenue.":"漏斗各行显示流量从何而来：9,333 次点击变成 326.7 次转化，每次 550，产生 $179,666.67 的收入。","The profit line ($103,283.33) is the money view after media and other costs; the 14.97x figure beside revenue counts only ad spend, so it always reads higher than the headline return.":"利润一行（$103,283.33）是扣除媒体和其他成本后的金额视角；收入旁边的 14.97x 只计算广告支出，所以总是比核心回报率更高。","Entering a cost per click in the CPM field; the model treats that field as cost per thousand impressions, so a click cost shrinks the modeled impressions a thousandfold.":"把单次点击成本填到 CPM 栏；模型把该栏当作每千次展示成本，因此点击成本会使模型中的展示次数缩小一千倍。","Comparing the return on ad spend with the headline return; the 14.97x ignores margin and other costs, while the headline nets them out.":"把广告支出回报率与核心回报率相比较；14.97x 忽略了毛利率和其他成本，而核心回报率已将它们扣除。","Entering margin as a decimal; the margin and rate fields are percentages from 0 to 100, not fractions.":"把毛利率输入为小数；毛利率和比率栏是 0 到 100 的百分数，不是小数。","Reading fractional conversions as literal; the 326.7 figure is an average across many runs of the funnel, not a partial customer.":"把带小数的转化数当成字面数字；326.7 是该漏斗多次运行的平均值，而不是半个客户。","Reading the funnel for a CPM-based campaign":"如何阅读基于 CPM 的广告活动漏斗","With $12,000.00 of spend at an $18.00 CPM, the page estimates 9,333 clicks at a 1.4% click-through rate and 326.7 conversions at 3.5%.":"12,000.00 美元支出、CPM 为 $18.00 时，本页估算点击数为 9,333（点击率 1.4%），转化 326.7 次（转化率 3.5%）。","At $550.00 per conversion and a 65% margin, profit is $103,283.33 after $1,500.00 of other costs.":"每次转化 $550.00、毛利率 65%，扣除 $1,500.00 其他成本后，利润为 $103,283.33。","Break-even needs a conversion rate of 0.40%, and cost per conversion is $41.33.":"盈亏平衡需要 0.40% 的转化率，单次转化成本为 $41.33。","Click-through and conversion rate both scale the result in the same way, so lowering either by 25% gives the same $74,087.50 profit, while a 20% higher CPM gives $83,819.44.":"点击率和转化率对结果的影响方式相同，所以其中任何一个降低 25%，利润都同样是 $74,087.50，而 CPM 提高 20% 则为 $83,819.44。","A 10% lower margin lowers profit by $11,678.33.":"毛利率降低 10%，利润减少 $11,678.33。","The inputs are your own assumptions, and the page applies them at any spend level, so treat the result as arithmetic on your numbers.":"这些输入是您自己的假设，本页把它们应用于任何支出水平，所以请把结果当作对您数字的算术计算。","Why does the ROI differ from the ROAS?":"为什么 ROI 与 ROAS 不同？","The 14.97x return on ad spend divides revenue by media spend only.":"14.97x 的广告支出回报率只是收入除以媒体支出。","The headline 765.06% applies the gross margin first and subtracts both the spend and the other costs.":"核心的 765.06% 先应用毛利率，再减去支出和其他成本。","What if the spend is zero?":"如果支出为零会怎样？","The model still computes the funnel, but the return lines need a positive total cost; with zero cost the headline reports that it is undefined.":"模型仍会计算漏斗，但回报各行需要总成本为正；成本为零时，核心数字会提示未定义。","Does the model predict my campaign?":"模型能预测我的广告活动吗？","No. It replays the rates you enter; actual delivery prices and conversion behavior move, so treat the output as the arithmetic of your own scenario.":"不能。它只是重放您输入的比率；实际投放价格和转化行为会变化，所以请把结果当作您自己情景的算术计算。","Attribution, platform reporting, view-through conversions, refunds, repeat purchases, taxes, creative fatigue and incrementality can change actual results.":"归因、平台报告、浏览转化、退款、重复购买、税费、创意疲劳和增量效果都可能改变实际结果。","ROI is undefined when the total modeled cost is zero.":"当模型总成本为零时，ROI 未定义。","The associated cash-flow amounts can still be calculated; an undefined return percentage is not a zero-percent return.":"相关的现金流金额仍可计算；未定义的回报百分比并不等于 0% 的回报。","From impressions to profit":"从展示到利润","The Facebook scenario starts with ad spend and the entered CPM, then estimates impressions, clicks and conversions using the entered rates.":"Facebook 情景从广告支出和所输入的 CPM 开始，再用所输入的比率估算展示次数、点击数和转化数。","These are expectations, so fractional conversions are valid averages rather than literal completed orders.":"这些是预期值，所以带小数的转化数是有效的平均值，而不是字面意义上的已完成订单。","They are not platform performance benchmarks.":"它们不是平台的绩效基准。","Revenue is expected conversions × average order value.":"收入 = 预期转化数 × 平均订单价值。","Gross margin converts that revenue to contribution before advertising and other campaign costs.":"毛利率把这些收入换算为扣除广告和其他活动成本之前的贡献额。","ROI uses contribution minus campaign costs, not revenue alone.":"ROI 使用的是贡献额减去活动成本，而不是只看收入。","For $1,000 spend, $10 CPM, 1% click-through and 2% conversion, the model expects 100,000 impressions, 1,000 clicks and 20 conversions.":"支出 $1,000、CPM $10、点击率 1%、转化率 2% 时，模型预计 100,000 次展示、1,000 次点击和 20 次转化。","At $100 per order and 50% margin, $2,000 revenue supplies $1,000 contribution and exactly breaks even before other campaign costs.":"每单 $100、毛利率 50%，$2,000 收入带来 $1,000 贡献额，在计入其他活动成本之前刚好盈亏平衡。","CPM, click-through and conversion are separate stages":"CPM、点击率和转化率是相互独立的环节","CPM sets the cost for 1,000 impressions.":"CPM 决定每 1,000 次展示的成本。","Click-through rate converts impressions to expected clicks, and conversion rate converts those clicks to the selected outcome.":"点击率把展示次数换算为预期点击数，转化率再把这些点击换算为所选的结果。","In this one-outcome-per-click model both percentages run from 0% to 100%.":"在这个“每次点击一个结果”的模型中，两个百分比都在 0% 到 100% 之间。","Revenue uses the entered order value, while profit uses gross margin and subtracts advertising and other campaign costs.":"收入使用所输入的订单价值，而利润使用毛利率并减去广告和其他活动成本。","A revenue multiple above 1 does not alone prove the campaign is profitable.":"收入倍数大于 1，本身并不能证明广告活动有利润。","Quick summary: Estimate Google Ads clicks, conversions, revenue, ROAS, contribution profit and ROI from editable campaign assumptions.":"快速摘要：根据可编辑的广告活动假设，估算 Google Ads 的点击数、转化数、收入、ROAS、贡献利润和 ROI。","Estimate Google Ads clicks, conversions, revenue, ROAS, contribution profit and ROI from editable campaign assumptions.":"根据可编辑的广告活动假设，估算 Google Ads 的点击数、转化数、收入、ROAS、贡献利润和 ROI。","Average cost per click ($):":"平均单次点击成本（$）：","the average price paid per click.":"每次点击平均支付的价格。","The calculator turns the spend into clicks at the entered cost per click, into conversions at the website conversion rate, and into revenue at the average revenue per conversion.":"计算器按所输入的单次点击成本把支出换算成点击数，按网站转化率换算成转化数，再按每次转化的平均收入换算成收入。","With the illustrative starting inputs: the 12,000 spend at 8.5 per click buys 1,412 clicks, which convert 84.7 times at 6%, producing $46,588.24 of revenue (a 3.88x return on ad spend).":"按示例起始数据：12,000 的支出、每次点击 8.5，买到 1,412 次点击，按 6% 转化 84.7 次，产生 $46,588.24 的收入（广告支出回报率为 3.88x）。","Gross profit at 65% minus the 12,000 spend and 1,500 of other costs leaves $16,782.35, a 124.31% return on those combined costs.":"65% 的毛利减去 12,000 的支出和 1,500 的其他成本，剩下 $16,782.35，相对这些合计成本的回报率为 124.31%。","Average cost per click ($)":"平均单次点击成本（$）","The headline is the return on investment: 124.31% on the starting inputs, profit as a share of the 12,000 spend plus 1,500 of other costs.":"核心数字是投资回报率：按起始数据为 124.31%，即利润占 12,000 支出加 1,500 其他成本的比例。","The funnel lines show where volume comes from: 1,412 clicks become 84.7 conversions, which at 550 each produce $46,588.24 of revenue.":"漏斗各行显示流量从何而来：1,412 次点击变成 84.7 次转化，每次 550，产生 $46,588.24 的收入。","The profit line ($16,782.35) is the money view after media and other costs; the 3.88x figure beside revenue counts only ad spend, so it always reads higher than the headline return.":"利润一行（$16,782.35）是扣除媒体和其他成本后的金额视角；收入旁边的 3.88x 只计算广告支出，所以总是比核心回报率更高。","Entering a CPM in the cost-per-click field; this model prices clicks directly, so a per-thousand figure understates the click cost a thousandfold.":"把 CPM 填到单次点击成本栏；本模型直接对点击计价，所以按千次计的数字会把点击成本低估一千倍。","Comparing the return on ad spend with the headline return; the 3.88x ignores margin and other costs, while the headline nets them out.":"把广告支出回报率与核心回报率相比较；3.88x 忽略了毛利率和其他成本，而核心回报率已将它们扣除。","Entering the conversion rate or margin as a decimal; both fields are percentages from 0 to 100, not fractions.":"把转化率或毛利率输入为小数；这两栏都是 0 到 100 的百分数，不是小数。","Reading fractional conversions as literal; the 84.7 figure is an average across many runs of the funnel, not a partial customer.":"把带小数的转化数当成字面数字；84.7 是该漏斗多次运行的平均值，而不是半个客户。","Reading the funnel for a cost-per-click campaign":"如何阅读按单次点击成本计费的广告活动漏斗","Here clicks come straight from spend: $12,000.00 at $8.50 per click is 1,412 clicks, and a 6% conversion rate gives 84.7 conversions.":"这里点击数直接由支出得出：$12,000.00、每次点击 $8.50 即 1,412 次点击，6% 的转化率得到 84.7 次转化。","At $550.00 and a 65% margin, profit is $16,782.35 after $1,500.00 of other costs.":"每次转化 $550.00、毛利率 65%，扣除 $1,500.00 其他成本后，利润为 $16,782.35。","The cost per conversion is $159.38, and the break-even conversion rate is 2.67%.":"单次转化成本为 $159.38，盈亏平衡转化率为 2.67%。","This page is much closer to break-even than a CPM model with the same spend, and the what-if table shows it: a 25% lower conversion rate cuts profit by $7,570.59, a 20% higher cost per click by $5,047.06, and a 10% lower margin by $3,028.24.":"与相同支出的 CPM 模型相比，本页更接近盈亏平衡，假设对比表也说明了这一点：转化率降低 25%，利润减少 $7,570.59；单次点击成本提高 20%，减少 $5,047.06；毛利率降低 10%，减少 $3,028.24。","The conversion-rate and click-cost inputs are yours to supply from your account data.":"转化率和单次点击成本这两项输入需要您根据自己账户的数据提供。","The 3.88x return on ad spend divides revenue by media spend only.":"3.88x 的广告支出回报率只是收入除以媒体支出。","The headline 124.31% applies the gross margin first and subtracts both the spend and the other costs.":"核心的 124.31% 先应用毛利率，再减去支出和其他成本。","No. It replays the rates you enter; actual auction prices and conversion behavior move, so treat the output as the arithmetic of your own scenario.":"不能。它只是重放您输入的比率；实际拍卖价格和转化行为会变化，所以请把结果当作您自己情景的算术计算。","Clicks from a CPC assumption":"基于 CPC 假设得出点击数","This page uses average cost per click, so expected clicks = ad spend / CPC.":"本页使用平均单次点击成本，因此预期点击数 = 广告支出 / CPC。","Click-through rate is not required by this CPC model; it would be needed in an impression-based model.":"这个 CPC 模型不需要点击率；基于展示次数的模型才需要它。","Expected conversions = clicks × conversion rate / 100.":"预期转化数 = 点击数 × 转化率 / 100。","Fractional conversions are scenario averages, not literal completed orders.":"带小数的转化数是情景平均值，不是字面意义上的已完成订单。","With $1,000 spend and $1 CPC, the model expects 1,000 clicks.":"支出 $1,000、CPC 为 $1 时，模型预计 1,000 次点击。","At 2% conversion and $100 per order, revenue is $2,000.":"转化率 2%、每单 $100，收入为 $2,000。","A 50% gross margin leaves $1,000 contribution, which breaks even against the $1,000 advertising cost before other campaign costs.":"50% 的毛利率留下 $1,000 贡献额，在计入其他活动成本之前，刚好与 $1,000 的广告成本盈亏平衡。","Revenue divided by ad spend is ROAS; profit divided by total campaign cost is ROI.":"收入除以广告支出是 ROAS；利润除以活动总成本是 ROI。","Neither is a promise of Google Ads performance.":"二者都不是对 Google Ads 表现的承诺。","Use one conversion definition":"使用统一的转化定义","This simple funnel treats a conversion as one successful outcome per click, so the conversion percentage must be between 0% and 100%.":"这个简单漏斗把一次转化视为每次点击对应一个成功结果，因此转化率必须在 0% 到 100% 之间。","If an ad platform counts several events per click, first choose the one order or acquisition outcome you want to value.":"如果广告平台在每次点击中统计多个事件，请先选定您想计价的那一个订单或获客结果。","Using an event count as though every event were a new full-value order can overstate revenue.":"把事件计数当作每个事件都是一笔全额新订单，可能会高估收入。","CPC supplies click volume here; no click-through-rate assumption is needed.":"这里由 CPC 提供点击量，不需要点击率假设。","Quick summary: Estimate TikTok Ads traffic, conversions, revenue, ROAS and ROI using spend, CPM, click-through and conversion assumptions.":"快速摘要：使用支出、CPM、点击率和转化假设，估算 TikTok 广告的流量、转化、收入、ROAS 和 ROI。","Estimate TikTok Ads traffic, conversions, revenue, ROAS and ROI using spend, CPM, click-through and conversion assumptions.":"使用支出、CPM、点击率和转化假设，估算 TikTok 广告的流量、转化、收入、ROAS 和 ROI。","With the illustrative starting inputs: the 12,000 spend at a 12 CPM buys the impressions for 11,000 clicks, which convert 308 times at 2.8%, producing $169,400.00 of revenue (a 14.12x return on ad spend).":"按示例起始数据：12,000 的支出、CPM 为 12，买到的展示带来 11,000 次点击，按 2.8% 转化 308 次，产生 $169,400.00 的收入（广告支出回报率为 14.12x）。","Gross profit at 65% minus the 12,000 spend and 1,500 of other costs leaves $96,610.00, a 715.63% return on those combined costs.":"65% 的毛利减去 12,000 的支出和 1,500 的其他成本，剩下 $96,610.00，相对这些合计成本的回报率为 715.63%。","The headline is the return on investment: 715.63% on the starting inputs, profit as a share of the 12,000 spend plus 1,500 of other costs.":"核心数字是投资回报率：按起始数据为 715.63%，即利润占 12,000 支出加 1,500 其他成本的比例。","The funnel lines show where volume comes from: 11,000 clicks become 308 conversions, which at 550 each produce $169,400.00 of revenue.":"漏斗各行显示流量从何而来：11,000 次点击变成 308 次转化，每次 550，产生 $169,400.00 的收入。","The profit line ($96,610.00) is the money view after media and other costs; the 14.12x figure beside revenue counts only ad spend, so it always reads higher than the headline return.":"利润一行（$96,610.00）是扣除媒体和其他成本后的金额视角；收入旁边的 14.12x 只计算广告支出，所以总是比核心回报率更高。","Comparing the return on ad spend with the headline return; the 14.12x ignores margin and other costs, while the headline nets them out.":"把广告支出回报率与核心回报率相比较；14.12x 忽略了毛利率和其他成本，而核心回报率已将它们扣除。","Entering the rates or margin as decimals; the rate and margin fields are percentages from 0 to 100, not fractions.":"把比率或毛利率输入为小数；比率和毛利率栏是 0 到 100 的百分数，不是小数。","Reading the funnel as a forecast; the model replays the rates you enter, while actual delivery prices and conversion behavior move with the audience and creative.":"把漏斗当作预测；模型只是重放您输入的比率，而实际投放价格和转化行为会随受众和创意而变化。","Reading the funnel for a short-video CPM campaign":"如何阅读短视频 CPM 广告活动的漏斗","With $12,000.00 of spend at a $12.00 CPM, the page estimates 11,000 clicks at a 1.1% click-through rate and 308.0 conversions at 2.8%.":"12,000.00 美元支出、CPM 为 $12.00 时，本页估算点击数为 11,000（点击率 1.1%），转化 308.0 次（转化率 2.8%）。","Revenue is $169,400.00 at $550.00 per conversion, and profit is $96,610.00 after a 65% margin and $1,500.00 of other costs.":"每次转化 $550.00，收入为 $169,400.00；按 65% 毛利率并扣除 $1,500.00 其他成本后，利润为 $96,610.00。","Cost per conversion is $43.83 and the break-even conversion rate is 0.34%.":"单次转化成本为 $43.83，盈亏平衡转化率为 0.34%。","A 25% lower click-through or conversion rate gives the same $69,082.50 profit.":"点击率或转化率降低 25%，利润同样是 $69,082.50。","A 20% higher CPM lowers profit by $18,351.67, and a 10% lower margin by $11,011.00.":"CPM 提高 20%，利润减少 $18,351.67；毛利率降低 10%，减少 $11,011.00。","The ROAS of 14.12x counts only ad spend, while the ROI of 715.6% also counts the other campaign costs.":"14.12x 的 ROAS 只计算广告支出，而 715.6% 的 ROI 还计入了其他活动成本。","The 14.12x return on ad spend divides revenue by media spend only.":"14.12x 的广告支出回报率只是收入除以媒体支出。","The headline 715.63% applies the gross margin first and subtracts both the spend and the other costs.":"核心的 715.63% 先应用毛利率，再减去支出和其他成本。","The TikTok scenario starts with ad spend and the entered CPM, then estimates impressions, clicks and conversions using the entered rates.":"TikTok 情景从广告支出和所输入的 CPM 开始，再用所输入的比率估算展示次数、点击数和转化数。","Value conversions consistently with campaign spend":"让转化价值与广告活动支出口径保持一致","Use the same attribution period and one chosen order or acquisition event for spend, conversion rate and value per conversion.":"对支出、转化率和单次转化价值，使用同一个归因周期以及同一个选定的订单或获客事件。","This CPM funnel allows one click per impression and one selected conversion per click, so both rates are limited to 0%–100%.":"这个 CPM 漏斗假定每次展示最多一次点击、每次点击对应一次选定的转化，所以两个比率都限制在 0%–100%。","View-through events, repeat actions and platform-attributed revenue can use a different counting basis; the page cannot resolve attribution overlap.":"浏览转化事件、重复行为和平台归因的收入可能采用不同的统计口径；本页无法解决归因重叠问题。","Its calculated return is an entered scenario, not a platform benchmark.":"其计算出的回报是您输入的情景，而不是平台基准。","Quick summary: Estimate first-year HIPAA risk assessment, safeguards, training and tooling cost.":"快速摘要：估算 HIPAA 风险评估、安全保障措施、培训和工具在第一年的成本。","Estimate first-year HIPAA risk assessment, safeguards, training and tooling cost.":"估算 HIPAA 风险评估、安全保障措施、培训和工具在第一年的成本。","Enter Employees or in-scope users; Readiness and consulting cost ($); Assessment or audit cost ($); Monthly compliance tooling cost ($); Training cost per employee ($); Technical remediation budget ($).":"输入：员工或范围内用户数；准备与咨询费用（$）；评估或审计费用（$）；每月合规工具费用（$）；每位员工的培训费用（$）；技术整改预算（$）。","Select Calculate to update the results.":"点击“计算”以更新结果。","Consulting, audit, remediation, annual tooling and per-employee training are totaled.":"咨询、审计、整改、年度工具费用和按人计算的培训费用会被合计。","Employees or in-scope users":"员工或范围内用户数","Readiness and consulting cost ($)":"准备与咨询费用（$）","Assessment or audit cost ($)":"评估或审计费用（$）","Monthly compliance tooling cost ($)":"每月合规工具费用（$）","Training cost per employee ($)":"每位员工的培训费用（$）","Technical remediation budget ($)":"技术整改预算（$）","Estimated first-year compliance cost":"估算的第一年合规成本","Consulting, audit and remediation":"咨询、审计和整改","Annual tooling cost":"年度工具费用","Employee training cost":"员工培训费用","Reading the cost lines for a HIPAA budget":"如何阅读 HIPAA 预算的各项成本","The starting total of $109,400.00 is $30,000.00 of readiness, $15,000.00 of assessment, $40,000.00 of remediation, $14,400.00 of tooling (twelve months of $1,200.00) and $10,000.00 of training for 100 people.":"起始总额 $109,400.00 由以下部分组成：准备 $30,000.00、评估 $15,000.00、整改 $40,000.00、工具 $14,400.00（十二个月，每月 $1,200.00）以及 100 人的培训 $10,000.00。","Remediation is the largest line at 36.6%.":"整改是最大的一项，占 36.6%。","Per employee, the total is $1,094.00.":"人均总额为 $1,094.00。","Remediation drives the what-if results: 25% more or less moves the total by $10,000.00.":"整改是假设对比结果的主要驱动因素：增减 25% 会使总额变动 $10,000.00。","Half the employees saves $5,000.00 and twice as many adds $10,000.00, because only the training line scales with headcount.":"员工减半可节省 $5,000.00，员工翻倍则增加 $10,000.00，因为只有培训一项会随人数变化。","The page does not say which lines repeat each year, so ask your advisers before using the total as a yearly figure.":"本页不说明哪些项目每年重复发生，所以在把总额当作年度数字使用之前，请先咨询您的顾问。","Planning a realistic HIPAA compliance budget":"如何规划切合实际的 HIPAA 合规预算","Estimate first-year HIPAA compliance costs for readiness, risk assessment, employee training, security tooling and technical remediation.":"估算 HIPAA 合规第一年在准备、风险评估、员工培训、安全工具和技术整改方面的成本。","This calculator separates one-time project work,\n      annualized tooling and workforce training so that each assumption can be reviewed\n      and changed independently.":"本计算器把一次性项目工作、按年计算的工具费用和员工培训分开，便于逐项审查和单独修改每个假设。","Understand what each input represents":"了解每项输入代表什么","Employees or in-scope users:":"员工或范围内用户数：","People whose access, responsibilities\n        or training requirements are included in the project.":"其访问权限、职责或培训要求被纳入项目的人员。","Readiness and consulting:":"准备与咨询：","Gap analysis, project planning,\n        policy development, control design and specialist guidance.":"差距分析、项目规划、政策制定、控制措施设计和专业指导。","Assessment or audit:":"评估或审计：","The external or internal review work entered\n        for the selected compliance project.":"为所选合规项目输入的外部或内部审查工作费用。","Monthly compliance tooling:":"每月合规工具：","Software and services used for monitoring,\n        evidence, security operations or compliance management.":"用于监控、证据留存、安全运营或合规管理的软件和服务。","Training per employee:":"每位员工的培训：","The expected training cost multiplied by the\n        number of employees or users entered.":"预期培训成本乘以所输入的员工或用户数。","Technical remediation:":"技术整改：","The budget assigned to correcting identified\n        security, technology or process gaps.":"分配用于纠正已发现的安全、技术或流程缺口的预算。","Formula used by the calculator":"计算器使用的公式","The calculator uses four steps:":"计算器分四步进行：","Project cost = readiness and consulting + assessment or audit + remediation.":"项目成本 = 准备与咨询 + 评估或审计 + 整改。","Annual tooling cost = monthly tooling cost × 12.":"年度工具费用 = 每月工具费用 × 12。","Training cost = employees × training cost per employee.":"培训成本 = 员工数 × 每位员工的培训成本。","Estimated first-year cost = project cost + annual tooling + training.":"估算的第一年成本 = 项目成本 + 年度工具费用 + 培训。","Default example explained":"默认示例说明","Using the example values initially shown on this page, consulting, assessment and\n      remediation equal":"按本页最初显示的示例值，咨询、评估和整改合计","Twelve months of tooling equal":"十二个月的工具费用合计",", and employee training equals":"，员工培训费用为","The resulting example first-year estimate is":"由此得出的示例第一年估算为","These are editable planning inputs, not published market prices.":"这些是可编辑的规划输入，不是公开的市场价格。","Replace every default\n      with quotations, internal estimates or contract values that match your organization.":"请把每个默认值替换为与贵组织相符的报价、内部估算或合同金额。","Main factors that can change the estimate":"可能改变估算的主要因素","HIPAA planning commonly involves administrative, physical and technical safeguards.":"HIPAA 规划通常涉及行政、物理和技术三类保障措施。","The estimate should reflect the systems, workforce members, locations, vendors and workflows that handle protected health information.":"估算应反映处理受保护健康信息的系统、工作人员、办公地点、供应商和工作流程。","The number of employees, contractors and locations included in the compliance scope.":"纳入合规范围的员工、承包商和办公地点数量。","The maturity of current privacy, security, access-control and documentation practices.":"现有隐私、安全、访问控制和文档管理实践的成熟度。","The amount of remediation required after the initial risk assessment or gap review.":"初次风险评估或差距审查之后所需整改的工作量。","The cost of security awareness and role-specific workforce training.":"安全意识培训和按岗位划分的员工培训成本。","Recurring security, monitoring, backup, identity and compliance-management tools.":"持续使用的安全、监控、备份、身份和合规管理工具。","Outside consulting, legal review or specialist assessment work not already included.":"尚未包含在内的外部咨询、法律审查或专业评估工作。","How to compare budget scenarios":"如何比较不同的预算情景","Create a baseline using the most likely values, then change one assumption at a time.":"先用最可能的数值建立基准，然后每次只改变一个假设。","A lower-cost scenario might assume stronger existing controls and less remediation.":"较低成本的情景可以假定现有控制措施更完善、需要的整改更少。","A higher-cost scenario might include a wider scope, more specialist support or additional\n      security tooling.":"较高成本的情景可以包括更广的范围、更多的专家支持或额外的安全工具。","Keeping the other inputs unchanged makes the effect of each assumption\n      easier to understand.":"保持其他输入不变，更容易看清每个假设的影响。","For cash-flow planning, separate the result into upfront project expenses and recurring\n      costs.":"做现金流规划时，请把结果拆分为前期项目支出和持续性成本。","Consulting, assessment and remediation are treated as project costs by this calculator.":"本计算器把咨询、评估和整改视为项目成本。","Tooling is annualized, while training changes with the workforce size entered.":"工具费用按年计算，而培训费用随所输入的员工规模变化。","Costs that may need a separate allowance":"可能需要另行预留的费用","The result does not automatically include breach response, legal representation, cyber-insurance, internal staff time, major infrastructure replacement or future annual reassessments unless those amounts are entered in the available fields.":"结果不会自动包含数据泄露应对、法律代理、网络保险、内部员工工时、重大基础设施更换或未来的年度复评费用，除非您在可用字段中输入这些金额。","Before approving a budget, document what is included, what is excluded, who owns each\n      workstream and whether quoted amounts are one-time or recurring.":"批准预算之前，请记录包含什么、不包含什么、每项工作由谁负责，以及报价金额是一次性的还是持续性的。","Recalculate when the scope,\n      workforce, auditor, technology environment or supplier pricing changes.":"当范围、员工规模、审计方、技术环境或供应商价格发生变化时，请重新计算。","Scope, existing controls, auditor, systems and certification level determine actual cost.":"实际成本由范围、现有控制措施、审计方、系统和认证级别决定。","Budget the defined implementation scope":"按已确定的实施范围编制预算","Identify which locations, staff and systems the assessment covers before entering implementation, training and recurring support costs.":"在输入实施、培训和持续支持成本之前，先确定评估涵盖哪些办公地点、人员和系统。","A consultant fee, software subscription and remediation project may overlap.":"顾问费用、软件订阅和整改项目之间可能有重叠。","The result totals the entered budget; spending that amount does not demonstrate compliance or replace an assessment of the organization’s actual obligations.":"结果只是把您输入的预算相加；花掉这笔钱并不能证明已经合规，也不能代替对组织实际义务的评估。","Quick summary: Estimate first-year PCI DSS assessment, scanning, tooling and remediation cost.":"快速摘要：估算 PCI DSS 评估、扫描、工具和整改在第一年的成本。","Estimate first-year PCI DSS assessment, scanning, tooling and remediation cost.":"估算 PCI DSS 评估、扫描、工具和整改在第一年的成本。","Reading the cost lines for a PCI budget":"如何阅读 PCI 预算的各项成本","The starting total of $121,000.00 splits into $25,000.00 of readiness, $25,000.00 of assessment, $45,000.00 of remediation, $18,000.00 of tooling and $8,000.00 of training.":"起始总额 $121,000.00 分为：准备 $25,000.00、评估 $25,000.00、整改 $45,000.00、工具 $18,000.00 和培训 $8,000.00。","Tooling at $1,500.00 a month adds up to $18,000.00, 14.9% of the total; the page does not decide which lines repeat.":"工具每月 $1,500.00，合计 $18,000.00，占总额的 14.9%；本页不判断哪些项目会重复发生。","A 25% change in remediation moves the total by $11,250.00.":"整改变动 25% 会使总额变动 $11,250.00。","Half the employees saves $4,000.00, twice as many adds $8,000.00, and six months of tooling instead of twelve saves $9,000.00.":"员工减半可节省 $4,000.00，员工翻倍则增加 $8,000.00，工具费用按六个月而不是十二个月计算可节省 $9,000.00。","Per employee the total is $1,210.00.":"人均总额为 $1,210.00。","Replace each default with a quote or internal estimate before relying on any figure.":"在依赖任何数字之前，请把每个默认值替换为报价或内部估算。","Planning a realistic PCI DSS compliance budget":"如何规划切合实际的 PCI DSS 合规预算","Estimate first-year PCI DSS compliance costs for readiness, assessment, employee training, security tooling and technical remediation.":"估算 PCI DSS 合规第一年在准备、评估、员工培训、安全工具和技术整改方面的成本。","PCI DSS planning should focus on the cardholder-data environment and every connected person, process and technology that can affect its security.":"PCI DSS 规划应聚焦持卡人数据环境，以及所有可能影响其安全的相关人员、流程和技术。","Reducing unnecessary scope can materially change the amount of assessment and remediation work.":"缩小不必要的范围，可能显著改变评估和整改工作的工作量。","The number of payment channels, locations, systems and service providers in scope.":"纳入范围的支付渠道、办公地点、系统和服务提供商数量。","Whether cardholder data is stored, processed or transmitted by internal systems.":"内部系统是否存储、处理或传输持卡人数据。","The current condition of network segmentation, logging, access control and vulnerability management.":"网络分段、日志记录、访问控制和漏洞管理的现状。","The assessment method and the amount of external assessor or specialist support required.":"评估方式，以及所需的外部评估人员或专家支持的多少。","Scanning, penetration testing, monitoring and compliance-management tooling.":"扫描、渗透测试、监控和合规管理工具。","Remediation work needed to correct security or documentation gaps.":"纠正安全或文档缺口所需的整改工作。","The estimate does not automatically include payment-processing charges, replacement hardware, assessor travel, major application redevelopment, recurring validation or penalties arising from noncompliance unless those costs are entered separately.":"估算不会自动包含支付处理费用、设备更换、评估人员差旅、重大应用重构、持续验证或因不合规产生的罚款，除非您单独输入这些成本。","Assessment fees and remediation are different":"评估费用与整改是两回事","An assessment or validation fee does not necessarily include network changes, payment-system work, staff time or recurring scanning.":"评估或验证费用不一定包含网络变更、支付系统工作、员工工时或持续扫描。","Avoid treating the same software subscription as both an implementation item and a recurring charge.":"避免把同一份软件订阅既当作实施项目，又当作持续性费用。","The result is an entered project budget and does not establish a merchant’s validation level or compliance status.":"结果是您输入的项目预算，并不能确定商户的验证级别或合规状态。","Quick summary: Estimate first-year SOC 2 readiness, audit, tooling and remediation cost.":"快速摘要：估算 SOC 2 准备、审计、工具和整改在第一年的成本。","Estimate first-year SOC 2 readiness, audit, tooling and remediation cost.":"估算 SOC 2 准备、审计、工具和整改在第一年的成本。","Reading the cost lines for a SOC 2 budget":"如何阅读 SOC 2 预算的各项成本","The starting total of $166,600.00 is $45,000.00 of readiness, $35,000.00 of assessment, $50,000.00 of remediation, $21,600.00 of tooling and $15,000.00 of training.":"起始总额 $166,600.00 由以下部分组成：准备 $45,000.00、评估 $35,000.00、整改 $50,000.00、工具 $21,600.00 和培训 $15,000.00。","Readiness and remediation together are 57.0% of it, and the per-employee figure is $1,666.00.":"准备和整改合计占总额的 57.0%，人均为 $1,666.00。","In the what-if table, a 25% change in remediation moves the total by $12,500.00, six months of tooling instead of twelve saves $10,800.00, and halving the headcount saves $7,500.00 through the training line.":"在假设对比表中，整改变动 25% 会使总额变动 $12,500.00，工具费用按六个月而不是十二个月计算可节省 $10,800.00，员工减半则通过培训一项节省 $7,500.00。","Enter the audit scope and tooling you expect, since the page only adds what you type.":"请输入您预期的审计范围和工具，因为本页只会把您输入的内容相加。","Planning a realistic SOC 2 compliance budget":"如何规划切合实际的 SOC 2 合规预算","Estimate first-year SOC 2 compliance costs for readiness, audit preparation, employee training, security tooling and technical remediation.":"估算 SOC 2 合规第一年在准备、审计筹备、员工培训、安全工具和技术整改方面的成本。","SOC 2 planning depends on the selected Trust Services Criteria, the systems and services included in the examination, and whether the organization is preparing for a Type I or Type II report.":"SOC 2 规划取决于所选的信任服务标准、纳入审查的系统和服务，以及组织准备的是 Type I 还是 Type II 报告。","The selected security, availability, confidentiality, processing-integrity and privacy criteria.":"所选的安全性、可用性、保密性、处理完整性和隐私标准。","The maturity of policies, control ownership, evidence collection and risk-management processes.":"政策、控制措施责任归属、证据收集和风险管理流程的成熟度。","The number of systems, cloud environments, vendors and employees included in scope.":"纳入范围的系统、云环境、供应商和员工数量。","The audit firm, report type and examination period.":"审计机构、报告类型和审查期间。","Automation used for evidence collection, access reviews, monitoring and vendor management.":"用于证据收集、访问权限审查、监控和供应商管理的自动化。","Technical and operational remediation required before the examination begins.":"审查开始之前所需的技术和运营整改。","The result does not automatically include internal evidence-collection labor, penetration testing, legal review, customer security questionnaires, vendor remediation or the cost of operating controls during future reporting periods unless entered in the calculator.":"结果不会自动包含内部证据收集的人工成本、渗透测试、法律审查、客户安全问卷、供应商整改，以及未来报告期内运行各项控制措施的成本，除非您在计算器中输入这些金额。","Readiness, audit and renewal budgets":"准备、审计和续期预算","Separate internal readiness work from the external audit engagement and from recurring controls software.":"把内部准备工作与外部审计委托以及持续使用的控制措施软件分开。","Confirm the reporting period and systems in scope before comparing quotations.":"比较报价之前，请先确认报告期间和纳入范围的系统。","Adding these costs creates a budget for the assumed work; it does not produce an audit opinion or determine whether controls are suitably designed or operating effectively.":"把这些费用相加只是为假设的工作编制预算；它不会形成审计意见，也不能判断控制措施的设计是否恰当或运行是否有效。","Quick summary: Estimate coding or career bootcamp ROI and payback period.":"快速摘要：估算编程或职业训练营的 ROI 和回本周期。","Estimate coding or career bootcamp ROI and payback period.":"估算编程或职业训练营的 ROI 和回本周期。","Enter Annual tuition and fees ($); Program length (years); Annual grants, scholarships and employer aid ($); Current annual earnings ($); Expected annual earnings after program ($); Years used for ROI comparison.":"输入：年度学费和费用（$）；项目时长（年）；年度助学金、奖学金和雇主资助（$）；当前年收入（$）；项目结束后预期年收入（$）；用于 ROI 对比的年数。","Program cost after aid and estimated foregone earnings are compared with the projected earnings increase over the selected period.":"把扣除资助后的项目成本和估算的放弃收入，与所选期间内预计的收入增加额进行对比。","Annual tuition and fees ($)":"年度学费和费用（$）","Program length (years)":"项目时长（年）","Annual grants, scholarships and employer aid ($)":"年度助学金、奖学金和雇主资助（$）","Current annual earnings ($)":"当前年收入（$）","Expected annual earnings after program ($)":"项目结束后预期年收入（$）","Years used for ROI comparison":"用于 ROI 对比的年数","Estimated education return on investment":"估算的教育投资回报率","Direct cost plus foregone earnings":"直接成本加放弃的收入","Additional earnings over comparison period":"对比期内的额外收入","Net financial benefit":"净财务收益","Estimated payback period":"估算的回本周期","1 years":"1 年","Reading the cost and break-even for a short program":"如何阅读短期项目的成本和盈亏平衡点","For a half-year program the foregone earnings dominate: $22,500.00 of the $30,000.00 total cost is the $45,000.00 salary given up for six months, and tuition less aid is $7,500.00.":"对于半年的项目，放弃的收入占主导：$30,000.00 的总成本中，有 $22,500.00 是六个月放弃的 $45,000.00 年薪部分，学费减去资助为 $7,500.00。","The yearly earnings increase is $30,000.00, so the cost is recovered after 1.0 year and five comparison years leave a net benefit of $120,000.00, an ROI of 400%.":"每年收入增加 $30,000.00，因此 1.0 年后收回成本，五年的对比期留下 $120,000.00 的净收益，ROI 为 400%。","The year-by-year table makes the break-even visible: the net position reaches $0.00 at year 1.":"逐年表格让盈亏平衡点一目了然：净头寸在第 1 年达到 $0.00。","A 10% lower post-program salary cuts the net benefit by $37,500.00, and removing the aid changes it by only $500.00.":"项目后薪资降低 10%，净收益减少 $37,500.00；取消资助只会使其变化 $500.00。","The earnings figure after the program is an assumption you supply; the page does not predict it.":"项目结束后的收入数字是您提供的假设；本页不会预测它。","Employment outcomes, taxes, financing, raises, unemployment, benefits and nonfinancial value are uncertain.":"就业结果、税费、融资、加薪、失业、福利和非财务价值都存在不确定性。","Annual inputs, program cost and earnings assumptions":"年度输入、项目成本与收入假设","Bootcamp fees are often quoted for an entire course.":"训练营的费用通常按整个课程报价。","The tuition and aid fields here are annual amounts: for a six-month program, a $10,000 total tuition quote must be entered as $20,000 per year to reproduce that total.":"这里的学费和资助字段是按年计的金额：对于六个月的项目，总学费报价 $10,000 需要输入为每年 $20,000，才能得出该总额。","Direct study cost = max(0, annual tuition − annual aid) × program years.":"直接学习成本 = max(0, 年学费 − 年资助) × 项目年数。","Foregone earnings = current annual earnings × program years.":"放弃的收入 = 当前年收入 × 项目年数。","Total modeled cost is the sum.":"模型总成本是两者之和。","Benefit = (expected annual earnings after study − current annual earnings) × comparison years.":"收益 = (学习后预期年收入 − 当前年收入) × 对比年数。","ROI = (benefit − modeled cost) / modeled cost × 100.":"ROI = (收益 − 模型成本) / 模型成本 × 100。","In the starting bootcamp-style example, $16,000 annual tuition, $1,000 annual aid and half a year produce $7,500 direct cost.":"在起始的训练营式示例中，年学费 $16,000、年资助 $1,000、学期半年，直接成本为 $7,500。","Half of $45,000 current earnings adds $22,500, giving $30,000 cost.":"当前收入 $45,000 的一半即 $22,500 加上去，成本为 $30,000。","A $30,000 annual earnings increase over five years gives $150,000 benefit and 400% ROI.":"每年收入增加 $30,000，五年带来 $150,000 的收益，ROI 为 400%。","These undiscounted amounts assume the earnings increase happens; the result is not an employment or salary forecast.":"这些未折现的金额假定收入增加确实发生；结果不是就业或薪资预测。","Quick summary: Estimate college ROI using tuition, aid, foregone earnings and salary gain.":"快速摘要：根据学费、资助、放弃的收入和薪资增长估算大学教育的 ROI。","Estimate college ROI using tuition, aid, foregone earnings and salary gain.":"根据学费、资助、放弃的收入和薪资增长估算大学教育的 ROI。","5.9 years":"5.9 年","Reading the cost and break-even for a four-year degree":"如何阅读四年制学位的成本和盈亏平衡点","The starting total cost is $208,000.00: $88,000.00 of tuition less aid over four years, plus $120,000.00 of earnings given up.":"起始总成本为 $208,000.00：四年学费减去资助共 $88,000.00，加上放弃的收入 $120,000.00。","With a $35,000.00 yearly increase the cost is recovered after 5.9 years, and the table shows the net position first turning positive in year 6 at $2,000.00.":"每年收入增加 $35,000.00，5.9 年后收回成本，表格显示净头寸在第 6 年首次转正，为 $2,000.00。","Ten years leave a net benefit of $142,000.00, or 68.3% of the cost.":"十年对比期留下 $142,000.00 的净收益，相当于成本的 68.3%。","This is a case where the comparison period matters.":"这是对比期长短很关键的一个例子。","A comparison period 25% shorter (7.5 years) leaves a net benefit of $54,500.00, and a 10% lower post-degree salary lowers it by $65,000.00.":"对比期缩短 25%（7.5 年），净收益为 $54,500.00；毕业后薪资降低 10%，净收益减少 $65,000.00。","Removing the aid lowers it by $32,000.00.":"取消资助会使其减少 $32,000.00。","The page does not discount future earnings or include loan interest.":"本页不对未来收入折现，也不包含贷款利息。","Use annual tuition and annual aid for the program length entered.":"请按所输入的项目时长，使用年度学费和年度资助。","Living expenses are absent from this form; include only extra study-related costs in a separate comparison rather than assuming tuition represents the full cost of attendance.":"本表单不包含生活开支；请只把额外的学习相关成本放进另一项单独对比，而不要以为学费就代表就读的全部成本。","For a hypothetical four-year course with $10,000 annual tuition, $2,000 annual aid and $20,000 foregone annual earnings, direct cost is $32,000 and foregone earnings add $80,000.":"以一个假设的四年课程为例：年学费 $10,000、年资助 $2,000、每年放弃收入 $20,000，则直接成本为 $32,000，放弃的收入再加 $80,000。","Total modeled cost is $112,000.":"模型总成本为 $112,000。","An annual earnings increase of $10,000 over ten years gives $100,000 benefit, a $12,000 net shortfall and about −10.71% ROI.":"每年收入增加 $10,000，十年带来 $100,000 收益，净亏损 $12,000，ROI 约为 −10.71%。","A higher annual salary can therefore coexist with a negative return over the selected comparison window.":"因此，在所选对比期内，年薪提高也可能同时伴随负回报。","Quick summary: Estimate graduate-school ROI using program cost and expected salary gain.":"快速摘要：根据项目成本和预期薪资增长估算研究生教育的 ROI。","Estimate graduate-school ROI using program cost and expected salary gain.":"根据项目成本和预期薪资增长估算研究生教育的 ROI。","6.7 years":"6.7 年","Reading the cost and break-even for a master-level program":"如何阅读硕士项目的成本和盈亏平衡点","A two-year program with $40,000.00 of tuition and $5,000.00 of aid per year costs $70,000.00 after aid, and the $130,000.00 of salary given up brings the total to $200,000.00.":"两年制项目，每年学费 $40,000.00、资助 $5,000.00，扣除资助后成本为 $70,000.00，放弃的 $130,000.00 薪资使总成本达到 $200,000.00。","A $30,000.00 yearly increase recovers it after 6.7 years, and the table turns positive in year 7.":"每年增加 $30,000.00，6.7 年后收回成本，表格在第 7 年转为正数。","Ten years leave a $100,000.00 net benefit, or 50.0%.":"十年对比期留下 $100,000.00 的净收益，即 50.0%。","The result is sensitive to the post-program salary: 10% lower leaves a net benefit of only $5,000.00, and 10% higher raises it to $195,000.00.":"结果对项目后的薪资很敏感：降低 10%，净收益只剩 $5,000.00；提高 10%，则升至 $195,000.00。","Removing the aid lowers it by $10,000.00.":"取消资助会使其减少 $10,000.00。","Because the cost is recovered after 6.7 years, any comparison period shorter than that leaves the net benefit negative.":"由于成本要 6.7 年后才能收回，任何短于此的对比期都会使净收益为负。","The foregone-earnings model assumes current earnings stop during the program.":"放弃收入模型假定当前收入在项目期间中断。","That can overstate the cost of part-time study while working, or understate a program with additional fees and borrowing costs.":"对于边工作边兼读的情况，这可能高估成本；而对于有额外费用和借贷成本的项目，则可能低估成本。","Compare a separate realistic cash-flow budget.":"请另做一份切合实际的现金流预算来对照。","For a hypothetical two-year graduate program with $25,000 annual tuition, $5,000 annual aid and $60,000 current earnings, direct cost is $40,000 and foregone earnings are $120,000.":"以一个假设的两年制研究生项目为例：年学费 $25,000、年资助 $5,000、当前收入 $60,000，则直接成本为 $40,000，放弃的收入为 $120,000。","Total modeled cost is $160,000.":"模型总成本为 $160,000。","Raising expected annual earnings from $60,000 to $80,000 for ten comparison years gives $200,000 benefit, $40,000 net benefit and 25% ROI.":"把预期年收入从 $60,000 提高到 $80,000，对比十年，收益为 $200,000，净收益 $40,000，ROI 25%。","The modeled cost takes eight years of that $20,000 annual increase to recover, before taxes or discounting.":"按每年增加 $20,000 计算，模型成本需要八年才能收回，且未计税费或折现。","no change":"无变化","Each row changes one thing and re-runs the calculator’s own arithmetic on the numbers you entered. These are comparisons, not quotes or forecasts.":"每一行只改变一项，并用您输入的数字重新运行计算器自身的算术。这些只是对比，不是报价或预测。","Where the total comes from":"总额的构成来源","The legal fee is the larger of the hourly work (hours x rate) and the flat, package or minimum fee. The flat figure works as a floor, not as a second fee on top.":"律师费取按小时工作（小时数 x 费率）与固定、套餐或最低费用中较大的一个。固定金额相当于下限，而不是额外再加一笔费用。","Court, specialist and other costs are added after that, exactly as entered.":"法院、专家及其他费用随后按您输入的金额原样相加。","Real engagements can bill retainers, trust deposits, tax or travel differently; this page does not model them.":"实际委托可能以不同方式收取预付金、信托存款、税费或差旅费；本页不对这些建模。","Legal fee: the two candidates":"律师费：两个候选方案","Candidate":"方案","Amount":"金额","Used?":"是否采用？","Hourly work ({0} h x {1})":"按小时工作（{0} 小时 x {1}）","No":"否","Yes, larger":"是，金额较大","Flat, package or minimum fee":"固定、套餐或最低费用","Only the larger candidate goes into the total. The two are not added together, so the table above has no share column.":"只有较大的方案计入总额。两者不会相加，所以上表没有占比一列。","What the total is made of":"总额由什么构成","Line":"项目","Share of total":"占总额比例","Legal fee used ({0})":"采用的律师费（{0}）","flat fee":"固定费用","hourly work":"按小时工作","Court, filing and government fees":"法院、立案和政府规费","Specialist and professional fees":"专家和专业人员费用","Other case-related costs":"其他案件相关费用","Estimated total":"估算总额","Break-even: hourly work passes the flat fee at {0} hours ({1} / {2}). Below that, this model keeps the flat fee; above it, each extra hour adds {2}.":"盈亏平衡点：按小时工作在 {0} 小时时超过固定费用（{1} / {2}）。低于此值，本模型采用固定费用；高于此值，每多一小时增加 {2}。","What if the hours or rate were different?":"如果小时数或费率不同会怎样？","As entered":"按输入值","Hours 25% lower":"小时数减少 25%","Hours 25% higher":"小时数增加 25%","Hourly rate 10% higher":"小时费率提高 10%","Hourly rate 10% lower":"小时费率降低 10%","No hourly work (flat fee only)":"没有按小时工作（仅固定费用）","Estimated total under changed hours or rate":"小时数或费率变化后的估算总额","Scenario":"情景","Total":"总额","Change":"变化","From ad spend to profit":"从广告支出到利润","Clicks come from spend and CPM: impressions = spend / CPM x 1,000, then clicks = impressions x click-through rate.":"点击数由支出和 CPM 得出：展示次数 = 支出 / CPM x 1,000，然后点击数 = 展示次数 x 点击率。","Clicks come from spend divided by the average cost per click.":"点击数 = 支出除以平均单次点击成本。","Profit is revenue x gross margin, minus the ad spend and the other campaign costs. ROI divides that profit by spend plus other costs.":"利润 = 收入 x 毛利率，再减去广告支出和其他活动成本。ROI 等于该利润除以支出加其他成本。","ROAS here is revenue divided by ad spend only, so it ignores the other campaign costs that ROI includes.":"这里的 ROAS 只是收入除以广告支出，因此忽略了 ROI 所包含的其他活动成本。","The model assumes the rates you enter hold at any spend level. Real campaigns usually do not.":"模型假定您输入的各项比率在任何支出水平下都保持不变。真实的广告活动通常并非如此。","Funnel and profit for the entered campaign":"所输入广告活动的漏斗和利润","Step":"步骤","Result":"结果","Clicks":"点击数","Conversions ({0}% of clicks)":"转化数（占点击的 {0}%）","Revenue":"收入","Gross profit ({0}% margin)":"毛利（毛利率 {0}%）","Less ad spend":"减：广告支出","Less other campaign costs":"减：其他活动成本","Profit":"利润","ROI":"ROI","Undefined (zero cost)":"未定义（成本为零）","ROAS (revenue / ad spend)":"ROAS（收入 / 广告支出）","Break-even: at your other inputs the conversion rate must reach {0}% for profit to be zero (above 100%, so this campaign cannot break even as entered).":"盈亏平衡：在您其他输入不变的情况下，转化率需达到 {0}% 利润才为零（超过 100%，因此按所输入的数据这个广告活动无法保本）。","Break-even: at your other inputs the conversion rate must reach {0}% for profit to be zero.":"盈亏平衡：在您其他输入不变的情况下，转化率需达到 {0}% 利润才为零。","Revenue must reach {0} (ROAS {1}x) to cover spend plus other costs at this margin.":"按此毛利率，收入需达到 {0}（ROAS {1}x）才能覆盖支出和其他成本。","Cost per conversion: {0}.":"单次转化成本：{0}。","What if the rates were different?":"如果各项比率不同会怎样？","Conversion rate 25% lower":"转化率降低 25%","Conversion rate 25% higher":"转化率提高 25%","Click-through rate 25% lower":"点击率降低 25%","Click-through rate 25% higher":"点击率提高 25%","CPM 20% higher":"CPM 提高 20%","Cost per click 20% higher":"单次点击成本提高 20%","Gross margin 10% lower":"毛利率降低 10%","Profit and ROI under changed rates":"比率变化后的利润和 ROI","Change in profit":"利润变化","The total adds readiness, assessment and remediation amounts, twelve months of tooling, and training for every employee entered.":"总额包括准备、评估和整改金额，十二个月的工具费用，以及所输入每位员工的培训费用。","This page does not say which of these repeat every year. Tooling and training often do, but only your own scope and quotes can settle that, so the table keeps each line separate.":"本页不说明其中哪些每年都会重复发生。工具和培训常常如此，但只有您自己的范围和报价才能确定，因此表格把每一项分开列出。","Amounts are the ones you enter. The page does not look up fees or scope requirements.":"金额均为您输入的数值。本页不会查询费用或范围要求。","Lines that make up the estimated total":"构成估算总额的各项","Readiness and consulting":"准备与咨询","Assessment or audit":"评估或审计","Technical remediation":"技术整改","Tooling ({0} x 12 months)":"工具（{0} x 12 个月）","Training ({0} x {1})":"培训（{0} x {1}）","Per employee: {0} across {1} employees or in-scope users. Of the total, {2} comes from the tooling and training lines.":"人均：{0}，覆盖 {1} 名员工或范围内用户。总额中有 {2} 来自工具和培训两项。","What if the scope were different?":"如果范围不同会怎样？","Half the employees in scope":"范围内员工减半","Twice the employees in scope":"范围内员工翻倍","Remediation budget 25% lower":"整改预算降低 25%","Remediation budget 25% higher":"整改预算提高 25%","Tooling 6 months instead of 12":"工具费用 6 个月而不是 12 个月","Estimated total under changed scope":"范围变化后的估算总额","Cost, gain and break-even":"成本、收益与盈亏平衡","Cost is tuition minus aid for each program year (not below zero), plus the earnings you give up while studying.":"成本 = 每个学年的学费减去资助（不低于零），再加上求学期间放弃的收入。","Gain is the yearly earnings increase multiplied by the comparison years. Nothing is discounted, and loan interest, taxes and raises are left out.":"收益 = 每年收入增加额乘以对比年数。不做任何折现，贷款利息、税费和加薪均不计入。","If aid is larger than tuition, the extra is not counted as income.":"如果资助多于学费，多出的部分不算作收入。","Cost and gain for the entered program":"所输入项目的成本和收益","Tuition less aid ({0} years)":"学费减资助（{0} 年）","Earnings given up while studying":"求学期间放弃的收入","Total cost":"总成本","Yearly earnings increase":"每年收入增加额","Gain over {0} comparison years":"{0} 年对比期内的收益","Break-even: the cost is recovered after {0} years of the earnings increase.":"盈亏平衡：收入增加 {0} 年后收回成本。","That is inside the {0} comparison years.":"这在 {0} 年的对比期之内。","That is beyond the {0} comparison years, so the net benefit is negative.":"这超出了 {0} 年的对比期，因此净收益为负。","There is no earnings increase in this scenario, so the cost is never recovered.":"此情景下收入没有增加，因此成本永远无法收回。","Year by year after the program":"项目结束后逐年情况","Cumulative earnings increase and net position by year":"按年份的累计收入增加额和净头寸","Cumulative increase":"累计增加额","Net of cost":"扣除成本后","Only the first 15 years are listed. The comparison above uses all {0} years.":"仅列出前 15 年。上面的对比使用全部 {0} 年。","The bold row is the first year in which the net position is not negative.":"加粗的一行是净头寸首次不为负的年份。","What if the inputs were different?":"如果输入不同会怎样？","Earnings after the program 10% lower":"项目后收入降低 10%","Earnings after the program 10% higher":"项目后收入提高 10%","No grants or aid":"没有助学金或资助","Comparison period 25% shorter":"对比期缩短 25%","Comparison period 25% longer":"对比期延长 25%","Net benefit and ROI under changed inputs":"输入变化后的净收益和 ROI","Net benefit":"净收益","Calculation status:":"计算状态：","Estimate calculated":"已计算估算值","Check the waist, neck and hip measurements.":"请检查腰围、颈围和臀围的数值。","Enter positive measurements in inches and a positive weight in pounds.":"请输入以英寸为单位的正数尺寸和以磅为单位的正数体重。","These measurements do not produce a valid estimate.":"这些数值无法得出有效的估算结果。","Total payments simulated:":"模拟还款总额：","Compare two scenarios":"比较两种情景","Save a calculated baseline, change the inputs, then compare both sets of results.":"保存一个已计算的基准，修改输入，然后比较两组结果。","Each column uses its own displayed inputs.":"每一列使用其自身显示的输入。","Load starting example":"加载初始示例","Save baseline":"保存基准","Compare current":"比较当前","Copy comparison":"复制比较","Clear saved":"清除已保存","The saved comparison stays in this page’s memory.":"已保存的比较保留在此页面的内存中。","Reloading clears it.":"重新加载页面会将其清除。","Example figures illustrate the model; they are not current quotes or forecasts.":"示例数字仅用于说明模型，并非当前报价或预测。","Quick summary: Estimate body fat percentage using the U.S. Navy circumference method.":"快速摘要：使用美国海军围度法估算体脂百分比。","Guide language: English.":"指南语言：简体中文。","What this calculator does":"此计算器的作用","Estimate body fat from circumference measurements in inches.":"根据以英寸为单位的围度测量值估算体脂。","Invalid measurements produce an error, and fat mass is displayed in pounds.":"无效的测量值会产生错误，脂肪质量以磅显示。","How to use the calculator":"如何使用计算器","Choose male or female, then enter height, neck circumference and waist circumference in inches and body weight in pounds.":"选择男性或女性，然后输入身高、颈围和腰围（单位为英寸）以及体重（单位为磅）。","Women also enter hip circumference; the male formula ignores that field.":"女性还需输入臀围；男性公式会忽略该字段。","Select Calculate to see the estimated body-fat percentage and the fat mass in pounds.":"点击“计算”即可查看估算的体脂百分比和以磅计的脂肪质量。","Use a flexible tape held snug against bare skin without compressing it, and measure the same way each time.":"使用软尺紧贴裸露的皮肤但不要压紧，并且每次都用相同的方法测量。","Repeating each measurement and entering the average reduces noise.":"重复测量每个部位并输入平均值，可以减少误差。","How the calculation works":"计算方式","The implemented male formula is 86.010 x log10(waist - neck) - 70.041 x log10(height) + 36.76.":"所用的男性公式为 86.010 x log10(腰围 - 颈围) - 70.041 x log10(身高) + 36.76。","The female formula is 163.205 x log10(waist + hip - neck) - 97.684 x log10(height) - 78.387.":"女性公式为 163.205 x log10(腰围 + 臀围 - 颈围) - 97.684 x log10(身高) - 78.387。","All circumferences and height must be in inches.":"所有围度和身高都必须以英寸为单位。","Fat mass is body weight in pounds multiplied by the estimated percentage divided by 100.":"脂肪质量等于以磅计的体重乘以估算百分比再除以 100。","Worked example":"计算示例","Using the male formula with height 70 in, neck 15 in, waist 36 in and weight 180 lb gives about 21.25%, or 38.3 lb estimated fat mass.":"使用男性公式，身高 70 英寸、颈围 15 英寸、腰围 36 英寸、体重 180 磅，得到约 21.25%，即估算脂肪质量 38.3 磅。","Hip circumference is not used by the male formula.":"男性公式不使用臀围。","How to interpret the result":"如何解读结果","The main figure is the estimated share of body weight that is fat.":"主要数字是估算的体重中脂肪所占的比例。","Fat mass is that percentage times the weight you entered.":"脂肪质量等于该百分比乘以你输入的体重。","With the default male inputs (70 in, neck 15 in, waist 36 in, 180 lb) the page shows 21.25% and 38.3 lb.":"使用默认的男性输入（70 英寸、颈围 15 英寸、腰围 36 英寸、180 磅），页面显示 21.25% 和 38.3 磅。","The formula uses the logarithm of waist minus neck, so small measurement differences move the result noticeably.":"该公式使用腰围减颈围的对数，因此测量上的细微差异会明显改变结果。","With the same inputs, a 35 in waist gives 19.43% and a 37 in waist gives 22.99%.":"在相同输入下，腰围 35 英寸得到 19.43%，腰围 37 英寸得到 22.99%。","For that reason, compare readings taken the same way over time, and do not treat one reading as exact.":"因此，请比较以相同方式在不同时间测得的数值，不要把单次测量当作精确值。","As another reference, a woman entering height 65 in, neck 13 in, waist 30 in, hip 38 in and 140 lb gets 28.56% and 40.0 lb.":"另一个参考：一位女性输入身高 65 英寸、颈围 13 英寸、腰围 30 英寸、臀围 38 英寸、体重 140 磅，得到 28.56% 和 40.0 磅。","The status line only confirms the arithmetic succeeded.":"状态行仅表示算术计算已成功完成。","It is not a health category.":"它不是健康类别。","Assumptions and limitations":"假设与局限","This is a circumference-based estimate from the formulas shown, not a clinical measurement.":"这是根据所示公式用围度得出的估算值，不是临床测量。","Measurement technique and body proportions affect it.":"测量方法和身体比例都会影响结果。","The tool no longer assigns a health category from one set of cutoffs for everyone.":"该工具不再用一套适用于所有人的分界值来划分健康类别。","A calculated status means the arithmetic succeeded, not that a clinician validated the result.":"“已计算”状态表示算术计算成功，并不表示临床人员已验证该结果。","Common mistakes":"常见错误","Entering centimeters or kilograms.":"输入厘米或千克。","Height and all circumferences must be in inches, and weight in pounds.":"身高和所有围度必须以英寸为单位，体重以磅为单位。","Entering a waist equal to or smaller than the neck, which cannot produce a valid result and shows an error.":"输入的腰围等于或小于颈围，这无法得出有效结果并会显示错误。","Leaving the hip field blank or wrong for the female formula.":"使用女性公式时，臀围字段留空或填写错误。","Measuring the waist or neck at a different spot on each attempt.":"每次测量腰围或颈围时选择不同的位置。","A shift of 1 in changes the answer by about 1.5 to 2 percentage points at the default inputs.":"按默认输入，1 英寸的偏差会使结果相差约 1.5 到 2 个百分点。","Reading the number as a clinical result.":"把该数字当作临床结果。","Body-composition scans and clinician assessments measure differently.":"人体成分扫描和临床评估的测量方式不同。","Privacy":"隐私","This form needs your sex, a few body measurements and your weight.":"此表单需要你的性别、几项身体测量值和体重。","It does not ask for a name, photo, health record or contact details.":"它不会要求姓名、照片、健康记录或联系方式。","The calculation runs in your browser.":"计算在你的浏览器中运行。","Frequently asked questions":"常见问题","Why must waist exceed neck for the male formula?":"为什么男性公式要求腰围大于颈围？","The logarithm requires waist minus neck to be positive.":"对数要求腰围减颈围为正数。","Measurements that fail this condition cannot produce a valid estimate.":"不满足该条件的测量值无法得出有效估算。","Can I enter centimeters?":"可以输入厘米吗？","Convert them to inches first.":"请先将其换算为英寸。","The constants in the implemented equations assume inches.":"所用公式中的常数以英寸为单位。","Why does the result say Estimate calculated?":"为什么结果显示“已计算估算值”？","It confirms that the inputs produced a finite estimate.":"它确认输入得出了一个有限的估算值。","It is not a medical classification.":"它不是医学分类。","Quick summary: Estimate allergy immunotherapy visit and testing costs.":"快速摘要：估算过敏免疫治疗的就诊和检测费用。","Estimate allergy immunotherapy visit and testing costs.":"估算过敏免疫治疗的就诊和检测费用。","The starting figures are illustrative example inputs, not price quotes or coverage decisions; enter your own plan figures.":"初始数字只是说明用的示例输入，并非价格报价或承保决定；请输入您自己保险计划的数字。","Fill in each field, then select Calculate to update the results.":"填写每个字段，然后点击“计算”更新结果。","Number of injection visits:":"注射就诊次数：","the injection visits you are budgeting for the treatment period, counted as visits rather than individual allergens or vials.":"您为治疗期预算的注射就诊次数，按就诊次数计算，而不是按单个过敏原或药瓶计算。","Allowed cost per visit ($):":"每次就诊的认可费用（$）：","the plan-allowed (negotiated) amount for one injection visit from your plan documents or a provider estimate, not the billed charge.":"保险计划对一次注射就诊认可的（协商）金额，来自您的计划文件或医疗机构的估价，而不是账单上的收费。","Initial testing and serum costs ($):":"初始检测和血清费用（$）：","allowed amounts for one-time items such as testing and serum preparation, but only when they are not already inside the per-visit allowed cost.":"检测和血清配制等一次性项目的认可金额，但仅限于尚未包含在每次就诊认可费用中的部分。","Deductible remaining ($):":"剩余免赔额（$）：","how much of your plan deductible is still unpaid for the period this scenario covers.":"在本情景所涵盖的期间内，您的计划免赔额中尚未支付的部分。","Coinsurance after deductible (%):":"扣除免赔额后的共保比例（%）：","your percentage share of allowed charges after the deductible is met, from your plan documents.":"免赔额满足后，您对认可费用承担的比例，来自您的计划文件。","Copay per service ($):":"每项服务的定额自付（$）：","a fixed copay per visit only when your plan charges it in addition to coinsurance.":"仅当您的保险计划在共保之外另收每次就诊的固定定额自付时才填写。","Leave it at zero when the copay replaces coinsurance.":"如果定额自付取代了共保，请保持为零。","The calculator adds up allowed charges, applies your remaining deductible first, then adds your coinsurance percentage on what is left and a copay per visit.":"计算器先汇总认可费用，先扣除您的剩余免赔额，再对剩余部分按共保比例计算，并加上每次就诊的定额自付。","The patient total is capped at the allowed charges, and the insurer share is whatever remains.":"患者总额以认可费用为上限，保险公司承担的部分就是剩余的金额。","With the starting figures (40 visits, $40 allowed per visit, $800 other costs, $500 deductible, 20% coinsurance, $10 copay): allowed = 40 x $40 + $800 = $2,400.00; deductible applied = $500.00; coinsurance = 20% of $1,900.00 = $380.00; copays = 40 x $10 = $400.00; patient = $1,280.00; insurer = $1,120.00.":"按初始数字（40 次就诊，每次认可 $40，其他费用 $800，免赔额 $500，共保比例 20%，定额自付 $10）：认可费用 = 40 x $40 + $800 = $2,400.00；已适用免赔额 = $500.00；共保 = $1,900.00 的 20% = $380.00；定额自付 = 40 x $10 = $400.00；患者 = $1,280.00；保险公司 = $1,120.00。","Number of injection visits":"注射就诊次数","Allowed cost per visit ($)":"每次就诊的认可费用（$）","Initial testing and serum costs ($)":"初始检测和血清费用（$）","Deductible remaining ($)":"剩余免赔额（$）","Coinsurance after deductible (%)":"扣除免赔额后的共保比例（%）","Copay per service ($)":"每项服务的定额自付（$）","Total allowed charges":"认可费用合计","Deductible applied":"已适用的免赔额","Estimated insurer share":"保险公司预计承担部分","Applied additional copays":"已适用的额外定额自付","Reading the result":"如何解读结果","The patient estimate is capped at total allowed charges.":"患者估算金额以认可费用合计为上限。","When your inputs reach that cap, the insurer share reads zero and every further charge stays with you in this model.":"当您的输入达到该上限时，保险公司承担部分显示为零，在此模型中之后的每笔费用都由您承担。","The applied-deductible line shows how much of your entered remaining deductible was actually used.":"“已适用的免赔额”一行显示您输入的剩余免赔额中实际用掉了多少。","When allowed charges are smaller than the remaining deductible, no coinsurance applies in this model.":"当认可费用小于剩余免赔额时，此模型不会计入共保。","Insurer share is simply what is left of the allowed charges after your part.":"保险公司承担部分就是认可费用扣除您承担部分后的余额。","Compare scenarios by changing one input at a time so the effect of each assumption stays clear.":"比较不同情景时，每次只改变一个输入，这样每个假设的影响才清楚。","Entering billed charges instead of allowed amounts.":"输入账单收费而不是认可金额。","The model expects plan-allowed amounts; billed charges are usually higher and inflate every line of the result.":"模型需要的是保险计划认可的金额；账单收费通常更高，会使结果的每一行都偏高。","Counting testing or serum twice.":"把检测或血清重复计算。","If the per-visit allowed cost already includes these items, adding them again in the other-costs field double-counts them.":"如果每次就诊的认可费用已包含这些项目，再把它们填入“其他费用”字段就会重复计算。","Adding a copay that replaces coinsurance.":"加入了取代共保的定额自付。","Some plans charge a copay instead of coinsurance; entering both overstates the patient side.":"有些保险计划收取定额自付而不收共保；两者都填会高估患者承担的部分。","Assuming an out-of-pocket maximum applies.":"假定存在自付费用上限。","This form does not apply an annual out-of-pocket maximum, so it can overstate patient cost when your plan would have capped it.":"此表单不考虑年度自付费用上限，因此当您的计划设有上限时，可能会高估患者费用。","Reading the who-pays-what breakdown for a visit series":"解读一系列就诊的“谁承担什么”明细","With the starting figures the $2,400.00 of allowed charges splits into $500.00 of deductible, $380.00 of coinsurance and $400.00 of copays, so you pay $1,280.00 and the estimated plan contribution is $1,120.00.":"按初始数字，$2,400.00 的认可费用分为 $500.00 免赔额、$380.00 共保和 $400.00 定额自付，因此您支付 $1,280.00，计划预计承担 $1,120.00。","Because the copay is charged once per visit, the visit count does double duty here: 40 visits at $10.00 add $400.00, which is 16.7% of all charges and slightly more than the coinsurance line.":"由于定额自付按每次就诊收取，就诊次数在这里起到双重作用：40 次就诊每次 $10.00，共 $400.00，占全部费用的 16.7%，略高于共保一行。","The what-if table shows how little the quoted price moves this result.":"“假设情景”表显示报价对这一结果的影响很小。","Raising or lowering every charge by 10% changes your cost by only $48.00, since the deductible and copays are fixed amounts.":"把每项费用提高或降低 10%，您的费用只会变动 $48.00，因为免赔额和定额自付都是固定金额。","Removing the copays, or entering a deductible of zero, each lower the total to $880.00.":"取消定额自付，或把免赔额填为零，都会使总额降至 $880.00。","If your plan charges the copay on only some visits, the copay line here will be too high, so lower the copay amount to the average you expect per visit.":"如果您的计划只对部分就诊收取定额自付，这里的定额自付一行会偏高，请把金额调低为您预计的每次就诊平均值。","Why is the insurer share zero?":"为什么保险公司承担部分为零？","Because the deductible, coinsurance and copays you entered already reach the total allowed charges.":"因为您输入的免赔额、共保和定额自付已经达到认可费用合计。","The model caps the patient total at that amount, so nothing remains for the insurer in this scenario.":"模型将患者总额限制在该金额以内，因此在此情景中保险公司没有剩余承担部分。","Does this estimate decide what my plan pays?":"这个估算能决定我的保险计划会支付多少吗？","No. It is a simplified arithmetic model of the amounts you enter.":"不能。它只是对您输入金额的简化算术模型。","Actual coverage depends on your plan rules, network status and exclusions, which only your plan documents and insurer can confirm.":"实际承保取决于您的计划规则、网络状态和除外责任，这些只有您的计划文件和保险公司才能确认。","What if my plan has an out-of-pocket maximum?":"如果我的计划有自付费用上限怎么办？","This form does not apply one.":"此表单不考虑上限。","If your plan has a maximum, your real patient cost may be lower than the estimate; compare the estimate with the maximum in your plan documents.":"如果您的计划设有上限，您的实际患者费用可能低于估算值；请将估算值与计划文件中的上限进行比较。","Coverage, network status, negotiated rates, separate deductibles, exclusions and out-of-pocket limits can change the result.":"承保范围、网络状态、协商费率、单独的免赔额、除外责任和自付费用上限都可能改变结果。","Which charges belong in this scenario?":"哪些费用应计入这个情景？","Count injection visits rather than individual allergens in a vial.":"请按注射就诊次数计算，而不是按药瓶中的单个过敏原计算。","The testing and serum entry should exclude anything already included in the allowed cost per visit.":"检测和血清一项应排除已包含在每次就诊认可费用中的任何内容。","Let A = service count x allowed unit cost + other allowed charges.":"设 A = 服务次数 x 认可单价 + 其他认可费用。","The applied deductible is D = min(A, remaining deductible).":"已适用的免赔额为 D = min(A, 剩余免赔额)。","The model then adds your coinsurance on A - D and a copay per service, and caps the patient total at A; the insurer share is the remainder.":"然后模型对 A - D 计算共保，加上每项服务的定额自付，并将患者总额限制在 A 以内；保险公司承担部分即为余额。","Only the charges left after the deductible attract coinsurance, so a larger remaining deductible moves cost to the patient side one-for-one up to the allowed total, while each copay dollar moves it by one dollar per visit: across the starting 40 visits, every $1 of copay is a $40 change.":"只有扣除免赔额后剩余的费用才会产生共保，因此剩余免赔额越大，患者承担的费用就一对一地增加，直到认可费用合计为止；而定额自付每增加一美元，每次就诊就增加一美元：在初始的 40 次就诊中，定额自付每增加 $1，总额就变动 $40。","Coverage terminology":"承保术语","Use your plan documents or explanation of benefits to identify allowed charges and patient cost sharing.":"请通过您的计划文件或福利说明来确认认可费用和患者的费用分担。","HealthCare.gov’s coverage glossary":"HealthCare.gov 的保险术语表","explains these terms; it does not certify the assumptions entered in this calculator.":"解释了这些术语；它并不认证本计算器中输入的假设。","Quick summary: Estimate appendectomy out-of-pocket cost after insurance assumptions.":"快速摘要：根据保险假设估算阑尾切除术的自付费用。","Estimate appendectomy out-of-pocket cost after insurance assumptions.":"根据保险假设估算阑尾切除术的自付费用。","Number of services:":"服务项目数量：","the billable services in the scenario, normally 1 for a single procedure episode.":"情景中可计费的服务项目数，单次手术通常为 1。","Allowed cost per service ($):":"每项服务的认可费用（$）：","the plan-allowed amount for the procedure itself from plan documents or a provider estimate, not the billed charge.":"保险计划对手术本身认可的金额，来自计划文件或医疗机构的估价，而不是账单上的收费。","Medication, facility and other costs ($):":"药物、设施及其他费用（$）：","allowed amounts billed separately from the procedure, such as facility, anesthesia or medication charges, only when they are not already inside the allowed service cost.":"与手术分开计费的认可金额，例如设施、麻醉或药物费用，但仅限于尚未包含在服务认可费用中的部分。","a fixed copay per service only when your plan charges it in addition to coinsurance.":"仅当您的保险计划在共保之外另收每项服务的固定定额自付时才填写。","The calculator adds up allowed charges, applies your remaining deductible first, then adds your coinsurance percentage on what is left and a copay per service.":"计算器先汇总认可费用，先扣除您的剩余免赔额，再对剩余部分按共保比例计算，并加上每项服务的定额自付。","With the starting figures (1 service, $25,000 allowed, $7,000 other costs, $2,500 deductible, 20% coinsurance, $0 copay): allowed = 1 x $25,000 + $7,000 = $32,000.00; deductible applied = $2,500.00; coinsurance = 20% of $29,500.00 = $5,900.00; patient = $8,400.00; insurer = $23,600.00.":"按初始数字（1 项服务，认可 $25,000，其他费用 $7,000，免赔额 $2,500，共保比例 20%，定额自付 $0）：认可费用 = 1 x $25,000 + $7,000 = $32,000.00；已适用免赔额 = $2,500.00；共保 = $29,500.00 的 20% = $5,900.00；患者 = $8,400.00；保险公司 = $23,600.00。","Number of services":"服务项目数量","Allowed cost per service ($)":"每项服务的认可费用（$）","Medication, facility and other costs ($)":"药物、设施及其他费用（$）","On a large single procedure the insurer share usually dominates; the patient side is driven almost entirely by your deductible and coinsurance entries.":"对于金额较大的单次手术，保险公司承担的部分通常占大头；患者承担的部分几乎完全取决于您输入的免赔额和共保比例。","The patient estimate is capped at total allowed charges, so it can never exceed the allowed amount you entered in this model.":"患者估算金额以认可费用合计为上限，因此在此模型中永远不会超过您输入的认可金额。","The applied-deductible line shows how much of your entered remaining deductible was used.":"“已适用的免赔额”一行显示您输入的剩余免赔额中用掉了多少。","Hospital billed charges are usually far above plan-allowed amounts and inflate every line of the result.":"医院的账单收费通常远高于保险计划认可的金额，会使结果的每一行都偏高。","Counting facility or anesthesia twice.":"把设施或麻醉费用重复计算。","If the allowed service cost already includes facility or anesthesia, adding them again in the other-costs field double-counts them.":"如果服务认可费用已包含设施或麻醉费用，再把它们填入“其他费用”字段就会重复计算。","Treating the estimate as a coverage decision.":"把估算结果当作承保决定。","The model only combines the amounts you enter; it cannot say what your plan will actually pay for a procedure.":"模型只是把您输入的金额组合起来；它无法判断您的保险计划实际会为手术支付多少。","Reading the who-pays-what breakdown for a large single bill":"解读一笔大额账单的“谁承担什么”明细","The starting $32,000.00 of allowed charges breaks into $2,500.00 of deductible and $5,900.00 of coinsurance, so you pay $8,400.00 and the estimated plan contribution is $23,600.00.":"初始的 $32,000.00 认可费用分为 $2,500.00 免赔额和 $5,900.00 共保，因此您支付 $8,400.00，计划预计承担 $23,600.00。","At this size the coinsurance rate matters far more than the deductible: coinsurance is 18.4% of the charges and the deductible only 7.8%.":"在这个金额下，共保比例比免赔额重要得多：共保占费用的 18.4%，而免赔额只占 7.8%。","That shows in the what-if table.":"这在“假设情景”表中可以看到。","Meeting the deductible first lowers your cost by $2,000.00, while a coinsurance rate 10 points lower lowers it by $2,950.00.":"先满足免赔额会使您的费用减少 $2,000.00，而共保比例降低 10 个百分点则会减少 $2,950.00。","A 10% change in charges moves your cost by $640.00.":"费用变动 10% 会使您的费用变动 $640.00。","This page has no out-of-pocket maximum, so for a bill of this size compare the $8,400.00 with the maximum in your plan documents; if the maximum is lower, the maximum is the better guide to your cost.":"本页面没有自付费用上限，因此对于这种金额的账单，请把 $8,400.00 与计划文件中的上限进行比较；如果上限更低，则上限更能反映您的费用。","Why is my patient estimate only part of the bill?":"为什么我的患者估算金额只是账单的一部分？","Because the model splits allowed charges between you and the insurer using the deductible and coinsurance you entered.":"因为模型会用您输入的免赔额和共保比例，把认可费用在您与保险公司之间分担。","With typical entries the insurer carries the larger share of a high-cost procedure, but the actual split is set by your plan.":"按常见输入，高额手术中保险公司通常承担更大的份额，但实际分担方式由您的计划决定。","Actual coverage for a procedure depends on medical-necessity rules, network status, pre-authorization and exclusions, which only your plan documents and insurer can confirm.":"手术的实际承保取决于医疗必要性规则、网络状态、事先授权和除外责任，这些只有您的计划文件和保险公司才能确认。","A surgical episode can generate separate surgeon, facility and anesthesia claims.":"一次手术可能产生外科医生、设施和麻醉各自独立的理赔。","Combine only charges you intend to treat under one deductible and coinsurance assumption; a separate deductible or excluded service needs a separate scenario.":"只合并您打算按同一组免赔额和共保假设处理的费用；单独的免赔额或除外的服务需要另建一个情景。","With a single high-cost service, the remaining deductible and coinsurance rate are the levers: each extra $1,000 of remaining deductible moves $1,000 to the patient side, and each coinsurance percentage point moves 1% of the post-deductible remainder, $295.00 at the starting figures.":"对于单项高额服务，剩余免赔额和共保比例是关键因素：剩余免赔额每增加 $1,000，患者就多承担 $1,000；共保比例每提高一个百分点，就会变动扣除免赔额后余额的 1%，按初始数字即 $295.00。","Quick summary: Estimate braces treatment cost including appliances, orthodontist fees, imaging, retainers and possible insurance coverage.":"快速摘要：估算牙套矫正治疗费用，包括矫治器、正畸医生费用、影像、保持器以及可能的保险承保。","Estimate the cost of a full course of braces, including the quoted treatment price, orthodontist and facility fees, imaging, retainers and any insurance coverage you enter.":"估算一整个疗程牙套矫正的费用，包括报价的治疗价格、正畸医生和机构费用、影像、保持器以及您输入的任何保险承保。","Enter the number of treatment cases; one full course of braces for one person is one case.":"输入治疗病例数；一个人的一整个疗程牙套矫正算一个病例。","Cost per unit or treatment is the quoted price for one case.":"“每单位或每次治疗费用”是一个病例的报价。","Provider or specialist fee takes any orthodontist charge listed separately, and facility, imaging or laboratory fees take imaging or records charges on their own lines.":"“医疗机构或专科医生费用”填写单独列出的正畸医生收费，“设施、影像或化验费用”则分别填写影像或记录资料的收费。","Other related costs collects any remaining quoted items that do not fit the fields above.":"“其他相关费用”用于填写上述字段放不下的其余报价项目。","Enter the coverage percentage from your plan documents (the default of 35% is an example input, not a statement about any plan), the remaining deductible, and any copay not already folded into the percentage, then select Calculate to update the results.":"请根据您的保险计划文件填写承保比例（默认的 35% 只是示例输入，并不代表任何保险计划）、剩余免赔额，以及尚未包含在比例中的任何定额自付，然后点击“计算”更新结果。","The bill adds one case at $5,800 plus the fee fields: $5,800 + $500 + $250 + $450 = $7,000.":"账单由一个病例的 $5,800 加上各项费用字段组成：$5,800 + $500 + $250 + $450 = $7,000。","The $500 deductible comes off first, leaving $6,500, and 35% of that is $2,275.":"先扣除 $500 的免赔额，剩余 $6,500，其 35% 为 $2,275。","The $100 copay is added to the patient side, so the patient cost is $500 + $4,225 + $100 = $4,825, and the insurer contribution shows the remainder, $7,000 - $4,825 = $2,175.":"$100 的定额自付计入患者一方，因此患者费用为 $500 + $4,225 + $100 = $4,825，保险方承担部分显示为余额：$7,000 - $4,825 = $2,175。","Because the copay sits on top of the percentage split, the insurer line is $100 lower than 35% of the post-deductible amount.":"由于定额自付是在按比例分担之外另加的，保险方这一行比扣除免赔额后金额的 35% 少 $100。","Number of treatment cases":"治疗病例数","Read the main figure as the out-of-pocket cost under your entered assumptions.":"请将主要数字理解为在您输入的假设下的自付费用。","The deductible and copay row, $600 here, is the fixed part of your share that does not depend on the coverage percentage.":"“免赔额和定额自付”一行（此处为 $600）是您承担部分中的固定部分，与承保比例无关。","Because braces are priced per case, the per-unit line repeats the main figure and becomes useful mainly when comparing a quote that covers more than one case.":"由于牙套按病例计价，每单位一行只是重复主要数字，主要在比较涵盖多个病例的报价时才有用。","Splitting a quote incorrectly is the main risk: enter each quoted line in exactly one field, so the appliance price goes to cost per unit and a separate orthodontist charge goes to provider fee, never both.":"把报价拆分错误是主要风险：每个报价项目只填入一个字段，矫治器价格填在“每单位费用”，单独收取的正畸医生费用填在“医疗机构费用”，不要两处都填。","Working out 35% of the full $7,000 bill in your head overstates the insurer share, because the percentage applies only after the deductible.":"心算按完整的 $7,000 账单取 35% 会高估保险方的份额，因为该比例只适用于扣除免赔额之后的金额。","Treating the insurer line as a guaranteed payment ignores that it is only a remainder from your inputs.":"把保险方一行当作有保证的赔付，忽略了它只是根据您的输入算出的余额。","Reading the who-pays-what breakdown for a treatment plan":"解读治疗方案的“谁承担什么”明细","Here the 35% in the coverage field is the plan share of the bill after the deductible, so your share is the other 65%.":"这里承保字段中的 35% 是计划在扣除免赔额后对账单承担的比例，因此您承担其余的 65%。","On $7,000.00 of charges that gives $500.00 of deductible, $4,225.00 as your percentage share and a $100.00 copay: you pay $4,825.00 and the estimated plan contribution is $2,175.00.":"对 $7,000.00 的费用而言，这意味着 $500.00 免赔额、$4,225.00 的比例分担部分和 $100.00 定额自付：您支付 $4,825.00，计划预计承担 $2,175.00。","Most of the result sits in the percentage line, 60.4% of the charges.":"结果的大部分来自比例分担一行，占费用的 60.4%。","The what-if table shows what each assumption is worth.":"“假设情景”表显示每个假设的价值。","Ten more points of plan share lowers your cost by $650.00, a met deductible by $175.00 and no copay by $100.00.":"计划分担比例提高十个百分点可使您的费用减少 $650.00，免赔额已满足可减少 $175.00，没有定额自付可减少 $100.00。","If your plan states a dollar maximum for this benefit, compare it with the estimated plan contribution above; the page does not apply one, so it can understate your cost when the maximum is lower than what the percentage would pay.":"如果您的计划对这项福利规定了美元上限，请将其与上面的计划预计承担金额比较；本页面不考虑上限，因此当上限低于按比例应付的金额时，可能会低估您的费用。","Does the estimate show what my plan will actually pay?":"这个估算显示的是我的计划实际会支付的金额吗？","No. It applies the percentage and deductible you enter; it does not check eligibility, waiting periods or annual maximums.":"不是。它只应用您输入的比例和免赔额；不会核查资格、等待期或年度上限。","Confirm benefits with the plan before relying on the split.":"在依赖这一分担结果之前，请先向保险计划确认福利。","Why is the insurer contribution $2,175 and not 35% of the bill?":"为什么保险方承担 $2,175，而不是账单的 35%？","The percentage applies only after the $500 deductible, and the extra $100 copay moves that amount to the patient side: 35% of $6,500 is $2,275, less $100 is $2,175.":"该比例只在扣除 $500 免赔额之后适用，另外 $100 的定额自付把这笔金额转到患者一方：$6,500 的 35% 是 $2,275，减去 $100 即 $2,175。","Is the $5,800 starting price a typical cost for braces?":"$5,800 的初始价格是牙套的典型费用吗？","No figure on this page is a market rate.":"本页面上的任何数字都不是市场价格。","The starting values are example inputs; use the numbers from your own written quote.":"初始值只是示例输入；请使用您自己书面报价中的数字。","Quick summary: Estimate dental-implant treatment cost and potential out-of-pocket expense using editable implant, crown, imaging and insurance assumptions.":"快速摘要：根据可编辑的种植体、牙冠、影像和保险假设，估算种植牙治疗费用及可能的自付支出。","Estimate dental implant treatment cost per implant, including crown, imaging and specialist fees, and the potential out-of-pocket amount after the insurance assumptions you enter.":"估算每颗种植体的治疗费用，包括牙冠、影像和专科医生费用，以及在您输入的保险假设下可能需要自付的金额。","Enter the number of implants; the model prices per implant, so enter the one-implant price in cost per unit or treatment.":"输入种植体数量；模型按每颗种植体计价，因此请在“每单位或每次治疗费用”中填写单颗种植体的价格。","Provider or specialist fee takes any separate surgical or specialist charge, and facility, imaging or laboratory fees take imaging or center charges on their own lines.":"“医疗机构或专科医生费用”填写单独收取的手术或专科医生费用，“设施、影像或化验费用”则分别填写影像或机构收费。","Enter the coverage percentage from your plan documents (the default of 20% is an example input, not a statement about any plan), the remaining deductible, and any copay not already folded into the percentage, then select Calculate to update the results.":"请根据您的保险计划文件填写承保比例（默认的 20% 只是示例输入，并不代表任何保险计划）、剩余免赔额，以及尚未包含在比例中的任何定额自付，然后点击“计算”更新结果。","The bill adds 2 x $3,200 + $1,200 + $450 + $600 = $8,650.":"账单合计为 2 x $3,200 + $1,200 + $450 + $600 = $8,650。","The $1,000 deductible comes off first, leaving $7,650, and 20% of that is $1,530.":"先扣除 $1,000 的免赔额，剩余 $7,650，其 20% 为 $1,530。","The $100 copay is added to the patient side, so the patient cost is $1,000 + $6,120 + $100 = $7,220, and the insurer contribution shows the remainder, $8,650 - $7,220 = $1,430.":"$100 的定额自付计入患者一方，因此患者费用为 $1,000 + $6,120 + $100 = $7,220，保险方承担部分显示为余额：$8,650 - $7,220 = $1,430。","Dividing the patient cost by units gives $7,220 / 2 = $3,610 per implant.":"将患者费用除以数量，得到每颗种植体 $7,220 / 2 = $3,610。","Number of implants":"种植体数量","Read the main figure as the out-of-pocket cost for the whole quote under your entered assumptions, and the per-unit line as the per-implant share of it.":"请将主要数字理解为在您输入的假设下整份报价的自付费用，每单位一行则是其中每颗种植体分摊的部分。","The per-implant figure is the useful comparison when one quote covers two implants and another covers one.":"当一份报价包含两颗种植体而另一份只含一颗时，每颗种植体的数字才是有用的比较依据。","At low coverage percentages most of the bill stays with the patient, which the $7,220 against $8,650 split makes visible.":"承保比例较低时，账单的大部分仍由患者承担，$7,220 对 $8,650 的分担就说明了这一点。","Entering the total for two implants into cost per unit while units is 2 doubles the bill, because the model multiplies by the number of implants.":"在数量为 2 时把两颗种植体的总价填入“每单位费用”，会使账单翻倍，因为模型会再乘以种植体数量。","Entering a provider fee that is already inside the per-implant price counts it twice; place each quoted line in exactly one field.":"把已包含在每颗种植体价格中的医疗机构费用再填一次会重复计算；每个报价项目只应填入一个字段。","Expecting the insurer to pay 20% of the full $8,650 overstates its share, because the percentage applies only after the deductible and the copay then shifts another $100 to you.":"以为保险公司会支付完整 $8,650 的 20% 会高估其份额，因为该比例只适用于扣除免赔额之后的金额，而定额自付还会再让您多承担 $100。","Entering the full annual deductible when part of it is already met overstates your share.":"如果部分免赔额已经满足，却仍填入全年免赔额，会高估您的承担部分。","Reading the who-pays-what breakdown for a multi-implant bill":"解读多颗种植体账单的“谁承担什么”明细","Two implants at $3,200.00 plus $2,250.00 of provider, facility and other fees come to $8,650.00.":"两颗种植体每颗 $3,200.00，加上医疗机构、设施及其他费用 $2,250.00，合计 $8,650.00。","With 20% plan coverage after the $1,000.00 deductible, you pay $7,220.00, which is 83.5%, and the estimated plan contribution is $1,430.00.":"在 $1,000.00 的免赔额之后，计划承保 20%，您支付 $7,220.00（占 83.5%），计划预计承担 $1,430.00。","The page shows $3,610.00 per implant; that is the whole bill divided evenly, fees included.":"页面显示每颗种植体 $3,610.00；这是把整张账单（含各项费用）平均分摊的结果。","At a plan share this low, the coverage percentage and the charge level are the numbers that move your cost.":"在计划分担比例这么低的情况下，承保比例和费用水平是影响您费用的关键数字。","Ten more points of plan share lowers it by $765.00 and a 10% change in charges moves it by $692.00, while a met deductible saves $200.00 and no copay $100.00.":"计划分担比例提高十个百分点可减少 $765.00，费用变动 10% 会使其变动 $692.00，免赔额已满足可节省 $200.00，没有定额自付可节省 $100.00。","If a plan does not cover a part of the treatment at all, leave that part out of the charge fields and add it to the result yourself, since every entered charge is treated as covered by the percentage.":"如果保险计划完全不承保治疗的某一部分，请不要把这部分填入费用字段，而是自行加到结果中，因为所有输入的费用都按适用承保比例处理。","Why is the insurer contribution $1,430 when coverage is 20%?":"承保比例是 20%，为什么保险方承担 $1,430？","The percentage applies after the $1,000 deductible: 20% of $7,650 is $1,530, and the extra $100 copay then moves to the patient side, leaving $1,430.":"该比例在扣除 $1,000 免赔额之后适用：$7,650 的 20% 是 $1,530，另外 $100 的定额自付转到患者一方，因此保险方为 $1,430。","Does the result say what my plan will actually pay?":"结果能说明我的保险计划实际会支付多少吗？","No. The calculator does not check eligibility, annual maximums or waiting periods; it applies the percentage and deductible you enter.":"不能。计算器不会核查资格、年度上限或等待期；它只应用您输入的比例和免赔额。","Is $3,200 per implant a typical price?":"每颗种植体 $3,200 是典型价格吗？","It is only a starting input.":"它只是一个初始输入。","Prices are set by providers and their quotes, so treat every default here as a placeholder for your own figures.":"价格由医疗机构及其报价决定，因此请把这里的每个默认值都视为占位，用您自己的数字替换。","Quick summary: Estimate dermatologist visit costs after deductible, coinsurance and copays.":"快速摘要：估算在免赔额、共保和定额自付之后的皮肤科就诊费用。","Estimate dermatologist visit costs after deductible, coinsurance and copays.":"估算在免赔额、共保和定额自付之后的皮肤科就诊费用。","Number of visits:":"就诊次数：","the office visits you are budgeting for, counted as visits whether or not a procedure happens at each one.":"您预算的门诊就诊次数，无论每次是否进行了操作，都按就诊次数计算。","the plan-allowed amount for one visit from plan documents or a provider estimate, not the billed charge.":"保险计划对一次就诊认可的金额，来自计划文件或医疗机构的估价，而不是账单上的收费。","allowed amounts billed separately from the visit, such as pathology or medication charges, only when they are not already inside the per-visit allowed cost.":"与就诊分开计费的认可金额，例如病理或药物费用，但仅限于尚未包含在每次就诊认可费用中的部分。","With the starting figures (3 visits, $250 allowed per visit, $150 other costs, $500 deductible, 20% coinsurance, $40 copay): allowed = 3 x $250 + $150 = $900.00; deductible applied = $500.00; coinsurance = 20% of $400.00 = $80.00; copays = 3 x $40 = $120.00; patient = $700.00; insurer = $200.00.":"按初始数字（3 次就诊，每次认可 $250，其他费用 $150，免赔额 $500，共保比例 20%，定额自付 $40）：认可费用 = 3 x $250 + $150 = $900.00；已适用免赔额 = $500.00；共保 = $400.00 的 20% = $80.00；定额自付 = 3 x $40 = $120.00；患者 = $700.00；保险公司 = $200.00。","Number of visits":"就诊次数","When allowed charges are close to your remaining deductible, the patient side carries most of the cost and the insurer share is small, as the starting figures show.":"当认可费用接近您的剩余免赔额时，大部分费用由患者承担，保险公司承担的部分很小，初始数字就是这样。","The patient estimate is capped at total allowed charges; it cannot exceed the allowed amount you entered in this model.":"患者估算金额以认可费用合计为上限；在此模型中不会超过您输入的认可金额。","The model expects plan-allowed amounts; billed charges are usually higher and inflate every line.":"模型需要的是保险计划认可的金额；账单收费通常更高，会使每一行都偏高。","Counting procedures twice.":"把操作项目重复计算。","If the per-visit allowed cost already covers a biopsy or similar service, adding it again in the other-costs field double-counts it.":"如果每次就诊的认可费用已包含活检或类似服务，再把它填入“其他费用”字段就会重复计算。","Some plans charge a copay instead of coinsurance for office visits; entering both overstates the patient side.":"有些保险计划对门诊就诊收取定额自付而不收共保；两者都填会高估患者承担的部分。","Reading the who-pays-what breakdown for a short run of visits":"解读少量就诊的“谁承担什么”明细","Three visits at $250.00 plus $150.00 of other charges come to $900.00.":"三次就诊每次 $250.00，加上其他费用 $150.00，合计 $900.00。","The deductible alone takes $500.00 of that, 55.6% of the charges, and coinsurance adds $80.00 and copays $120.00, so you pay $700.00 and the estimated plan contribution is $200.00.":"仅免赔额就占去其中的 $500.00，即费用的 55.6%，共保再加 $80.00，定额自付再加 $120.00，因此您支付 $700.00，计划预计承担 $200.00。","When the bill is this small the deductible decides most of the answer.":"当账单金额这么小时，免赔额几乎决定了大部分结果。","The what-if rows make that visible.":"“假设情景”各行可以直观地看出这一点。","If the deductible were already met you would pay $300.00, which is $400.00 less.":"如果免赔额已经满足，您只需支付 $300.00，少 $400.00。","A coinsurance rate 10 points lower saves only $40.00, and removing the copays saves $120.00.":"共保比例降低 10 个百分点只能节省 $40.00，而取消定额自付可节省 $120.00。","Check the deductible field before anything else on this page: a remaining deductible that is higher or lower than you think changes the result more than the percentage does.":"在本页面上请先检查免赔额字段：剩余免赔额比您以为的更高或更低，对结果的影响比比例更大。","Why is my patient share most of the total?":"为什么我承担的部分占总额的大头？","Because allowed charges for a few visits are often close to the remaining deductible.":"因为几次就诊的认可费用往往与剩余免赔额相近。","Until the deductible is met in this model, the patient carries the charges; coinsurance only applies to what is left after it.":"在此模型中，免赔额满足之前费用由患者承担；共保只适用于扣除免赔额后剩余的部分。","Actual coverage depends on your plan rules, referral requirements, network status and exclusions, which only your plan documents and insurer can confirm.":"实际承保取决于您的计划规则、转诊要求、网络状态和除外责任，这些只有您的计划文件和保险公司才能确认。","Distinguish an office visit from a biopsy, pathology or other procedure billed separately.":"请把门诊就诊与单独计费的活检、病理或其他操作区分开。","Put those additional allowed charges in the other-cost field only when they are absent from the visit amount.":"只有这些额外的认可费用不在就诊金额中时，才把它们填入“其他费用”字段。","With modest allowed charges the deductible dominates: at the starting figures the $500 remaining deductible is most of the patient total, while copays scale with visit count, $40 per extra visit at the starting $40 copay.":"在认可费用不高时，免赔额起主导作用：按初始数字，$500 的剩余免赔额占患者总额的大部分，而定额自付随就诊次数增加，初始定额自付 $40 即每多一次就诊增加 $40。","Quick summary: Estimate hearing-aid devices, fitting, testing, warranty and out-of-pocket costs.":"快速摘要：估算助听器设备、验配、检测、保修和自付费用。","Estimate the cost of hearing aids per device, including fitting, testing and warranty charges, and the out-of-pocket amount after any coverage you enter.":"估算每台助听器的费用，包括验配、检测和保修收费，以及在您输入的任何承保之后需要自付的金额。","Enter the number of hearing aids; the model prices per device, so enter the one-device price in cost per unit or treatment.":"输入助听器数量；模型按每台设备计价，因此请在“每单位或每次治疗费用”中填写单台设备的价格。","Provider or specialist fee takes any separate fitting or specialist charge, and facility, imaging or laboratory fees take testing or center charges on their own lines.":"“医疗机构或专科医生费用”填写单独收取的验配或专科医生费用，“设施、影像或化验费用”则分别填写检测或机构收费。","The bill adds 2 x $2,800 + $500 + $250 + $350 = $6,700.":"账单合计为 2 x $2,800 + $500 + $250 + $350 = $6,700。","The $500 deductible comes off first, leaving $6,200, and 20% of that is $1,240.":"先扣除 $500 的免赔额，剩余 $6,200，其 20% 为 $1,240。","The $100 copay is added to the patient side, so the patient cost is $500 + $4,960 + $100 = $5,560, and the insurer contribution shows the remainder, $6,700 - $5,560 = $1,140.":"$100 的定额自付计入患者一方，因此患者费用为 $500 + $4,960 + $100 = $5,560，保险方承担部分显示为余额：$6,700 - $5,560 = $1,140。","Dividing the patient cost by units gives $5,560 / 2 = $2,780 per hearing aid.":"将患者费用除以数量，得到每台助听器 $5,560 / 2 = $2,780。","Number of hearing aids":"助听器数量","Read the main figure as the out-of-pocket cost for the whole quote, and the per-unit line as the per-device share.":"请将主要数字理解为整份报价的自付费用，每单位一行则是每台设备分摊的部分。","The per-device figure is the cleanest way to compare a one-device quote against a two-device package.":"每台设备的数字是比较单台报价与两台套餐最清楚的方式。","Entering the pair price into cost per unit while units is 2 doubles the bill, because the model multiplies by the number of hearing aids.":"在数量为 2 时把一对的价格填入“每单位费用”，会使账单翻倍，因为模型会再乘以助听器数量。","Entering a fitting charge in both provider fee and other related costs counts it once too many; each quoted line goes in exactly one field.":"把验配费同时填入“医疗机构费用”和“其他相关费用”会多算一次；每个报价项目只应填入一个字段。","Expecting the insurer to pay 20% of the full $6,700 overstates its share, because the percentage applies only after the deductible and the copay shifts another $100 to you.":"以为保险公司会支付完整 $6,700 的 20% 会高估其份额，因为该比例只适用于扣除免赔额之后的金额，而定额自付还会再让您多承担 $100。","Entering the full annual deductible when part is already met overstates your share.":"如果部分免赔额已经满足，却仍填入全年免赔额，会高估您的承担部分。","Reading the who-pays-what breakdown for a pair of devices":"解读一对设备的“谁承担什么”明细","Two hearing aids at $2,800.00 plus $1,100.00 of provider, facility and other fees come to $6,700.00.":"两台助听器每台 $2,800.00，加上医疗机构、设施及其他费用 $1,100.00，合计 $6,700.00。","With 20% plan coverage after a $500.00 deductible you pay $5,560.00 and the estimated plan contribution is $1,140.00, an average of $2,780.00 per hearing aid.":"在 $500.00 的免赔额之后，计划承保 20%，您支付 $5,560.00，计划预计承担 $1,140.00，平均每台助听器 $2,780.00。","The plan figure is lower than 20% of the post-deductible amount ($1,240.00) because the $100.00 copay is added to your side.":"计划金额低于扣除免赔额后金额的 20%（$1,240.00），因为 $100.00 的定额自付计入了您一方。","In the what-if table, ten more points of plan share lowers your cost by $620.00 and a 10% change in charges moves it by $536.00.":"在“假设情景”表中，计划分担比例提高十个百分点会使您的费用减少 $620.00，费用变动 10% 则会使其变动 $536.00。","Meeting the deductible or removing the copay each lowers it by $100.00.":"满足免赔额或取消定额自付，各可减少 $100.00。","To compare one aid with two, change the device count and read the per-device line.":"要比较一台与两台助听器，请更改设备数量并查看每台设备一行。","Why is the insurer contribution $1,140 when coverage is 20%?":"承保比例是 20%，为什么保险方承担 $1,140？","The percentage applies after the $500 deductible: 20% of $6,200 is $1,240, and the extra $100 copay moves to the patient side, leaving $1,140.":"该比例在扣除 $500 免赔额之后适用：$6,200 的 20% 是 $1,240，另外 $100 的定额自付转到患者一方，因此保险方为 $1,140。","No. The insurer line is the remainder after your entered share, not a coverage determination.":"不是。保险方一行是扣除您所输入的承担部分后的余额，并非承保裁定。","Confirm the benefit with the insurer before relying on the split.":"在依赖这一分担结果之前，请先向保险公司确认福利。","Is $2,800 per device a typical price?":"每台设备 $2,800 是典型价格吗？","It is a placeholder, not a market estimate.":"它只是占位值，并非市场估价。","The page has no price data of its own; your quote supplies the real numbers.":"本页面自身没有价格数据；真实数字由您的报价提供。","Quick summary: Estimate clear-aligner treatment cost with provider, scan, retainer and insurance assumptions.":"快速摘要：根据医生费用、扫描、保持器和保险假设，估算隐形矫治器治疗费用。","Updated November 25, 2026.":"更新日期：2026年11月25日。","Estimate clear-aligner treatment cost for a full course, including provider, scan and retainer charges and any insurance coverage you enter.":"估算一整个疗程的隐形矫治器费用，包括医生、扫描和保持器费用，以及您输入的任何保险承保。","Enter the number of treatment cases; one full aligner course for one person is one case.":"输入治疗病例数；一个人的一整个矫治器疗程算一个病例。","Provider or specialist fee takes any dentist or orthodontist charge listed separately, and facility, imaging or laboratory fees take scan or imaging charges on their own lines.":"医生或专科医生费用填写单独列出的牙医或正畸医生收费；设施、影像或实验室费用填写单独列出的扫描或影像收费。","Enter the coverage percentage from your plan documents (the default of 30% is an example input, not a statement about any plan), the remaining deductible, and any copay not already folded into the percentage, then select Calculate to update the results.":"输入保险计划文件中的承保比例（默认的 30% 只是示例输入，并不代表任何计划）、剩余免赔额，以及尚未包含在比例中的定额自付，然后点击“计算”更新结果。","The bill adds one case at $6,200 plus the fee fields: $6,200 + $600 + $300 + $500 = $7,600.":"账单为一个病例 $6,200 加上各项费用字段：$6,200 + $600 + $300 + $500 = $7,600。","The $500 deductible comes off first, leaving $7,100, and 30% of that is $2,130.":"先扣除 $500 免赔额，剩余 $7,100，其中 30% 为 $2,130。","The $100 copay is added to the patient side, so the patient cost is $500 + $4,970 + $100 = $5,570, and the insurer contribution shows the remainder, $7,600 - $5,570 = $2,030.":"$100 定额自付计入患者一方，因此患者费用为 $500 + $4,970 + $100 = $5,570，保险方承担的部分显示为余额：$7,600 - $5,570 = $2,030。","Because the copay sits on top of the percentage split, the insurer line is $100 lower than 30% of the post-deductible amount.":"由于定额自付叠加在比例分担之上，保险方这一行比免赔额之后金额的 30% 少 $100。","With one case per person the per-unit line repeats the main figure; it becomes useful when comparing quotes that cover different numbers of cases.":"每人一个病例时，每单位一行与主要数字相同；在比较涵盖不同病例数的报价时才有用。","Entering each quoted line once matters most: the aligner course price goes to cost per unit, a separate provider charge goes to provider fee, and never the same amount in both.":"最重要的是每一条报价只输入一次：矫治器疗程价格填入单位费用，单独的医生收费填入医生费用，同一金额绝不能两处都填。","Comparing an aligner quote against a quote for a different treatment scope mixes unlike figures; keep comparisons within the same treatment plan.":"把矫治器报价与不同治疗范围的报价相比，会混用不同口径的数字；请在同一治疗方案内比较。","Working out 30% of the full $7,600 overstates the insurer share, because the percentage applies only after the deductible.":"按完整的 $7,600 计算 30% 会高估保险方份额，因为该比例只在免赔额之后适用。","Forgetting the $100 copay on top of the split understates your share.":"忘记在分担之外再加 $100 定额自付，会低估您的份额。","Reading the who-pays-what breakdown for a clear aligner quote":"如何阅读隐形矫治器报价的费用分担明细","A single case at $6,200.00 plus $1,400.00 of provider, facility and other fees comes to $7,600.00.":"一个病例 $6,200.00，加上 $1,400.00 的医生、设施和其他费用，合计 $7,600.00。","With 30% plan coverage after a $500.00 deductible, the page shows $500.00 of deductible, $4,970.00 as your percentage share and a $100.00 copay: you pay $5,570.00 and the estimated plan contribution is $2,030.00.":"在 $500.00 免赔额之后按 30% 承保时，页面显示免赔额 $500.00、您的比例份额 $4,970.00 和定额自付 $100.00：您支付 $5,570.00，计划预计承担 $2,030.00。","Your percentage share is 65.4% of the charges, so the plan percentage is the biggest lever.":"您的比例份额占费用的 65.4%，因此计划承保比例是影响最大的因素。","In the what-if table, ten more points lowers your cost by $710.00, a 10% change in charges moves it by $532.00, a met deductible saves $150.00 and no copay saves $100.00.":"在假设对比表中，承保比例再高 10 个百分点可使您的费用减少 $710.00，费用变动 10% 会使其变动 $532.00，免赔额已满可节省 $150.00，取消定额自付可节省 $100.00。","If the quote lists refinements or retainers as separate items, add them to the other-costs field once so the breakdown reflects the full bill.":"如果报价将精调或保持器列为单独项目，请只在“其他费用”字段中加入一次，使明细反映完整账单。","Why is the insurer contribution $2,030 and not 30% of the bill?":"为什么保险方承担 $2,030，而不是账单的 30%？","The percentage applies only after the $500 deductible: 30% of $7,100 is $2,130, and the extra $100 copay moves to the patient side, leaving $2,030.":"该比例只在 $500 免赔额之后适用：$7,100 的 30% 为 $2,130，额外的 $100 定额自付归患者一方，因此剩下 $2,030。","No. The result applies your entered percentage and deductible only.":"不是。结果只应用您输入的比例和免赔额。","It does not verify eligibility, age limits or plan maximums, so confirm the benefit with the plan.":"它不会核实资格、年龄限制或计划上限，请向保险计划确认该项福利。","Is the $6,200 starting price a typical cost?":"起始价格 $6,200 是典型费用吗？","It is an example input, not a typical-cost claim.":"它只是示例输入，并不是对典型费用的说明。","Substitute the figures from a written quote before reading the result as yours.":"在把结果当作您自己的情况之前，请换成书面报价中的数字。","Quick summary: Estimate IUI treatment and medication out-of-pocket cost.":"快速摘要：估算宫腔内人工授精（IUI）治疗和药物的自付费用。","Estimate IUI treatment and medication out-of-pocket cost.":"估算宫腔内人工授精（IUI）治疗和药物的自付费用。","Number of IUI cycles:":"IUI 周期数：","the treatment cycles you are budgeting for, counted as cycles rather than individual appointments within a cycle.":"您预算的治疗周期数，按周期计算，而不是按周期内的单次就诊计算。","Allowed clinic cost per cycle ($):":"每个周期的诊所认可费用（$）：","the plan-allowed clinic amount for one cycle from plan documents or a clinic estimate, not the billed charge.":"一个周期中计划认可的诊所金额，来自计划文件或诊所估价，而不是账单上的收费。","Medication and monitoring costs ($):":"药物和监测费用（$）：","allowed amounts billed separately from the cycle fee, such as medication and monitoring, only when they are not already inside the per-cycle allowed cost.":"与周期费用分开计费的认可金额，例如药物和监测，仅在它们尚未包含在每周期认可费用中时填写。","a fixed copay per cycle only when your plan charges it in addition to coinsurance.":"每个周期的固定定额自付，仅在您的计划在共保比例之外另行收取时填写。","Leave it at zero when the copay replaces coinsurance or when no copay applies.":"如果定额自付取代共保比例，或没有定额自付，请保持为零。","The calculator adds up allowed charges, applies your remaining deductible first, then adds your coinsurance percentage on what is left and a copay per cycle.":"计算器先汇总认可费用，先应用您的剩余免赔额，再对剩余部分按共保比例计算，并加上每个周期的定额自付。","With the starting figures (3 cycles, $1,200 allowed per cycle, $2,400 other costs, $1,000 deductible, 20% coinsurance, $0 copay): allowed = 3 x $1,200 + $2,400 = $6,000.00; deductible applied = $1,000.00; coinsurance = 20% of $5,000.00 = $1,000.00; patient = $2,000.00; insurer = $4,000.00.":"按起始数字（3 个周期、每周期认可 $1,200、其他费用 $2,400、免赔额 $1,000、共保比例 20%、定额自付 $0）：认可费用 = 3 x $1,200 + $2,400 = $6,000.00；应用的免赔额 = $1,000.00；共保 = $5,000.00 的 20% = $1,000.00；患者 = $2,000.00；保险方 = $4,000.00。","Number of IUI cycles":"IUI 周期数","Allowed clinic cost per cycle ($)":"每个周期的诊所认可费用（$）","Medication and monitoring costs ($)":"药物和监测费用（$）","The split between patient and insurer hinges on your deductible and coinsurance entries, not on the treatment price itself; the model only splits the allowed amount you enter.":"患者与保险方之间的分担取决于您输入的免赔额和共保比例，而不是治疗价格本身；模型只会分摊您输入的认可金额。","Counting medication twice.":"重复计算药物费用。","If the per-cycle allowed cost already includes medication or monitoring, adding them again in the other-costs field double-counts them.":"如果每周期认可费用已包含药物或监测，再在“其他费用”字段中重复添加就会重复计算。","Assuming the treatment is covered.":"假定该治疗在承保范围内。","The model splits whatever allowed amount you enter; it cannot say whether your plan covers this treatment at all, which only your plan documents can confirm.":"模型只会分摊您输入的认可金额；它无法判断您的计划是否承保该治疗，只有计划文件才能确认。","Reading the who-pays-what breakdown for a treatment cycle series":"如何阅读一系列治疗周期的费用分担明细","Three cycles at $1,200.00 plus $2,400.00 of medication and monitoring come to $6,000.00.":"三个周期，每个 $1,200.00，加上 $2,400.00 的药物和监测费用，合计 $6,000.00。","You pay $2,000.00, made up of a $1,000.00 deductible and $1,000.00 of coinsurance, and the estimated plan contribution is $4,000.00.":"您支付 $2,000.00，其中包括 $1,000.00 免赔额和 $1,000.00 共保，计划预计承担 $4,000.00。","The page shows $666.67 per cycle, which is an average: the deductible is paid once, so it spreads over however many cycles you enter.":"页面显示每个周期 $666.67，这是平均值：免赔额只缴一次，因此会摊到您输入的所有周期上。","In the what-if table, a deductible already met brings your cost to $1,200.00 and a coinsurance rate 10 points lower brings it to $1,500.00.":"在假设对比表中，免赔额已满时您的费用降为 $1,200.00，共保比例低 10 个百分点时降为 $1,500.00。","A 10% change in charges moves the total by $120.00.":"费用变动 10% 会使总额变动 $120.00。","Enter medication and monitoring once, in the second charge field, and only as amounts the plan allows; entering them in both fields counts them twice and raises every line in the breakdown.":"药物和监测只在第二个费用字段中输入一次，并且只填写计划认可的金额；两个字段都填会重复计算，并使明细中的每一行都升高。","Why budget per cycle instead of per appointment?":"为什么按周期而不是按就诊次数预算？","Because the model multiplies one allowed cost by the cycle count and then adds the separate medication and monitoring entry once.":"因为模型把一个认可费用乘以周期数，然后只加一次单独的药物和监测输入。","Entering appointments instead of cycles would mix two different units and distort the total.":"输入就诊次数而不是周期数会混用两种不同单位，并使总额失真。","Coverage for fertility treatment varies widely by plan and may be excluded entirely; only your plan documents and insurer can confirm what applies to you.":"生育治疗的承保范围因计划差异很大，也可能被完全排除；只有您的计划文件和保险公司才能确认适用于您的内容。","The service count represents the quoted insemination cycles.":"服务数量代表报价中的人工授精周期数。","Monitoring, medication and laboratory work can be separate; the entered total does not predict the number of cycles required or treatment success.":"监测、药物和实验室检查可能单独计费；输入的总额不能预测所需周期数或治疗是否成功。","The separate medication and monitoring entry is a large share of allowed charges here: at the starting figures it is $2,400 of $6,000, and every dollar in it flows through the same deductible and coinsurance split as the cycle fees.":"在这里，单独的药物和监测输入占认可费用的很大比例：按起始数字为 $6,000 中的 $2,400，其中每一美元都与周期费用一样经过相同的免赔额和共保分担。","Quick summary: Estimate LASIK procedure and out-of-pocket costs for one or both eyes with consultation, facility and financing-related assumptions.":"快速摘要：根据咨询、设施和融资相关假设，估算单眼或双眼 LASIK 手术费用及自付费用。","Estimate LASIK cost for one or both eyes, including surgeon, facility and imaging charges, and the out-of-pocket amount after any coverage and deductible you enter.":"估算单眼或双眼 LASIK 费用，包括外科医生、设施和影像收费，以及在您输入的承保和免赔额之后的自付金额。","Enter the number of eyes being treated; the model prices per eye, so enter the one-eye price in cost per unit or treatment.":"输入接受治疗的眼睛数量；模型按每只眼睛计价，因此请在“单位或每次治疗费用”中输入单眼价格。","Provider or specialist fee takes any surgeon charge the quote lists separately, and facility, imaging or laboratory fees take center, measurement or imaging charges listed on their own lines.":"医生或专科医生费用填写报价中单独列出的外科医生收费；设施、影像或实验室费用填写单独列出的中心、测量或影像收费。","Estimated insurance coverage is the percentage from your plan documents; the default of zero is an example input, not a statement about what any plan covers.":"预计保险承保是计划文件中的比例；默认的零只是示例输入，并不说明任何计划承保什么。","Enter the remaining deductible and any copay that is not already folded into the percentage, then select Calculate to update the results.":"输入剩余免赔额和尚未包含在比例中的定额自付，然后点击“计算”更新结果。","The bill adds units times cost per unit plus the three fee fields: 2 x $2,400 + $250 + $350 + $150 = $5,550.":"账单为单位数乘以单位费用，再加三个费用字段：2 x $2,400 + $250 + $350 + $150 = $5,550。","The remaining deductible comes off the bill first, the coverage percentage applies to what is left, and any extra copay is added to the patient side, with patient cost capped at the bill.":"先从账单中扣除剩余免赔额，承保比例适用于剩余部分，任何额外的定额自付计入患者一方，且患者费用以账单金额为上限。","With the default 0% coverage and no deductible or copay, the patient owes the entire $5,550 and the insurer contribution is $0.":"在默认 0% 承保且没有免赔额或定额自付的情况下，患者需支付全部 $5,550，保险方承担 $0。","The panel also divides the patient cost by the number of units: $5,550 / 2 = $2,775 per eye.":"面板还会把患者费用除以单位数：$5,550 / 2 = 每只眼睛 $2,775。","Number of eyes":"眼睛数量","Read the main figure as the out-of-pocket cost under the inputs you entered, not as a price quote or a coverage decision.":"请把主要数字理解为按您输入数据得出的自付费用，而不是价格报价或承保决定。","The insurer contribution is the arithmetic remainder of the bill after the patient share; it is not a commitment from any plan.":"保险方承担的部分只是账单扣除患者份额后的算术余额，并不是任何计划的承诺。","The per-unit line is the cleanest way to compare one one-eye quote against another when packages bundle different items.":"当套餐包含的项目不同时，每单位一行是比较两份单眼报价最清晰的方式。","With coverage left at zero the result simply returns the entered bill, so the page also works as a plain per-eye cost adder.":"承保保持为零时，结果就是您输入的账单，因此本页也可以当作简单的单眼费用加总工具。","Entering the price for both eyes into cost per unit while units is 2 doubles the bill, because the model multiplies cost per unit by the number of eyes.":"在单位数为 2 时把双眼价格填入单位费用，会使账单翻倍，因为模型会把单位费用乘以眼睛数量。","Enter the remaining deductible in its own field; the calculator subtracts it for you, so a bill you reduced by hand and a deductible entry together take the deductible off twice.":"请在专门的字段中输入剩余免赔额；计算器会替您扣除，因此如果账单已手动减过，再填免赔额，就会扣除两次。","Putting a copay into other related costs and also into the copay field counts it twice.":"把定额自付同时填入“其他相关费用”和定额自付字段，会重复计算。","Comparing a one-eye quote against the two-eye patient total, instead of the per-unit line, misstates the gap.":"把单眼报价与双眼患者总额相比，而不是与每单位一行相比，会错误地表示差距。","Reading the who-pays-what breakdown when no coverage is entered":"未输入承保时如何阅读费用分担明细","The starting figures enter no coverage, no deductible and no copay, so the breakdown is plain: $5,550.00 of charges for two eyes, all of it on your side, $2,775.00 per eye, and $0.00 from the plan.":"起始数字未输入承保、免赔额或定额自付，因此明细很简单：两只眼睛共 $5,550.00 费用，全部由您承担，每只眼睛 $2,775.00，计划承担 $0.00。","The deductible-met row shows no change for the same reason.":"出于同样的原因，“免赔额已满”一行没有变化。","The rows that do move are the plan percentage and the charge level.":"会变化的行是计划承保比例和费用水平。","If an employer or plan contributes a share of the procedure, enter that share as the coverage percentage; each 10 points is worth $555.00 on these charges.":"如果雇主或计划承担手术的一部分费用，请将该部分作为承保比例输入；在这些费用下，每 10 个百分点价值 $555.00。","A 10% change in the charges moves the total by $555.00 as well.":"费用变动 10% 同样会使总额变动 $555.00。","Only enter a coverage figure from a document you have, since the page cannot tell whether a given plan covers this procedure.":"仅输入您手头文件中的承保数字，因为本页无法判断某个计划是否承保此手术。","Does the zero default coverage mean insurance never pays for LASIK?":"默认承保为零是否意味着保险从不支付 LASIK？","No. Zero is only a starting input, not a claim about any plan.":"不是。零只是起始输入，并不是对任何计划的说明。","If your plan documents a benefit, enter that percentage and confirm the details with the insurer before relying on the result.":"如果您的计划文件载明了某项福利，请输入该比例，并在依赖结果之前向保险公司确认细节。","Why does the patient cost equal the full bill in the starting scenario?":"为什么在起始情景中患者费用等于整张账单？","Coverage is 0% and the deductible and copay are zero, so the arithmetic passes the entire $5,550 bill to the patient.":"承保为 0%，免赔额和定额自付均为零，因此按计算整张 $5,550 账单都由患者承担。","Change any of those three fields and the split changes.":"更改这三个字段中的任何一个，分担结果都会随之改变。","Is $2,400 per eye a typical price?":"每只眼睛 $2,400 是典型价格吗？","It is an illustrative default, not a market rate or a recommendation.":"它只是用于说明的默认值，不是市场价格，也不是建议。","Replace every field with figures from a written quote.":"请把每个字段都换成书面报价中的数字。","Quick summary: Estimate psychiatrist visit costs after insurance assumptions.":"快速摘要：根据保险假设，估算精神科就诊费用。","Estimate psychiatrist visit costs after insurance assumptions.":"根据保险假设，估算精神科就诊费用。","the appointments you are budgeting for across the period, counted as visits.":"您在该期间预算的就诊次数，按次计算。","Medication and lab costs ($):":"药物和化验费用（$）：","allowed amounts billed separately from the visit, such as medication or laboratory charges, only when they are not already inside the per-visit allowed cost.":"与就诊分开计费的认可金额，例如药物或化验收费，仅在它们尚未包含在每次就诊认可费用中时填写。","With the starting figures (12 visits, $250 allowed per visit, $600 other costs, $1,000 deductible, 20% coinsurance, $40 copay): allowed = 12 x $250 + $600 = $3,600.00; deductible applied = $1,000.00; coinsurance = 20% of $2,600.00 = $520.00; copays = 12 x $40 = $480.00; patient = $2,000.00; insurer = $1,600.00.":"按起始数字（12 次就诊、每次认可 $250、其他费用 $600、免赔额 $1,000、共保比例 20%、定额自付 $40）：认可费用 = 12 x $250 + $600 = $3,600.00；应用的免赔额 = $1,000.00；共保 = $2,600.00 的 20% = $520.00；定额自付 = 12 x $40 = $480.00；患者 = $2,000.00；保险方 = $1,600.00。","Medication and lab costs ($)":"药物和化验费用（$）","For recurring care the visit count is the main driver: both the allowed total and the copay line scale with it.":"对于持续性的诊疗，就诊次数是主要驱动因素：认可总额和定额自付行都随之增长。","Many plans charge a flat copay instead of coinsurance for outpatient mental-health visits; entering both overstates the patient side.":"许多计划对门诊心理健康就诊收取固定的定额自付，而不收共保；两者都输入会高估患者一方。","If the per-visit allowed cost already covers medication management, adding medication again in the other-costs field double-counts it.":"如果每次就诊的认可费用已包含药物管理，再在“其他费用”字段中重复添加药物就会重复计算。","Reading the who-pays-what breakdown for recurring visits":"如何阅读多次就诊的费用分担明细","Twelve visits at $250.00 plus $600.00 of medication and lab costs come to $3,600.00.":"12 次就诊，每次 $250.00，加上 $600.00 的药物和化验费用，合计 $3,600.00。","You pay $2,000.00: $1,000.00 of deductible, $520.00 of coinsurance and $480.00 of copays.":"您支付 $2,000.00：免赔额 $1,000.00、共保 $520.00 和定额自付 $480.00。","That is $166.67 per visit on average, and the estimated plan contribution is $1,600.00.":"平均每次就诊 $166.67，计划预计承担 $1,600.00。","This model adds the copay on top of coinsurance rather than in place of it.":"该模型把定额自付叠加在共保之上，而不是取而代之。","That is why the copay line, 13.3% of the charges, sits beside a coinsurance line of 14.4%.":"因此定额自付一行占费用的 13.3%，与占 14.4% 的共保一行并列。","If your plan charges a copay instead of coinsurance for these visits, the page will overstate your cost; the what-if row with copays removed shows $1,520.00, and the row with the deductible met shows $1,200.00.":"如果您的计划对这些就诊收取定额自付而不是共保，本页会高估您的费用；取消定额自付的假设行显示 $1,520.00，免赔额已满的行显示 $1,200.00。","A 10% change in charges moves your cost by $72.00.":"费用变动 10% 会使您的费用变动 $72.00。","Why does the copay matter so much here?":"为什么这里的定额自付影响这么大？","Because it applies per visit.":"因为它按每次就诊收取。","Across many visits the copays add up to a large share of the patient side, as the starting figures show, while a single-visit scenario barely feels them.":"如起始数字所示，多次就诊时定额自付会累积成患者一方的很大一部分，而只有一次就诊时几乎感觉不到。","Actual coverage depends on your plan rules, network status and any visit limits, which only your plan documents and insurer can confirm.":"实际承保取决于您的计划规则、网络状态和任何就诊次数限制，只有您的计划文件和保险公司才能确认。","Use the allowed amount for the visit type being modeled, such as an initial consultation or a follow-up.":"请使用所模拟就诊类型的认可金额，例如初诊或复诊。","A medication charge or a different visit price should not be multiplied as though every appointment were identical.":"药物费用或不同的就诊价格不应被当作每次预约都相同而相乘。","Over many visits the per-visit copay compounds: at the starting figures the 12 copays add $480 to the patient side, so each $10 change in copay moves the total by $120, while coinsurance only touches the $2,600 left after the deductible.":"多次就诊时，每次的定额自付会不断累积：按起始数字，12 次定额自付为患者一方增加 $480，因此定额自付每变动 $10，总额变动 $120，而共保只作用于免赔额之后剩下的 $2,600。","Quick summary: Estimate tubal ligation out-of-pocket cost after insurance assumptions.":"快速摘要：根据保险假设，估算输卵管结扎术的自付费用。","Estimate tubal ligation out-of-pocket cost after insurance assumptions.":"根据保险假设，估算输卵管结扎术的自付费用。","With the starting figures (1 service, $7,000 allowed, $1,500 other costs, $1,500 deductible, 20% coinsurance, $0 copay): allowed = 1 x $7,000 + $1,500 = $8,500.00; deductible applied = $1,500.00; coinsurance = 20% of $7,000.00 = $1,400.00; patient = $2,900.00; insurer = $5,600.00.":"按起始数字（1 项服务、认可 $7,000、其他费用 $1,500、免赔额 $1,500、共保比例 20%、定额自付 $0）：认可费用 = 1 x $7,000 + $1,500 = $8,500.00；应用的免赔额 = $1,500.00；共保 = $7,000.00 的 20% = $1,400.00；患者 = $2,900.00；保险方 = $5,600.00。","The patient side is driven by your deductible and coinsurance entries; the model only splits the allowed amount you enter.":"患者一方取决于您输入的免赔额和共保比例；模型只会分摊您输入的认可金额。","Billed charges are usually above plan-allowed amounts and inflate every line of the result.":"账单收费通常高于计划认可金额，会使结果的每一行都偏高。","Assuming the procedure is covered.":"假定该手术在承保范围内。","The model splits whatever allowed amount you enter; it cannot say whether your plan covers this procedure or under what conditions, which only your plan documents can confirm.":"模型只会分摊您输入的认可金额；它无法判断您的计划是否承保该手术或需满足什么条件，只有计划文件才能确认。","Reading the who-pays-what breakdown for a one-time procedure":"如何阅读一次性手术的费用分担明细","The starting $8,500.00 of allowed charges splits into $1,500.00 of deductible and $1,400.00 of coinsurance, so you pay $2,900.00 and the estimated plan contribution is $5,600.00.":"起始的 $8,500.00 认可费用分为 $1,500.00 免赔额和 $1,400.00 共保，因此您支付 $2,900.00，计划预计承担 $5,600.00。","With no copay entered, the whole split comes from two inputs: the deductible still remaining and the coinsurance rate.":"未输入定额自付时，整个分担只来自两个输入：剩余免赔额和共保比例。","The what-if table isolates each.":"假设对比表会分别单独呈现它们。","With the deductible already met you would pay $1,700.00, which is exactly 20% of the $8,500.00, because a met deductible leaves only the coinsurance share.":"免赔额已满时您将支付 $1,700.00，恰好是 $8,500.00 的 20%，因为免赔额已满后只剩共保份额。","A coinsurance rate 10 points lower gives $2,200.00, and a 10% change in charges moves the total by $170.00.":"共保比例低 10 个百分点时为 $2,200.00，费用变动 10% 会使总额变动 $170.00。","If the procedure is billed as one package, enter the package price once rather than splitting it across both charge fields.":"如果手术按一个套餐计费，请只输入一次套餐价格，而不要拆分到两个费用字段中。","Why is my patient share this size?":"为什么我的患者份额是这个数额？","Because the model applies your remaining deductible first and then your coinsurance percentage to the rest of the allowed charges.":"因为模型先应用您的剩余免赔额，然后对其余认可费用按共保比例计算。","With a single procedure, those two entries set almost the entire patient side.":"只有一项手术时，这两个输入几乎决定了整个患者一方。","Coverage for this procedure depends on your plan rules, network status and any applicable mandates or exclusions, which only your plan documents and insurer can confirm.":"该手术的承保取决于您的计划规则、网络状态以及任何适用的强制规定或除外责任，只有您的计划文件和保险公司才能确认。","A procedure quote may combine professional and facility charges or list them separately.":"手术报价可能把专业费用和设施费用合并，也可能分开列出。","Confirm the covered allowed amount and the applicable benefit before applying one shared deductible to the entire episode.":"在对整个治疗过程应用同一笔免赔额之前，请确认承保的认可金额和适用的福利。","With one service the remaining deductible and coinsurance rate are the levers: each extra $500 of remaining deductible moves $500 to the patient side, and each coinsurance percentage point moves 1% of the post-deductible remainder, $70.00 at the starting figures.":"只有一项服务时，剩余免赔额和共保比例是关键因素：剩余免赔额每增加 $500，患者一方就多承担 $500；共保比例每提高一个百分点，就等于免赔额之后余额的 1%，按起始数字为 $70.00。","Quick summary: Estimate vasectomy out-of-pocket cost after deductible and coinsurance.":"快速摘要：在免赔额和共保之后，估算输精管结扎术的自付费用。","Estimate vasectomy out-of-pocket cost after deductible and coinsurance.":"在免赔额和共保之后，估算输精管结扎术的自付费用。","the billable services in the scenario, normally 1 for a single procedure episode including the follow-up check when billed together.":"情景中的可计费服务数，单次手术通常为 1，若随访检查一起计费也包含在内。","allowed amounts billed separately from the procedure, such as facility or medication charges, only when they are not already inside the allowed service cost.":"与手术分开计费的认可金额，例如设施或药物收费，仅在它们尚未包含在服务认可费用中时填写。","With the starting figures (1 service, $1,500 allowed, $200 other costs, $750 deductible, 20% coinsurance, $50 copay): allowed = 1 x $1,500 + $200 = $1,700.00; deductible applied = $750.00; coinsurance = 20% of $950.00 = $190.00; copays = 1 x $50 = $50.00; patient = $990.00; insurer = $710.00.":"按起始数字（1 项服务、认可 $1,500、其他费用 $200、免赔额 $750、共保比例 20%、定额自付 $50）：认可费用 = 1 x $1,500 + $200 = $1,700.00；应用的免赔额 = $750.00；共保 = $950.00 的 20% = $190.00；定额自付 = 1 x $50 = $50.00；患者 = $990.00；保险方 = $710.00。","For a lower-cost procedure the deductible, not the coinsurance rate, usually decides the patient side, as the starting figures show.":"对于费用较低的手术，通常是免赔额而不是共保比例决定患者一方，如起始数字所示。","Counting the follow-up twice.":"重复计算随访费用。","If the allowed service cost already includes the follow-up check, adding it again in the other-costs field double-counts it.":"如果服务认可费用已包含随访检查，再在“其他费用”字段中重复添加就会重复计算。","Some plans charge a copay instead of coinsurance for outpatient procedures; entering both overstates the patient side.":"有些计划对门诊手术收取定额自付而不是共保；两者都输入会高估患者一方。","Reading the who-pays-what breakdown for a low-cost procedure":"如何阅读低费用手术的费用分担明细","The starting figures give $1,700.00 of allowed charges: a $1,500.00 service plus $200.00 of other costs.":"起始数字得出认可费用 $1,700.00：$1,500.00 的服务加上 $200.00 的其他费用。","The $750.00 deductible is 44.1% of that, coinsurance adds $190.00 and the copay $50.00, so you pay $990.00 and the estimated plan contribution is $710.00.":"$750.00 免赔额占其中的 44.1%，共保增加 $190.00，定额自付增加 $50.00，因此您支付 $990.00，计划预计承担 $710.00。","For a total this small the deductible is the main lever.":"对于这么小的总额，免赔额是最主要的影响因素。","The what-if table shows that a deductible already met lowers your cost by $600.00, to $390.00, while a coinsurance rate 10 points lower saves only $95.00 and removing the copay saves $50.00.":"假设对比表显示，免赔额已满可使您的费用减少 $600.00，降至 $390.00，而共保比例低 10 个百分点只节省 $95.00，取消定额自付节省 $50.00。","A 10% change in charges moves the result by $34.00.":"费用变动 10% 会使结果变动 $34.00。","If the remaining deductible is larger than the charges, the page caps your cost at the charges and the plan share shows $0.00.":"如果剩余免赔额大于费用，页面会把您的费用限制在费用总额，计划份额显示为 $0.00。","Why is the insurer share smaller than my part?":"为什么保险方份额比我的份额小？","Because with a lower-cost procedure the remaining deductible consumes a large share of the allowed charges before coinsurance applies, as the starting figures show.":"因为对于费用较低的手术，在共保生效之前，剩余免赔额就占掉了认可费用的很大一部分，如起始数字所示。","That is a property of the amounts entered, not a coverage rule.":"这是所输入金额的特性，而不是承保规则。","A procedure package may include or exclude consultation and follow-up testing.":"手术套餐可能包含或不包含咨询和随访检查。","Enter those additional allowed charges once, and use the insurer’s applicable benefit rather than assuming the same coverage as an office visit.":"这些额外的认可费用只输入一次，并使用保险公司适用的福利，而不是假定与门诊就诊的承保相同。","At this scale the remaining deductible is the largest single patient component: at the starting figures it is $750 of the $990 patient total, while coinsurance touches only the $950 left after it.":"在这个规模下，剩余免赔额是患者一方最大的单项构成：按起始数字，患者总额 $990 中有 $750 是免赔额，而共保只作用于其后剩下的 $950。","coinsurance ({0}% of the amount after the deductible)":"共保比例（扣除免赔额后金额的 {0}%）","your percentage share ({0}% of the amount after the deductible)":"您的比例分担（扣除免赔额后金额的 {0}%）","entered copays ({0} x {1})":"已输入的定额自付（{0} x {1}）","entered copay":"已输入的定额自付","Who pays what in this estimate":"本次估算中谁承担什么","Every amount you entered is treated as a plan-allowed charge that the percentage applies to.":"您输入的每一笔金额都被视为计划认可的费用，比例适用于这些费用。","The deductible comes off first, then your share of what is left, then the copay you entered is added on top.":"先扣除免赔额，再计算您对剩余部分的分担，最后加上您输入的定额自付。","There is no out-of-pocket maximum, annual benefit limit or exclusion in this model, so real coverage may differ.":"此模型不包含自付费用上限、年度福利上限或除外责任，因此实际保障可能有所不同。","The plan figure is only what remains of the charges after your part. It is not a coverage decision.":"计划金额只是扣除您的部分后费用的余额，并不是承保决定。","Share of charges entered: you {0}, estimated plan contribution {1}":"所输入费用的占比：您 {0}，计划预计承担 {1}","You: {0}. Estimated plan contribution: {1}. Percentages are shares of the {2} of charges entered, rounded to one decimal. Amounts are rounded to cents, so displayed rows can differ from the total by a cent.":"您：{0}。计划预计承担：{1}。百分比为占所输入费用 {2} 的份额，保留一位小数。金额四舍五入到分，因此显示的各行之和可能与总额相差一分。","Split of the entered charges between you and the plan":"所输入费用在您与计划之间的分担","Share of charges":"占费用比例","Charges entered":"已输入的费用","You: deductible applied":"您：已适用的免赔额","You: {0}":"您：{0}","You pay in total":"您合计支付","Estimated plan contribution (what is left of the charges, an arithmetic remainder)":"计划预计承担金额（费用的剩余部分，即算术余额）","Capped: the deductible, your percentage share and the entered copays added up to more than the charges entered. Your total is held at the charges, and the copay line shows only the part that fits ({0} of {1} entered), so the rows above add up to your total.":"已封顶：免赔额、您的比例分担和已输入的定额自付之和超过了所输入的费用。您的总额以费用为上限，定额自付一行只显示能容纳的部分（已输入 {1} 中的 {0}），因此上面各行之和等于您的总额。","Your total per {0}: {1} ({2} over {3}).":"您每{0}的合计：{1}（{2} 除以 {3}）。","What if the numbers were different?":"如果数字不同会怎样？","Deductible already met (remaining = 0)":"免赔额已满足（剩余 = 0）","Coinsurance 10 points lower ({0}%)":"共保比例降低 10 个百分点（{0}%）","Plan share 10 points higher ({0}%)":"计划分担比例提高 10 个百分点（{0}%）","Copays removed":"取消定额自付","Charges 10% higher (deductible and copays unchanged)":"费用提高 10%（免赔额和定额自付不变）","Charges 10% lower (deductible and copays unchanged)":"费用降低 10%（免赔额和定额自付不变）","Your cost under changed assumptions, using the same arithmetic as the calculator":"在更改假设后您的费用，使用与计算器相同的算法","You pay":"您支付","Plan est.":"计划预计","Each row changes one thing and re-runs the calculator’s own arithmetic. These are comparisons of the figures you entered, not coverage determinations. Because the model applies no out-of-pocket maximum or annual benefit limit, a plan with one could cost you less than shown.":"每一行只改变一个条件，并重新运行计算器自身的算法。这些只是对您所输入数字的比较，并非承保裁定。由于模型不考虑自付费用上限或年度福利上限，设有这些上限的计划可能让您花费比所示更少。","tooth":"颗牙","visit":"次就诊","case":"例","cycle":"个周期","eye":"只眼睛","hearing aid":"台助听器","implant":"颗种植体","injection visit":"次注射就诊","service":"项服务","At least one order does not clear the debts within 100 years, so interest is not compared. A larger extra payment or higher minimums would be needed.":"至少有一种顺序在 100 年内无法还清债务，因此不比较利息。需要提高额外还款额或最低还款额。","Avalanche":"雪崩还款法","Snowball":"雪球还款法","Balance left":"剩余余额","Both orders give the same result here. That happens when the smallest balance also carries the highest rate, or when the budget clears everything at once.":"这里两种顺序的结果相同。当最小余额同时也是利率最高的债务，或预算可以一次性还清全部债务时，就会出现这种情况。","Compared with paying only the entered minimums in {0} order ({1} months, {2} interest), the extra {3} a month (freed minimums still roll over in both runs) saves {4} of interest and {5}.":"与按{0}顺序只支付所输入的最低还款额相比（{1} 个月，利息 {2}），每月额外还 {3}（两种情形中释放出的最低还款额都会转入下一笔债务）可节省 {4} 的利息和 {5}。","Debt {0}":"债务 {0}","Debt {0} is paid off in month {1} ({2}).":"债务 {0} 在第 {1} 个月还清（{2}）。","Debt {0} is paid off in month {1}.":"债务 {0} 在第 {1} 个月还清。","Debts cleared in this order":"债务的还清顺序","Enter a nonnegative extra payment.":"请输入不为负数的额外还款额。","Enter a positive monthly payment.":"请输入大于零的每月还款额。","Enter nonnegative balances, rates and minimum payments.":"请输入不为负数的余额、利率和最低还款额。","Interest":"利息","No debts":"没有债务","None":"无","Not available: payoff not completed within 100 years":"不可用：100 年内无法还清","Not repaid within 100 years":"100 年内无法还清","On these numbers, avalanche costs {0} less interest and finishes {1}. Snowball clears its first debt in month {2} against month {3} for avalanche.":"按这些数字，雪崩还款法的利息少 {0}，并且{1}完成。雪球还款法在第 {2} 个月还清第一笔债务，雪崩还款法则是第 {3} 个月。","On these numbers, snowball costs {0} less interest, which is unusual. Recheck the rates and minimums you typed.":"按这些数字，雪球还款法的利息少 {0}，这种情况并不常见。请重新检查您输入的利率和最低还款额。","Out of range":"超出范围","Paid":"已支付","Same debts, same monthly budget, two payoff orders":"相同债务、相同月度预算、两种还款顺序","Showing the first {0} of {1} years.":"显示 {1} 年中的前 {0} 年。","Snowball vs avalanche on your numbers":"用您的数字比较雪球还款法与雪崩还款法","These values exceed the calculation range.":"这些数值超出了计算范围。","Time to debt-free":"还清全部债务所需时间","Total interest":"总利息","When each debt disappears":"每笔债务何时还清","Year":"年份","Yearly figures are rounded to the dollar.":"年度数字四舍五入到美元。","in the same number of months":"月数相同","not cleared: {0}":"未还清：{0}","{0} (months {1}-{2})":"{0}（第 {1}-{2} 个月）","{0} at {1}% APR":"{0}，年利率 {1}%","{0} month":"{0} 个月","{0} months":"{0} 个月","{0} month sooner":"提前 {0} 个月","{0} months sooner":"提前 {0} 个月","{0} months ({1})":"{0} 个月（{1}）","{0} plan year by year":"{0}计划按年明细","{0} plan, year by year":"{0}计划，按年明细","{0} simulated through the 100-year limit (payoff incomplete)":"已模拟至 100 年上限，共 {0}（尚未还清）","{0} year":"{0} 年","{0} years":"{0} 年","Starting figures illustrate this model.":"初始数字用于说明此模型。","Enter your own measurements, quoted costs and applicable terms; this page does not retrieve live prices or provider rates.":"请输入您自己的测量值、报价费用和适用条款；本页面不会获取实时价格或医疗机构的收费标准。","Quick summary: Estimate root-canal, crown, imaging and related dental costs with editable insurance assumptions.":"快速摘要：根据可编辑的保险假设，估算根管治疗、牙冠、影像及相关牙科费用。","What this calculator estimates":"本计算器估算什么","Estimate root canal treatment cost per tooth, including crown, imaging and specialist fees, and the out-of-pocket amount after the insurance assumptions you enter.":"估算每颗牙的根管治疗费用，包括牙冠、影像和专科医生费用，以及在您输入的保险假设下需要自付的金额。","How to use it":"使用方法","Enter the number of teeth treated; the model prices per tooth, so enter the one-tooth price in cost per unit or treatment.":"输入接受治疗的牙齿数量；模型按每颗牙计价，因此请在“每单位或每次治疗费用”中填写单颗牙的价格。","Provider or specialist fee takes any separate specialist charge, and facility, imaging or laboratory fees take imaging or center charges on their own lines.":"“医疗机构或专科医生费用”填写单独收取的专科医生费用，“设施、影像或化验费用”则分别填写影像或机构收费。","Other related costs collects remaining quoted items that do not fit the fields above; if a quote prices a covered follow-up restoration apart from the procedure, that line belongs here rather than in the per-tooth price.":"“其他相关费用”用于填写上述字段放不下的其他报价项目；如果报价把需要承保的后续修复单独计价，这一项应填在这里，而不是计入每颗牙的价格。","Enter the coverage percentage from your plan documents (the default of 50% is an example input, not a statement about any plan), the remaining deductible, and any copay not already folded into the percentage, then select Calculate to update the results.":"请根据您的保险计划文件填写承保比例（默认的 50% 只是示例输入，并不代表任何保险计划）、剩余免赔额，以及尚未包含在比例中的任何定额自付，然后点击“计算”更新结果。","The bill adds one tooth at $1,450 plus the fee fields: $1,450 + $300 + $180 + $1,350 = $3,280.":"账单由一颗牙的 $1,450 加上各项费用字段组成：$1,450 + $300 + $180 + $1,350 = $3,280。","The $250 deductible comes off first, leaving $3,030, and 50% of that is $1,515.":"先扣除 $250 的免赔额，剩余 $3,030，其 50% 为 $1,515。","The $75 copay is added to the patient side, so the patient cost is $250 + $1,515 + $75 = $1,840, and the insurer contribution shows the remainder, $3,280 - $1,840 = $1,440.":"$75 的定额自付计入患者一方，因此患者费用为 $250 + $1,515 + $75 = $1,840，保险方承担部分显示为余额：$3,280 - $1,840 = $1,440。","Because the copay sits on top of the percentage split, the insurer line is $75 lower than 50% of the post-deductible amount.":"由于定额自付是在按比例分担之外另加的，保险方这一行比扣除免赔额后金额的 50% 少 $75。","This copay handling is the calculator's simplified arithmetic, not an insurance plan rule.":"这种定额自付处理方式是计算器的简化算法，并非保险计划的规则。","Worked example: starting scenario":"计算示例：初始情景","Example inputs":"示例输入","Number of teeth treated":"接受治疗的牙齿数量","Cost per unit or treatment ($)":"每单位或每次治疗费用（$）","Provider or specialist fee ($)":"医疗机构或专科医生费用（$）","Facility, imaging or laboratory fees ($)":"设施、影像或化验费用（$）","Other related costs ($)":"其他相关费用（$）","Estimated insurance coverage after deductible (%)":"扣除免赔额后的预计保险承保比例（%）","Remaining deductible ($)":"剩余免赔额（$）","Additional patient copay within the entered bill, not already in the percentage ($)":"已输入账单内、尚未包含在比例中的患者额外定额自付（$）","Example results":"示例结果","Estimated out-of-pocket cost":"预计自付费用","Estimated gross treatment cost":"预计治疗总费用","Estimated insurer contribution":"保险方预计承担金额","Deductible and copay included":"含免赔额和定额自付","Estimated cost per unit":"预计每单位费用","Read the main figure as the out-of-pocket cost under your entered assumptions, and the per-unit line as the per-tooth share when more than one tooth is quoted.":"请将主要数字理解为在您输入的假设下的自付费用；当报价涉及多颗牙时，每单位一行即为每颗牙分担的部分。","The insurer contribution is an arithmetic remainder, not a commitment from any plan.":"保险方承担金额只是算术上的余额，并非任何保险计划的承诺。","The deductible and copay row, $325 here, is the fixed part of your share that does not depend on the coverage percentage.":"“免赔额和定额自付”一行（此处为 $325）是您承担部分中的固定部分，与承保比例无关。","Important limitations":"重要限制","Use insurer-allowed charges for covered services.":"对于承保的服务，请使用保险公司认可的收费金额。","The model does not apply an annual benefit cap, out-of-pocket maximum, prior spending, exclusions or balance billing.":"该模型不考虑年度福利上限、自付费用上限、既往支出、除外责任或余额账单。","Every amount you enter here, including other related costs, is treated as covered by the percentage, so keep non-covered charges out of all fields and add them to the result yourself afterward.":"您在此输入的所有金额（包括其他相关费用）都按适用该比例的承保费用处理，因此请不要把不承保的费用填入任何字段，之后自行加到结果中。","Confirm copay/coinsurance treatment with the plan to avoid counting one cost twice.":"请向保险计划确认定额自付和共保比例的处理方式，避免把同一笔费用重复计算。","The patient and insurer split is not an adjudication of a claim; actual plans apply their own deductible, coinsurance and copay rules.":"患者与保险方的分担并不是理赔裁定；实际的保险计划有各自的免赔额、共保比例和定额自付规则。","Putting a separately quoted restoration into both other related costs and the per-tooth price counts it twice; each quoted line goes in exactly one field.":"把单独报价的修复项目同时填入“其他相关费用”和每颗牙的价格会重复计算；每个报价项目只应填入一个字段。","Working out 50% of the full $3,280 overstates the insurer share, because the percentage applies only after the deductible and the copay then shifts another $75 to you.":"直接按完整的 $3,280 计算 50% 会高估保险方的份额，因为该比例只适用于扣除免赔额之后的金额，而定额自付还会再让您多承担 $75。","Entering the plan's full annual deductible when part is already met overstates your share.":"如果部分免赔额已经满足，却仍填入计划的全年免赔额，会高估您的承担部分。","Comparing a per-tooth quote against a multi-tooth patient total, instead of the per-unit line, misstates the gap.":"把按每颗牙的报价与多颗牙的患者总额相比，而不是与每单位一行比较，会得出错误的差距。","Reading the who-pays-what breakdown for a single tooth":"解读单颗牙的“谁承担什么”明细","One tooth at $1,450.00 plus $1,830.00 of provider, imaging and related costs comes to $3,280.00.":"一颗牙 $1,450.00，加上医疗机构、影像及相关费用 $1,830.00，合计 $3,280.00。","With 50% plan coverage after a $250.00 deductible, you pay $250.00 of deductible, $1,515.00 as your percentage share and a $75.00 copay, $1,840.00 in all.":"在 $250.00 的免赔额之后，计划承保 50%，您需要支付 $250.00 的免赔额、$1,515.00 的比例分担部分和 $75.00 的定额自付，合计 $1,840.00。","The estimated plan contribution is $1,440.00, or 43.9% of the charges.":"计划预计承担 $1,440.00，占费用的 43.9%。","The other-costs field holds $1,350.00 here, 41.2% of the bill, so a quote that prices a crown or other follow-up separately changes the result a lot.":"此处“其他费用”字段为 $1,350.00，占账单的 41.2%，因此如果报价把牙冠或其他后续项目单独计价，结果会有很大变化。","In the what-if table, ten more points of plan share lowers your cost by $303.00 and a 10% change in charges moves it by $164.00.":"在“假设情景”表中，计划分担比例提高十个百分点会使您的费用减少 $303.00，费用变动 10% 则会使其变动 $164.00。","A met deductible saves $125.00 and no copay saves $75.00.":"免赔额已满足可节省 $125.00，没有定额自付可节省 $75.00。","Enter each quoted line once.":"每个报价项目只填写一次。","Why is the insurer contribution $1,440 when coverage is 50%?":"承保比例是 50%，为什么保险方承担 $1,440？","The percentage applies only after the $250 deductible: 50% of $3,030 is $1,515, and the extra $75 copay moves to the patient side, leaving $1,440.":"该比例只在扣除 $250 免赔额之后适用：$3,030 的 50% 是 $1,515，另外 $75 的定额自付转到患者一方，因此保险方为 $1,440。","Does the model account for which tooth or how complex the case is?":"模型会考虑是哪颗牙或病例的复杂程度吗？","No. It is arithmetic on the amounts you enter; complexity shows up only through the quoted prices you type in.":"不会。它只是对您输入的金额做算术运算；病例的复杂程度只会通过您输入的报价体现。","Is $1,450 per tooth a typical price?":"每颗牙 $1,450 是典型价格吗？","It is an illustrative default.":"这只是一个说明用的默认值。","The calculator stores no price ranges; enter the amounts from your own quote.":"计算器不存储价格区间；请输入您自己报价中的金额。","Sources and background":"资料来源与背景","HealthCare.gov: allowed amount":"HealthCare.gov：认可金额","HealthCare.gov: out-of-pocket limits":"HealthCare.gov：自付费用上限","The glossary links above define insurance terms only; they do not describe or endorse this calculator's formula.":"上面的术语表链接仅解释保险术语，并不说明或认可本计算器的公式。","Quick summary: Estimate monthly payment, total interest, and remaining balance after a selected number of years.":"快速摘要：估算月供、总利息，以及经过所选年数后的剩余余额。","Calculate a fixed monthly loan payment and the remaining balance after an elapsed number of years.":"计算固定月供，以及经过一定年数后的剩余余额。","Enter the loan amount in dollars, the annual interest rate as a percentage (type 6.5 for 6.5%), the loan term in years and the years already elapsed.":"输入以美元计的贷款金额、年利率百分比（6.5% 请输入 6.5）、以年计的贷款期限以及已经过去的年数。","The elapsed field accepts fractions such as 2.5.":"已过年数一栏可以输入 2.5 这样的小数。","Select Calculate to see the monthly payment, the total interest over the full term and the balance still owed after the elapsed time.":"点击“计算”，即可看到月供、整个期限内的总利息，以及经过已过时间后仍欠的余额。","To compare two loan lengths, run the page twice and change only the term.":"要比较两种贷款期限，请运行本页两次，只改变期限。","Set elapsed to 0 if you want the starting balance rather than a later one.":"如果想看初始余额而不是之后的余额，请把已过年数设为 0。","The extra monthly payment is optional.":"每月额外还款是可选的。","It is added to every scheduled payment.":"它会加到每一期按计划的还款上。","Leave it at 0 for the plain schedule.":"保持为 0 即为普通还款计划。","Above zero, the page also shows when the loan would end, the interest you would pay with the extra, and the interest saved.":"大于零时，本页还会显示贷款何时还清、加上额外还款后需付的利息，以及节省的利息。","A yearly table below the result shows interest, principal and the balance at the end of each year.":"结果下方的年度表格显示每年的利息、本金和年末余额。","Payment uses M = P x r / [1 - (1 + r)^(-n)], where r is the annual percentage divided by 1200 and n is term years x 12.":"月供使用 M = P x r / [1 - (1 + r)^(-n)]，其中 r 为年利率百分比除以 1200，n 为期限年数 x 12。","After k monthly payments, remaining balance is M x [1 - (1 + r)^(-(n-k))] / r.":"支付 k 个月后，剩余余额为 M x [1 - (1 + r)^(-(n-k))] / r。","At zero interest, payment is P/n and balance is P x (n-k)/n.":"利率为零时，月供为 P/n，余额为 P x (n-k)/n。","Reading the yearly table":"如何阅读年度表格","Each row adds up twelve monthly payments.":"每一行汇总十二个月的还款。","Interest paid is the part that goes to the lender, principal paid is the part that reduces the loan, and the balance is what is still owed at the end of that year.":"已付利息是支付给贷款方的部分，已付本金是减少贷款的部分，余额则是该年年末仍欠的金额。","Compare the first and last rows to see how the split shifts as the balance shrinks.":"对比第一行和最后一行，可以看到随着余额减少，这种分配如何变化。","With an extra payment the table shows two balance columns, one with the extra and one without it.":"有额外还款时，表格会显示两列余额，一列含额外还款，一列不含。","The gap between them is the head start the extra money buys.":"两者之间的差额就是额外资金带来的提前量。","The final year may cover fewer than twelve months, and its row says which months it covers.":"最后一年可能不足十二个月，其所在行会注明涵盖哪些月份。","For a 12,000 loan at zero interest over two years, monthly payment is 500.":"12,000 的贷款、零利率、期限两年，月供为 500。","After one year, 12 payments have been made and 6,000 remains.":"一年后已还 12 期，剩余 6,000。","Elapsed time at or beyond the full term gives a zero remaining balance.":"已过时间达到或超过整个期限时，剩余余额为零。","For an extra payment, take the default loan of 300,000 at 6.5% for 30 years and add 200 a month.":"以额外还款为例，取默认贷款 300,000、利率 6.5%、期限 30 年，并每月多还 200。","The payment becomes about 2,096.20, the loan ends after 23 years and 1 month (277 payments instead of 360), total interest falls from $382,633.47 to $279,184.67, and $103,448.79 of interest is saved.":"月供变为约 2,096.20，贷款在 23 年 1 个月后还清（277 期，而不是 360 期），总利息从 $382,633.47 降到 $279,184.67，节省利息 $103,448.79。","The last payment is smaller than the others.":"最后一期还款比其他期少。","The large figure is the fixed principal-and-interest payment due each month.":"大号数字是每月固定的本息还款额。","Total interest is that payment times every scheduled month, minus the loan amount.":"总利息等于该月供乘以所有还款月数，再减去贷款金额。","With the default inputs (300,000 at 6.5% for 30 years) the payment is $1,896.20, total interest is $382,633.47, and after 5 years $280,832.93 is still owed, so five years of payments repaid about $19,167 of principal.":"使用默认输入（300,000、6.5%、30 年）时，月供为 $1,896.20，总利息为 $382,633.47，5 年后仍欠 $280,832.93，也就是五年的还款只偿还了约 $19,167 的本金。","The first row of the yearly table shows the same pattern in a different way.":"年度表格的第一行以另一种方式显示了同样的规律。","In year 1 of the default loan, $19,401.27 of the $22,754.45 paid is interest, about 85%.":"在默认贷款的第 1 年，所付 $22,754.45 中有 $19,401.27 是利息，约占 85%。","By the last year almost the whole payment is principal.":"到最后一年，几乎整笔还款都是本金。","Changing only the term to 15 years raises the payment to $2,613.32 and cuts total interest to $170,397.98.":"只把期限改为 15 年，月供升至 $2,613.32，总利息降至 $170,397.98。","A shorter term costs more each month and less overall.":"期限越短，每月支付越多，但总成本越低。","This tool assumes scheduled payments and a fixed rate.":"本工具假定按计划还款且利率固定。","The optional extra payment is assumed to go to principal every month with no prepayment penalty, and the page does not model missed payments, late fees, daily interest conventions or insurance.":"假定可选的额外还款每月都用于偿还本金且没有提前还款罚金；本页不模拟漏缴、滞纳金、按日计息惯例或保险。","The remaining-balance line follows the scheduled payments only and ignores the extra.":"剩余余额一行只按计划还款计算，不含额外还款。","The yearly table and the extra-payment lines need a term that is a whole number of months, and they do not round each payment to the cent.":"年度表格和额外还款各行要求期限为整数月，并且不会把每期还款四舍五入到分。","Fractional years represent an equivalent elapsed monthly period rather than a dated payment history.":"小数年数表示等效的已过月数，而不是带日期的还款记录。","Typing the rate as a decimal (0.065) instead of a percentage (6.5) gives a much lower payment than the real loan.":"把利率输入为小数（0.065）而不是百分数（6.5），得到的月供会远低于真实贷款。","Entering the term in months instead of years.":"把期限输入为月数而不是年数。","A 360 in the years field is a 360-year loan.":"在“年”一栏填 360，就是一笔 360 年的贷款。","Expecting the payment to include property tax, insurance or fees.":"以为月供包含房产税、保险或费用。","This page covers principal and interest only.":"本页只涵盖本金和利息。","Using the remaining balance as a payoff quote.":"把剩余余额当作结清报价。","A lender adds accrued interest and any fees, so ask for an official payoff statement.":"贷款方会加上应计利息和各项费用，所以请索取官方结清证明。","Leaving the elapsed field at its default of 5 when you want the balance at the start of the loan.":"想看贷款开始时的余额，却把已过年数留在默认值 5。","Set it to 0.":"请把它设为 0。","Assuming an extra payment goes to principal.":"以为额外还款一定用于偿还本金。","Some lenders hold it toward the next payment unless you tell them how to apply it, so confirm how your lender handles it.":"有些贷款方会把它留作下一期还款，除非您告知如何处理，所以请确认您的贷款方如何处理。","This form asks for five numbers: loan amount, rate, term, elapsed years and an optional extra payment.":"此表单需要五个数字：贷款金额、利率、期限、已过年数和可选的额外还款。","You do not need a lender name, loan number or any personal detail.":"不需要贷款方名称、贷款编号或任何个人信息。","Can the elapsed time exceed the term?":"已过时间可以超过期限吗？","Yes.":"可以。","The model caps it at the full term and displays a zero remaining balance.":"模型会将其限制在完整期限内，并显示剩余余额为零。","Does the remaining balance include payoff fees?":"剩余余额包含结清费用吗？","No. Ask the lender for an official payoff statement.":"不包含。请向贷款方索取官方结清证明。","Why does principal fall slowly at first?":"为什么本金一开始减少得很慢？","With a positive rate, more of early payments goes to interest because the outstanding balance is larger.":"利率为正时，前期还款中更多用于支付利息，因为未偿余额较大。","Does the remaining balance include the extra payment?":"剩余余额包含额外还款吗？","No. The remaining-balance line follows the scheduled payments only.":"不包含。剩余余额一行只按计划还款计算。","The yearly table shows the balance with the extra payment next to it.":"年度表格会在旁边显示含额外还款的余额。","Why does the interest column shrink every year?":"为什么利息一列每年都在减少？","Interest is charged on the balance still owed.":"利息按仍欠的余额计算。","As the balance falls, the same payment covers less interest and more principal.":"随着余额下降，同样的还款会覆盖更少的利息和更多的本金。","CFPB: mortgage amortization":"CFPB：抵押贷款摊销","({0} payments, no earlier than the schedule)":"（{0} 期，不早于原计划）","({0} payment instead of {1})":"（{0} 期，而不是 {1} 期）","({0} payments instead of {1})":"（{0} 期，而不是 {1} 期）","Year-by-year schedule":"逐年还款计划","Year-by-year schedule with the extra payment":"含额外还款的逐年还款计划","Principal":"本金","Balance":"余额","Balance (with extra)":"余额（含额外还款）","Balance (no extra)":"余额（不含额外还款）","Interest, principal and ending balance for each year of the loan":"贷款每一年的利息、本金和年末余额","Yearly figures add up the monthly payments and are rounded to the dollar. A lender rounds each payment to the cent, so the last payment on a real loan can differ by a few dollars.":"年度数字是各月还款之和，并四舍五入到整美元。贷款方会把每期还款四舍五入到分，因此真实贷款的最后一期可能相差几美元。","The year-by-year schedule and the extra-payment result need a term that is a whole number of months (years x 12). Try a term such as 15, 20 or 7.5 years.":"逐年还款计划和额外还款结果要求期限为整数月（年数 x 12）。请尝试 15、20 或 7.5 年这样的期限。","Total interest over full term:":"整个期限内的总利息：","Remaining balance after elapsed years:":"经过已过年数后的剩余余额：","Paid off after:":"还清时间：","Total interest with the extra payment:":"含额外还款的总利息：","Interest saved:":"节省的利息：","Swipe the table sideways to see every column.":"向左右滑动表格可查看所有列。","Quick summary: Convert using a rate you enter manually.":"快速摘要：使用您手动输入的汇率进行换算。","Multiply an amount by an exchange rate you enter manually.":"将金额乘以您手动输入的汇率。","This tool does not fetch live rates or select currencies.":"此工具不会获取实时汇率，也不提供货币选择。","Type the amount you hold in the source currency, then enter the exchange rate as the number of destination-currency units you get for one unit of the source currency.":"输入您持有的源货币金额，然后输入汇率，即一个单位源货币可兑换的目标货币单位数。","Take the rate from your bank, card issuer, exchange office or another provider you plan to use.":"请从您的银行、发卡机构、兑换处或您打算使用的其他服务商获取汇率。","Select Calculate to see the converted amount.":"点击“计算”查看换算后的金额。","The page has no currency list and no live feed, so it works for any currency pair as long as you enter the right rate and keep track of which currency is which.":"本页没有货币列表，也没有实时数据，因此只要您输入正确的汇率并分清各货币，就适用于任何货币对。","Enter the rate as destination-currency units for one source-currency unit.":"汇率应填写为一个单位源货币对应的目标货币单位数。","Converted amount = source amount x entered rate.":"换算金额 = 源金额 x 输入的汇率。","If the quoted rate is in the reverse direction, use its reciprocal before entering it.":"如果报价汇率的方向相反，请先取其倒数再输入。","If 1 unit of A buys 1.25 units of B, enter amount 200 and rate 1.25: the result is 250 B. If a provider quotes 4 A per 1 B, use 1/4 = 0.25 when converting A to B.":"如果 1 个单位的 A 可兑换 1.25 个单位的 B，输入金额 200 和汇率 1.25：结果为 250 B。如果服务商报价为 4 A 兑 1 B，则在把 A 换成 B 时使用 1/4 = 0.25。","The result is the amount multiplied by the rate and shown with two decimal places, in the destination currency.":"结果是金额乘以汇率，保留两位小数，以目标货币表示。","With the defaults, 100 at a rate of 1.25 gives 125.00.":"按默认值，100 乘以汇率 1.25 得 125.00。","Dividing the result by the amount returns the rate, which is a quick way to check you entered it as intended.":"将结果除以金额即可得到汇率，这是检查您是否按预期输入的快捷方法。","To include fees, use the effective rate instead of the quoted one: the amount you actually receive divided by the amount you sent.":"若要计入费用，请使用实际汇率而不是报价汇率：即您实际收到的金额除以您汇出的金额。","Entering that rate makes this page match the real transaction.":"输入该汇率可使本页结果与实际交易一致。","Two decimals suit most currencies.":"两位小数适用于大多数货币。","For one that normally uses none or three, as with some Asian and Gulf currencies, round the displayed figure as that currency does.":"对于通常不使用小数或使用三位小数的货币（如一些亚洲和海湾货币），请按该货币的惯例对显示数字取整。","For example, 250 at a rate of 149.5 shows 37375.00.":"例如，250 乘以汇率 149.5 显示 37375.00。","Use a rate and date from the provider you intend to use.":"请使用您打算使用的服务商的汇率和日期。","This form does not add commission, conversion spreads, transfer fees or card charges.":"此表单不会加入佣金、换汇点差、转账手续费或银行卡费用。","A displayed amount is arithmetic based on your input, not a promised transaction amount.":"显示的金额只是根据您的输入进行的计算，并非承诺的交易金额。","Entering the rate in the wrong direction.":"把汇率方向输入反了。","If the provider quotes 4 of A per 1 of B and you convert A to B, enter 0.25, not 4.":"如果服务商报价为 4 A 兑 1 B，而您要把 A 换成 B，请输入 0.25，而不是 4。","Using a rate from a different day or from a mid-market source when the provider you will use sells at a different rate.":"使用了不同日期的汇率或中间价来源，而您实际使用的服务商按另一汇率成交。","Typing a percentage change instead of a rate.":"输入了百分比变化，而不是汇率。","Forgetting that fees, commissions and card charges are not part of the calculation.":"忘了费用、佣金和银行卡费用不在计算范围内。","This form asks for an amount and a rate.":"此表单只要求输入金额和汇率。","It does not ask for account details, a card number or a payee.":"它不会要求账户信息、银行卡号或收款人。","Does the calculator update exchange rates?":"计算器会更新汇率吗？","No. Enter the rate yourself.":"不会。请自行输入汇率。","Which direction should the rate use?":"汇率应使用哪个方向？","Destination units per one source unit.":"每一个单位源货币对应的目标货币单位数。","Reverse quotes require the reciprocal.":"反向报价需要取倒数。","Can the entered rate be zero or negative?":"输入的汇率可以为零或负数吗？","No. The conversion requires a positive rate.":"不可以。换算需要正的汇率。","Enter an amount and a positive exchange rate.":"请输入金额和正的汇率。","Quick summary: Estimate a household auto insurance budget using a base monthly premium, number of vehicles, drivers, coverage factor, and discounts.":"快速摘要：根据基础月保费、车辆数、驾驶员数、承保系数和折扣，估算家庭车险预算。","Build an adjustable car-insurance budget from a base premium, vehicle count, driver count, coverage factor and discount.":"根据基础保费、车辆数、驾驶员数、承保系数和折扣，建立可调整的车险预算。","Enter the monthly premium for one vehicle from a real quote as the base, then the number of vehicles and the number of drivers (whole numbers, 1 or more), a coverage factor and an expected discount percentage.":"输入来自真实报价的单辆车月保费作为基础，然后输入车辆数和驾驶员数（整数，至少为 1）、承保系数以及预期折扣百分比。","A coverage factor of 1.00 leaves the base unchanged, and 1.10 adds 10%.":"承保系数为 1.00 时基础金额不变，1.10 则增加 10%。","The discount must be between 0 and 100.":"折扣必须介于 0 和 100 之间。","Select Calculate to see the monthly budget after discount, the annual figure, the amount before discounts and the discount value.":"点击“计算”可查看折扣后的月度预算、年度金额、折扣前金额以及折扣金额。","Change one input at a time to see how much each one moves the total.":"每次只改变一个输入，查看每项对总额的影响有多大。","Before-discount monthly budget = base premium x vehicles x driver adjustment x coverage factor.":"折扣前月度预算 = 基础保费 x 车辆数 x 驾驶员调整系数 x 承保系数。","The existing planning model uses driver adjustment = 1 + 0.12 x (drivers - 1).":"现有的规划模型使用 驾驶员调整系数 = 1 + 0.12 x (驾驶员数 - 1)。","The discount is then subtracted, and annual budget is monthly budget x 12.":"随后扣除折扣，年度预算为月度预算 x 12。","The 12% adjustment is a model assumption, not an insurer rating rule.":"12% 的调整是模型假设，并非保险公司的费率规则。","With a base premium of 150, one vehicle, one driver, coverage factor 1.00 and a 10% discount, the monthly budget is 135 and the annual budget is 1,620.":"基础保费 150、一辆车、一名驾驶员、承保系数 1.00、折扣 10% 时，月度预算为 135，年度预算为 1,620。","At two drivers, the model applies a 1.12 adjustment before the discount.":"有两名驾驶员时，模型在折扣前应用 1.12 的调整系数。","The large figure is the monthly budget after the discount, and the annual line is that amount times 12.":"大号数字是折扣后的月度预算，年度一行是该金额乘以 12。","The before-discount line shows what the budget would be with no discount, so the difference is the discount value.":"折扣前一行显示没有折扣时的预算，因此差额就是折扣金额。","With the defaults (150 base, 1 vehicle, 1 driver, factor 1.00, 10% discount) the page shows $150.00 before discount, a $15.00 discount, $135.00 a month and $1,620.00 a year.":"按默认值（基础 150、1 辆车、1 名驾驶员、系数 1.00、折扣 10%），页面显示折扣前 $150.00、折扣 $15.00、每月 $135.00、全年 $1,620.00。","For 2 vehicles, 2 drivers, factor 1.10 and the same discount, it shows $369.60 before discount, a $36.96 discount, $332.64 a month and $3,991.68 a year.":"2 辆车、2 名驾驶员、系数 1.10 且折扣相同时，显示折扣前 $369.60、折扣 $36.96、每月 $332.64、全年 $3,991.68。","Treat the result as a household planning figure to compare against real quotes, not as a prediction of any insurer's price.":"请把结果当作家庭规划数字，用来与真实报价比较，而不是对任何保险公司价格的预测。","This is not an insurance quote.":"这不是保险报价。","It does not model age, location, accident history, vehicle details, insurer rules or underwriting.":"它不会考虑年龄、位置、事故记录、车辆信息、保险公司规则或核保。","Use a real quote as the base input and compare the result with the policy.":"请以真实报价作为基础输入，并将结果与保单进行比较。","The model does not determine eligibility or coverage.":"该模型不判定资格或承保范围。","Entering an annual or six-month premium in the base field.":"在基础字段中输入了年保费或半年保费。","The base is monthly and per vehicle.":"基础金额按月计算，且是每辆车的金额。","Typing the discount as 0.10 instead of 10.":"把折扣输入为 0.10，而不是 10。","The field expects a percentage.":"该字段需要百分数。","Entering 0 drivers or vehicles.":"输入 0 名驾驶员或 0 辆车。","Both must be whole numbers of at least 1.":"两者都必须是不小于 1 的整数。","Entering the household total as the base and also setting a vehicle count above 1, which counts the vehicles twice.":"把家庭总额作为基础金额，同时又把车辆数设为大于 1，这样会重复计算车辆。","Treating the 12% extra-driver step as an insurer rule.":"把每增加一名驾驶员加 12% 当作保险公司的规则。","It is a fixed assumption in this model.":"这是该模型中的固定假设。","This form needs only a premium amount, counts of vehicles and drivers, a factor and a discount.":"此表单只需要保费金额、车辆数和驾驶员数、一个系数和一个折扣。","It does not ask for a plate number, VIN, license number or driving record.":"它不会要求提供车牌号、VIN、驾照号码或驾驶记录。","Is the extra-driver adjustment an insurer rule?":"额外驾驶员调整是保险公司的规则吗？","No. The fixed 12% adjustment is a disclosed budgeting assumption in this model.":"不是。固定的 12% 调整是该模型中公开说明的预算假设。","Does coverage factor 1.00 mean full coverage?":"承保系数 1.00 是否意味着全额承保？","No. It means no change to the base premium in this arithmetic model.":"不是。在这个算术模型中，它只表示基础保费不变。","Can I enter a discount over 100%?":"可以输入超过 100% 的折扣吗？","No. Discounts must be between zero and 100%.":"不可以。折扣必须在 0 到 100% 之间。","NAIC: understanding auto insurance":"NAIC：了解车险","Quick summary: Estimate an annual homeowners insurance budget from dwelling replacement cost, a planning rate, and deductible discount.":"快速摘要：根据住宅重置成本、规划费率和免赔额折扣，估算全年的房屋保险预算。","Estimate an annual home-insurance budget from a replacement-cost amount and a planning rate you enter.":"根据您输入的重置成本和规划费率，估算全年的房屋保险预算。","Enter the dwelling replacement cost, meaning what it would cost to rebuild the home, not its market or purchase price.":"输入住宅重置成本，即重建房屋所需的费用，而不是市场价格或购买价格。","Then enter a planning rate as a percentage of that cost (type 0.55 for 0.55%), any extra annual endorsements in dollars, and the discount percentage you expect for deductibles or policy discounts.":"然后输入占该成本百分比的规划费率（0.55% 请输入 0.55）、每年额外的批单费用（美元），以及您预期的免赔额或保单折扣百分比。","Select Calculate to see the annual premium after discount, the monthly equivalent, the premium before discounts and the discount value.":"点击“计算”可查看折扣后的年保费、月均金额、折扣前保费以及折扣金额。","Budget before discount = dwelling replacement cost x planning percentage / 100 + annual endorsements.":"折扣前预算 = 住宅重置成本 x 规划百分比 / 100 + 年度批单费用。","Discount = that budget x discount percentage / 100.":"折扣 = 该预算 x 折扣百分比 / 100。","The annual result is the budget minus discount; monthly budget is annual result divided by 12.":"年度结果为预算减去折扣；月度预算为年度结果除以 12。","For a replacement-cost input of 400,000, planning rate 0.55%, annual endorsements 250 and discount 10%, the budget before discount is 2,450.":"若重置成本为 400,000、规划费率 0.55%、年度批单费用 250、折扣 10%，则折扣前预算为 2,450。","The discount is 245, giving 2,205 annually or 183.75 monthly.":"折扣为 245，因此全年为 2,205，每月为 183.75。","The large figure is the estimated annual premium after discount, and the monthly line is that figure divided by 12.":"大号数字是折扣后的预计年保费，月度一行是该数字除以 12。","The before-discount line is the dwelling cost times the rate, plus endorsements.":"折扣前一行为住宅成本乘以费率，再加上批单费用。","With the defaults (400,000 at 0.55%, 250 endorsements, 10% discount) it shows $2,450.00 before discount, a $245.00 discount, $2,205.00 a year and $183.75 a month.":"按默认值（400,000，费率 0.55%，批单费用 250，折扣 10%），显示折扣前 $2,450.00、折扣 $245.00、全年 $2,205.00、每月 $183.75。","The rate has the largest effect.":"费率的影响最大。","Changing only the rate to 0.80% raises the annual figure to $3,105.00 ($258.75 a month).":"仅把费率改为 0.80%，全年金额升至 $3,105.00（每月 $258.75）。","If you have a quote, you can work backward to a planning rate: subtract endorsements from the annual quote, divide by the dwelling cost and multiply by 100.":"如果您有报价，可以倒推出规划费率：从年度报价中减去批单费用，除以住宅成本，再乘以 100。","The planning percentage is entered by the user; it is not a current market quote.":"规划百分比由用户输入，并不是当前的市场报价。","The form does not rate the property using location, construction, catastrophe risk, claims history or insurer rules.":"此表单不会根据位置、建筑、巨灾风险、理赔记录或保险公司的规则对房产评级。","Replacement cost is the rebuilding basis, not automatically the home's purchase price.":"重置成本是重建的依据，并不自动等于房屋的购买价格。","Using the purchase price or land value instead of the rebuilding cost.":"使用购买价格或土地价值，而不是重建成本。","Typing the rate as 0.0055 instead of 0.55.":"把费率输入为 0.0055，而不是 0.55。","Entering monthly endorsement costs in the annual endorsements field.":"把按月计的批单费用填入了年度批单费用字段。","Expecting the discount to apply only to the base premium.":"以为折扣只适用于基础保费。","In this model it applies to the base amount plus endorsements.":"在此模型中，折扣适用于基础金额加批单费用。","Reading the figure as a quote.":"把该数字当作报价。","The planning rate is your own assumption and does not reflect location, claims history or insurer rules.":"规划费率是您自己的假设，并不反映位置、理赔记录或保险公司的规则。","This form needs a rebuilding-cost figure, a planning rate, an endorsement amount and a discount.":"此表单需要重建成本、规划费率、批单金额和折扣。","It does not ask for a property address, policy number or personal details.":"它不会要求提供房产地址、保单号或个人信息。","Does the calculator fetch current premiums?":"计算器会获取当前保费吗？","No. Enter a rate or quote-derived assumption for your own comparison.":"不会。请输入费率，或由报价推算出的假设，用于您自己的比较。","Are monthly and annual results separate premiums?":"月度结果和年度结果是两笔不同的保费吗？","No. The monthly result is one twelfth of the annual budget.":"不是。月度结果是年度预算的十二分之一。","What does the discount apply to?":"折扣适用于什么？","In this model it applies to the combined dwelling-rate budget and annual endorsements.":"在此模型中，折扣适用于住宅费率预算与年度批单费用的合计。","NAIC: homeowners insurance background":"NAIC：房屋保险背景资料","Quick summary: Estimate an auto lease payment from negotiated price, residual value, money factor, term, fees, and sales tax.":"快速摘要：根据协商价格、残值、租赁利率系数、租期、费用和销售税，估算汽车租赁月付款。","Estimate a vehicle lease payment using adjusted capitalized cost, residual value, money factor and term.":"使用调整后的资本化成本、残值、租赁利率系数和租期，估算车辆租赁付款。","Enter the negotiated vehicle price, any down payment or trade credit, and the residual value at the end of the lease, all in dollars.":"输入协商后的车辆价格、任何首付款或以旧换新抵扣额，以及租赁期末的残值，均以美元计。","Then enter the money factor as a decimal (for example 0.0020), the term in whole months, capitalized fees in dollars, and the sales tax percentage applied to the payment.":"然后输入以小数表示的租赁利率系数（例如 0.0020）、以整月计的租期、以美元计的资本化费用，以及适用于付款的销售税百分比。","Select Calculate to see the monthly payment with tax, the base payment before tax, and the depreciation and finance parts of that payment.":"点击“计算”可查看含税月付款、税前基础付款，以及该付款中的折旧和融资部分。","The residual value and money factor usually come from the lease offer, so copy them from the quote.":"残值和租赁利率系数通常来自租赁报价，请从报价中抄录。","Adjusted capitalized cost = negotiated price - down payment or trade credit + financed fees.":"调整后的资本化成本 = 协商价格 - 首付款或以旧换新抵扣额 + 被融资的费用。","Monthly depreciation = (adjusted cost - residual value) / lease months.":"每月折旧 = (调整后成本 - 残值) / 租赁月数。","Monthly finance charge = (adjusted cost + residual value) x money factor.":"每月融资费用 = (调整后成本 + 残值) x 租赁利率系数。","This tool adds depreciation and finance charge, then applies the entered payment tax percentage.":"此工具将折旧和融资费用相加，再应用您输入的付款税率百分比。","Price 40,000, down payment 3,000 and financed fees 1,000 give adjusted cost 38,000.":"价格 40,000、首付款 3,000、被融资费用 1,000，得出调整后成本 38,000。","Residual 24,000 over 36 months gives 388.89 depreciation.":"残值 24,000、租期 36 个月，折旧为 388.89。","A money factor of 0.002 adds 124 finance charge.":"租赁利率系数 0.002 会增加 124 的融资费用。","At 7% payment tax, the estimate is 548.79 monthly.":"付款税率为 7% 时，估算每月 548.79。","The large figure is the monthly payment including the entered tax.":"大号数字是含所输入税费的月付款。","The three lines below it show where the money goes.":"下面的三行显示这笔钱的去向。","With the defaults the base payment is $512.89 a month, made of $388.89 depreciation and $124.00 finance charge, and 7% tax brings the total to $548.79.":"按默认值，基础付款为每月 $512.89，由 $388.89 折旧和 $124.00 融资费用组成，加上 7% 的税后总额为 $548.79。","A higher residual value lowers the payment because less of the cost is depreciated.":"残值越高，付款越低，因为需要折旧的成本更少。","With the residual raised from 24,000 to 26,000 and everything else unchanged, depreciation falls to $333.33, finance rises to $128.00 and the total is $493.63.":"残值从 24,000 提高到 26,000 而其他条件不变时，折旧降至 $333.33，融资费用升至 $128.00，总额为 $493.63。","To compare a money factor with an interest rate, a common rule of thumb multiplies it by 2,400.":"要把租赁利率系数与利率比较，常用的经验法则是将其乘以 2,400。","The default 0.0020 corresponds to roughly 4.8%.":"默认的 0.0020 大致相当于 4.8%。","Tax treatment, upfront charges, mileage limits, wear charges, disposition fees and early termination costs are not modeled.":"未对税务处理、预付费用、里程限制、磨损费用、还车处置费和提前终止成本建模。","Enter a money factor as a decimal; it is not the annual interest percentage.":"请以小数输入租赁利率系数；它不是年利率百分比。","Compare the estimate with the actual lease disclosures.":"请将估算结果与实际的租赁披露文件进行比较。","Entering the money factor as a percentage such as 4.8 or 0.2, instead of the decimal form such as 0.0020.":"把租赁利率系数输入为 4.8 或 0.2 这样的百分数，而不是 0.0020 这样的小数形式。","Entering the term in years.":"把租期按年输入。","The field expects months, as a whole number.":"该字段需要以整数表示的月数。","Typing the residual as a percentage of the sticker price.":"把残值输入为标价的百分比。","The field expects dollars.":"该字段需要美元金额。","Entering a down payment larger than the price plus fees, which triggers the error asking you to check price, down payment and fees.":"输入的首付款大于价格加费用，这会触发要求您检查价格、首付款和费用的错误。","Treating the result as the total due at signing.":"把结果当作签约时应付的总额。","Upfront charges and end-of-lease charges are not part of it.":"预付费用和租赁期末费用不包含在内。","This form needs vehicle price, down payment, residual value, money factor, term, fees and tax rate.":"此表单需要车辆价格、首付款、残值、租赁利率系数、租期、费用和税率。","It does not ask for a VIN, driver information or dealer account details.":"它不会要求提供 VIN、驾驶员信息或经销商账户信息。","Is money factor the same as APR?":"租赁利率系数与年化利率（APR）是一回事吗？","No. This form expects the lease money factor used in the rent-charge formula.":"不是。此表单需要的是租金费用公式中使用的租赁利率系数。","Are capitalized fees paid upfront?":"资本化费用是预先支付的吗？","The fees input represents fees included in the financed lease cost.":"费用输入项表示计入被融资租赁成本的费用。","Other upfront charges are separate.":"其他预付费用另计。","Does the result include end-of-lease charges?":"结果包含租赁期末费用吗？","No. Mileage, wear and disposition charges are outside this monthly-payment estimate.":"不包含。里程、磨损和还车处置费用不在这个月付款估算之内。","Federal Reserve: lease rent-charge calculation":"美联储：租赁租金费用计算","Quick summary: Estimate a pregnancy due date from the first day of the last menstrual period.":"快速摘要：根据末次月经第一天估算预产期。","Estimate a due date by adding 280 calendar days to the first day of the last menstrual period, using a simple 28-day-cycle assumption.":"在末次月经第一天的基础上加 280 个日历日来估算预产期，采用简单的 28 天周期假设。","Use the date field to enter the first day of your last menstrual period, the first day of bleeding and not the last.":"在日期字段中输入您末次月经的第一天，即开始出血的第一天，而不是最后一天。","This is the only input.":"这是唯一的输入项。","Select Calculate to see the estimated due date, the 40-week length the model assumes and the illustrative conception date.":"点击“计算”可查看预产期、模型假设的 40 周时长以及示意性的受孕日期。","If you are unsure of the date, try a few nearby dates to see how much the estimate moves.":"如果不确定日期，可以试几个相近的日期，看看估算结果变动多少。","Each day you shift the date shifts the due date by one day.":"日期每移动一天，预产期也移动一天。","The tool adds 280 days, or 40 weeks, to the entered last-period start date.":"该工具会在您输入的末次月经开始日期上加 280 天，即 40 周。","Its conception-date illustration adds 14 days to that same date.":"其示意性的受孕日期是在同一日期上加 14 天。","The form has no cycle-length, ovulation-date or ultrasound input, so it cannot adjust for those factors.":"此表单没有周期长度、排卵日期或超声检查的输入项，因此无法针对这些因素调整。","A last-period start date of January 1, 2026 gives an estimated due date of October 8, 2026.":"末次月经开始日期为 2026 年 1 月 1 日，估算预产期为 2026 年 10 月 8 日。","The conception-date illustration is January 15.":"示意性的受孕日期为 1 月 15 日。","The 40-week output describes the model's assumed interval, not how far along a pregnancy is today.":"40 周的输出描述的是模型假设的时间间隔，而不是目前怀孕已进行了多久。","The due date is the entered date plus 280 days.":"预产期 = 输入日期 + 280 天。","The conception date is the entered date plus 14 days.":"受孕日期 = 输入日期 + 14 天。","With the default of January 1, 2026 the page shows October 8, 2026 and a conception date of January 15, 2026.":"按默认的 2026 年 1 月 1 日，页面显示 2026 年 10 月 8 日，受孕日期为 2026 年 1 月 15 日。","For March 15, 2026 it shows December 20, 2026 and March 29, 2026.":"对于 2026 年 3 月 15 日，显示 2026 年 12 月 20 日和 2026 年 3 月 29 日。","Most births happen in the weeks around the estimated date rather than exactly on it, so use the result as the center of a window.":"大多数分娩发生在预产期前后几周，而不是恰好在当天，因此请把结果当作一个时间窗口的中心。","If your cycles usually run longer or shorter than 28 days, or an early scan dated the pregnancy differently, the date from your care provider is the one to follow.":"如果您的月经周期通常长于或短于 28 天，或早期超声检查对孕周的判断不同，请以您的医疗服务提供者给出的日期为准。","This is a calendar estimate.":"这是一个按日历推算的估计。","Cycle length and uncertain period dates can affect it.":"周期长度和不确定的月经日期都会影响它。","NHS guidance explains that an antenatal scan can estimate pregnancy timing more accurately.":"英国 NHS 的指南说明，产前超声检查可以更准确地估计孕周。","The conception illustration does not establish the actual day of conception or any legal conclusion.":"受孕示意并不能确定实际受孕日，也不构成任何法律结论。","Entering the date of conception, a positive test or a scan instead of the first day of the last period.":"输入了受孕日期、验孕阳性日期或超声检查日期，而不是末次月经第一天。","Using the last day of the period instead of the first day.":"使用了月经的最后一天，而不是第一天。","Reading 40 weeks as how far along the pregnancy is today.":"把 40 周当作目前怀孕已进行的时间。","It is the fixed interval the model adds to the date.":"它是模型加到日期上的固定间隔。","Mixing up day and month when typing a date.":"输入日期时弄混日和月。","The field uses the year-month-day order, and an impossible date shows an error.":"该字段使用年-月-日的顺序，不可能存在的日期会显示错误。","Treating the conception date as exact.":"把受孕日期当作精确日期。","It is a simple illustration that assumes ovulation on day 14.":"这只是一个简单的示意，假设在第 14 天排卵。","This form asks for one date.":"此表单只要求输入一个日期。","It does not ask for a name, a medical record number or any clinic details.":"它不会要求提供姓名、病历号或任何诊所信息。","Does this tool adjust for a longer or shorter cycle?":"此工具会针对更长或更短的周期进行调整吗？","No. The current form uses the simple 28-day-cycle assumption.":"不会。当前表单采用简单的 28 天周期假设。","Does 40 weeks mean I am currently 40 weeks pregnant?":"40 周是否意味着我现在已怀孕 40 周？","No. It is the interval added to the entered last-period date.":"不是。它是加到您输入的末次月经日期上的间隔。","Can this replace a clinician's due-date assessment?":"这能取代医生对预产期的评估吗？","No. Use the timing established during antenatal care.":"不能。请以产前检查中确定的时间为准。","NHS: estimated due dates and scans":"NHS：预产期估算与超声检查","Quick summary: Estimate annual and monthly retirement withdrawals using a selected portfolio withdrawal rate.":"快速摘要：按所选的投资组合提取率，估算退休后的年度和每月提取金额。","Convert a portfolio amount and an annual withdrawal percentage into a simple annual and monthly cash-flow budget.":"把投资组合金额和年度提取比例转换为简单的年度和每月现金流预算。","Enter the portfolio balance in dollars, the annual withdrawal rate as a percentage (type 4 for 4%), and the tax rate you expect to pay on withdrawals as a percentage.":"输入以美元计的投资组合余额、以百分数表示的年度提取率（4% 请输入 4），以及您预计对提取金额缴纳的税率（百分数）。","Select Calculate to see the yearly withdrawal, the monthly amount, and both figures after the tax assumption.":"点击“计算”可查看年度提取额、每月金额，以及按税率假设计算后的两个数字。","Try several withdrawal rates in turn to see how the yearly and monthly income change for the same balance.":"依次尝试几种提取率，看看同一余额下年度和每月收入如何变化。","Use a single blended tax rate that you have estimated yourself.":"请使用您自己估算的单一综合税率。","Annual gross withdrawal = portfolio x withdrawal percentage / 100.":"年度税前提取额 = 投资组合 x 提取比例 / 100。","Monthly gross is annual gross divided by 12.":"每月税前金额 = 年度税前金额 / 12。","After-tax budget = gross x (1 - tax percentage / 100).":"税后预算 = 税前金额 x (1 - 税率 / 100)。","This is a one-year arithmetic projection; it does not simulate future portfolio returns.":"这是一个一年期的算术推算；它不会模拟未来的投资组合回报。","A portfolio input of 1,000,000 at a 4% withdrawal assumption gives 40,000 gross annually and 3,333.33 monthly.":"投资组合输入 1,000,000、提取率假设 4%，年度税前为 40,000，每月为 3,333.33。","At an entered 15% tax assumption, it gives 34,000 annually after tax and 2,833.33 monthly.":"按输入的 15% 税率假设，税后年度为 34,000，每月为 2,833.33。","The large figure is the gross amount for one year, and the monthly line is that amount divided by 12.":"大号数字是一年的税前金额，每月一行是该金额除以 12。","The two after-tax lines apply your entered tax percentage to the gross amount.":"两条税后数据是把您输入的税率应用到税前金额上得出的。","With the defaults (1,000,000 at 4%, 15% tax) the page shows $40,000.00 a year, $3,333.33 a month, $34,000.00 a year after tax and $2,833.33 a month after tax.":"按默认值（1,000,000，提取率 4%，税率 15%），页面显示每年 $40,000.00、每月 $3,333.33、税后每年 $34,000.00、税后每月 $2,833.33。","For 750,000 at 3.5% with 10% tax, it shows $26,250.00 a year, $2,187.50 a month, $23,625.00 after tax and $1,968.75 a month after tax.":"750,000、提取率 3.5%、税率 10% 时，显示每年 $26,250.00、每月 $2,187.50、税后 $23,625.00、税后每月 $1,968.75。","These are one-year cash-flow figures.":"这些是一年期的现金流数字。","They say nothing about how long the money lasts, because the page has no investment return, inflation or portfolio-depletion model.":"它们无法说明这笔钱能维持多久，因为本页没有投资回报、通胀或投资组合耗尽的模型。","The example 4% is an input illustration, not a recommendation or guarantee of sustainability.":"示例中的 4% 只是输入示意，并非建议，也不保证可持续。","The form does not calculate actual tax brackets, inflation, investment losses, account rules, required distributions or how long the portfolio will last.":"此表单不会计算实际的税率档次、通胀、投资亏损、账户规则、必须提取的最低分配额，也不会计算投资组合能维持多久。","Typing a rate of 0.04 instead of 4.":"把比率输入为 0.04，而不是 4。","Expecting the page to say how long the portfolio will last.":"期望本页告诉您投资组合能维持多久。","It does not model returns or depletion.":"它不会模拟回报或耗尽。","Entering a tax bracket rather than an overall effective rate on the withdrawals.":"输入了税率档次，而不是提取金额的整体有效税率。","Combining pre-tax and Roth balances into one portfolio without adjusting the tax rate.":"把税前账户和 Roth 账户的余额合并成一个投资组合，却没有调整税率。","Assuming next year's withdrawal will be the same.":"假定明年的提取金额会相同。","The page calculates a single year from the balance you enter.":"本页只根据您输入的余额计算一年的结果。","This form needs a balance, a withdrawal rate and a tax rate.":"此表单需要余额、提取率和税率。","It does not ask for account numbers, an employer or a Social Security number.":"它不会要求提供账号、雇主或社会安全号码。","Does this tell me a safe withdrawal rate?":"这能告诉我安全的提取率吗？","No. It calculates cash flow from the rate you supply.":"不能。它只是根据您提供的比率计算现金流。","Is the tax amount my actual liability?":"这个税额就是我实际应缴的税吗？","No. It applies a single percentage assumption and does not calculate a tax return.":"不是。它只应用单一百分比假设，并不计算纳税申报。","Does the result include investment growth?":"结果包含投资增长吗？","No. There is no return or growth simulation in this form.":"不包含。此表单没有回报或增长模拟。","Quick summary: Estimate payoff time and interest using the debt snowball method, which targets the smallest balance first.":"快速摘要：使用债务雪球还款法估算还清时间和利息，该方法优先偿还余额最小的债务。","This page models the debt snowball method for up to three debts.":"本页面为最多三笔债务模拟债务雪球还款法。","Each debt receives its entered minimum payment, and all of the remaining monthly budget goes to the debt with the smallest remaining balance, whatever its interest rate.":"每笔债务先支付您输入的最低还款额，每月剩余的全部预算都用于剩余余额最小的债务，无论其利率高低。","When that debt is paid off, its payment rolls into the next smallest one.":"该笔债务还清后，它的还款额会转入下一笔最小的债务。","Some borrowers prefer this order because accounts close sooner.":"有些借款人偏好这种顺序，因为账户能更早结清。","The page shows the cost of that choice in payoff time and total interest.":"本页面会以还清时间和总利息显示这种选择的成本。","Enter the balance, APR (as a percentage, 24 for 24%) and monthly minimum for each debt, then the extra amount you can pay each month above all minimums.":"为每笔债务输入余额、年利率（以百分数输入，24 表示 24%）和每月最低还款额，再输入您每月可在所有最低还款额之外多付的金额。","Leave unused debt rows at zero balance.":"未使用的债务行请将余额保留为零。","Select Calculate to see the payoff time, total interest, total payments and which debt gets the extra money first.":"点击“计算”即可查看还清时间、总利息、总还款额，以及哪笔债务最先获得额外资金。","Under the result the page also shows a table that runs both orders on your debts, so you do not need to open the avalanche page to compare.":"结果下方还有一张表，会对您的债务同时运行两种顺序，因此无需打开雪崩还款法页面来比较。","Below it, a year-by-year table follows the snowball plan, and a short list gives the month each debt reaches zero.":"再往下是按年展示雪球计划的表格，以及列出每笔债务还清月份的简短清单。","Month by month, the page first adds interest to each debt: balance times APR divided by 1,200.":"逐月计算时，页面先为每笔债务加上利息：余额乘以年利率再除以 1,200。","It then pays every active debt its entered minimum, capped at that debt's balance.":"然后向每笔未结清的债务支付您输入的最低还款额，但不超过该债务的余额。","Whatever is left of the fixed budget goes to the open debt with the smallest balance.":"固定预算中剩余的部分用于余额最小的未结清债务。","When that balance reaches zero the freed money moves to the next smallest, which is the snowball effect.":"当该余额降到零时，释放出的资金会转到下一笔最小的债务，这就是雪球效应。","The fixed budget is the sum of the entered minimums plus the extra amount, and it does not shrink when a debt is cleared.":"固定预算等于所输入的最低还款额之和加上额外金额，某笔债务还清后预算不会减少。","The loop ends when every balance is zero or after 1,200 months.":"当所有余额为零，或满 1,200 个月时，计算结束。","Reading the comparison table":"如何阅读比较表","The table uses one fixed monthly budget for both columns: your minimums plus the extra amount.":"两列使用同一个固定的月度预算：您的最低还款额加上额外金额。","Only the order changes.":"只有顺序不同。","The bottom row names the debts in the order they reach zero, and two names joined by a plus sign mean they finished in the same month.":"最后一行按还清的先后顺序列出债务，用加号连接的两个名称表示它们在同一个月还清。","Look at the gap between the two interest figures before the gap in months.":"先看两个利息数字之间的差距，再看月数的差距。","A difference of a few dollars means the order hardly matters for your balances, and you can pick the one you will actually stick with.":"相差只有几美元，说明顺序对您的余额几乎没有影响，您可以选择自己真正能坚持的那一种。","A difference of hundreds is worth thinking about.":"相差数百美元就值得认真考虑。","The sentence under the table states the gap and how soon each order closes its first account.":"表下方的句子说明两者的差距，以及每种顺序多快结清第一个账户。","The line about the extra payment compares your plan with paying only the entered minimums, where freed minimums still roll to the next debt.":"关于额外还款的那一行，是把您的计划与只支付所输入最低还款额的情形相比较，后者中释放出的最低还款额仍会转入下一笔债务。","It shows what the extra money is worth, not what you would owe if you never rolled payments over.":"它显示的是额外资金的价值，而不是在从不转移还款额的情况下您会欠多少。","Take three debts: 2,000 at 8% APR, 9,000 at 22% and 5,000 at 15%, with minimums of 50, 180 and 100 and an extra 200 a month.":"假设有三笔债务：2,000 年利率 8%，9,000 年利率 22%，5,000 年利率 15%，最低还款额分别为 50、180 和 100，每月额外还 200。","The monthly budget is 530 (the 330 of minimums plus the extra 200).":"每月预算为 530（最低还款额合计 330 加上额外 200）。","In this calculator the snowball order targets the 2,000 debt first and the result is 43 months, $6,435.86 of total interest and $22,435.86 in total payments.":"在本计算器中，雪球顺序优先偿还 2,000 的那笔债务，结果为 43 个月、总利息 $6,435.86、总还款额 $22,435.86。","The debt avalanche calculator on the same numbers gives 40 months and $5,146.08 of interest, because it targets the 22% debt first.":"用同样的数字，债务雪崩还款法计算器得出 40 个月和 $5,146.08 的利息，因为它优先偿还利率 22% 的债务。","Payoff time is the number of months until all three balances reach zero.":"还清时间是三笔余额全部降到零所需的月数。","Total interest adds up the interest charged over those months, and total payments is principal plus that interest.":"总利息是这些月份内收取的利息之和，总还款额则是本金加上这些利息。","The first-targeted-debt line shows the balance and APR of the debt receiving the extra money in month one.":"“首先偿还的债务”一行显示第一个月获得额外资金的那笔债务的余额和年利率。","Snowball ignores APR, so its cost depends on how balances and rates line up.":"雪球还款法不考虑年利率，因此其成本取决于余额与利率如何搭配。","When the smallest balance also has the highest rate, as in the default inputs, snowball and avalanche give the same result (33 months, $3,405.43 interest).":"当最小余额同时也是利率最高的债务时（如默认输入），雪球还款法与雪崩还款法结果相同（33 个月，利息 $3,405.43）。","When the smallest balance has a low rate, as in the example above, snowball takes longer and costs more interest.":"当最小余额的利率较低时（如上面的例子），雪球还款法耗时更长，利息也更多。","The model assumes constant APRs, monthly compounding on the balance and no new charges.":"该模型假设年利率不变、按月对余额计息，且没有新增费用。","Real cards change minimums as balances fall and may add fees or promotional-rate changes, none of which are modeled.":"实际的信用卡会随着余额下降而调整最低还款额，还可能增加费用或改变促销利率，这些都没有纳入模型。","Because the order ignores interest rates, the result can be a more expensive plan than a rate-first order.":"由于这种顺序不考虑利率，结果可能比优先偿还高利率债务的方案成本更高。","Use it to see the size of that gap for your own balances, not to pick a winner.":"请用它来了解这一差距对您自己余额的大小，而不是用来评出胜者。","The yearly table adds up the monthly rows of the simulation and shows the first 10 years.":"年度表汇总了模拟中的各月数据，并显示前 10 年。","If the plan is unpaid after 1,200 months the page says repayment is incomplete, and the payments total then shows only what was simulated.":"如果计划在 1,200 个月后仍未还清，页面会提示还款未完成，此时总还款额只显示已模拟的部分。","Entering your whole monthly budget as the extra amount.":"把整个月度预算都填成额外金额。","The page adds the extra to the minimums, so this overstates what you pay.":"页面会把额外金额加到最低还款额上，所以这样会高估您的还款额。","Leaving a minimum at zero for a debt that still has a balance.":"对仍有余额的债务把最低还款额留为零。","That debt then receives money only when it is the priority debt, and the monthly budget is smaller by the missing minimum.":"这样该债务只有在成为优先债务时才会收到款项，而且月度预算会因缺少这笔最低还款额而变小。","Typing the APR as a monthly rate.":"把年利率当成月利率输入。","Enter the yearly percentage shown on the statement.":"请输入账单上显示的年度百分比。","Listing more than three debts.":"列出三笔以上的债务。","Combine small ones or run the page twice.":"可以合并较小的债务，或分两次运行本页面。","Using a balance that includes a payment you have already made this month.":"使用的余额里包含了您本月已经支付的款项。","This form needs balances, APRs and minimum payments, not creditor names, account numbers or statements.":"此表单只需要余额、年利率和最低还款额，不需要债权人名称、账号或账单。","Which debt does the snowball method pay first?":"债务雪球还款法最先偿还哪笔债务？","The one with the smallest remaining balance, regardless of its APR.":"剩余余额最小的那笔，无论其年利率是多少。","The first-targeted-debt line on the result shows which debt that is.":"结果中的“首先偿还的债务”一行会显示是哪一笔。","Why can snowball cost more interest than avalanche?":"为什么雪球还款法的利息可能比雪崩还款法更多？","Snowball does not look at interest rates.":"雪球还款法不考虑利率。","If a small debt has a low APR, extra money goes there while a costlier balance keeps growing.":"如果一笔小额债务的年利率很低，额外资金就会用在它身上，而成本更高的余额却继续增长。","In the example above the difference is $1,289.78 and 3 months.":"在上面的例子中，差距是 $1,289.78 和 3 个月。","Do I enter my total budget or only the extra amount?":"我应该输入总预算还是只输入额外金额？","Only the extra amount above your minimums.":"只输入高于最低还款额的额外金额。","The page adds the extra to the entered minimums to get the monthly budget.":"页面会把额外金额加到所输入的最低还款额上，得到每月预算。","What if the budget does not repay the debts?":"如果预算不足以还清债务怎么办？","The simulation stops at 1,200 months and reports that repayment is incomplete.":"模拟会在 1,200 个月时停止，并提示还款未完成。","Why does the page show both methods?":"为什么页面同时显示两种方法？","Because the useful question is how much the order matters for your own balances.":"因为真正有用的问题是顺序对您自己的余额有多大影响。","The table runs both orders on the same debts and budget, so the difference comes from the order alone.":"该表对相同的债务和预算运行两种顺序，因此差异只来自顺序本身。","Is the year-by-year table my statement?":"按年表格就是我的账单吗？","No. It is a simulation from the balances, rates and minimums you typed.":"不是。它是根据您输入的余额、利率和最低还款额做出的模拟。","Lenders round to the cent, change minimums as balances fall and may add fees, so real statements will differ a little.":"贷款机构会四舍五入到分，会随着余额下降调整最低还款额，还可能收取费用，因此实际账单会略有差异。","Source and background reading":"资料来源与延伸阅读","CFPB: debt-reduction methods":"CFPB：减债方法","33 months (2 years 9 months)":"33 个月（2 年 9 个月）","Debt 1 → Debt 2 → Debt 3":"债务 1 → 债务 2 → 债务 3","Compared with paying only the entered minimums in snowball order (50 months, $6,199.08 interest), the extra $250.00 a month (freed minimums still roll over in both runs) saves $2,793.65 of interest and 17 months.":"与按雪球还款法顺序只支付所输入的最低还款额相比（50 个月，利息 $6,199.08），每月额外还 $250.00（两种情形中释放出的最低还款额都会转入下一笔债务）可节省 $2,793.65 的利息和 17 个月。","Snowball plan, year by year":"雪球还款法计划，按年明细","Snowball plan year by year":"雪球还款法计划按年明细","3 (months 25-33)":"3（第 25-33 个月）","Debt 1 is paid off in month 10.":"债务 1 在第 10 个月还清。","Debt 2 is paid off in month 23 (1 year 11 months).":"债务 2 在第 23 个月还清（1 年 11 个月）。","Debt 3 is paid off in month 33 (2 years 9 months).":"债务 3 在第 33 个月还清（2 年 9 个月）。"};
